<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">KULAWA - Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Kul</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kulawa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Kulawa</para>
  <para style="mt2">CHITABU CHA</para>
  <para style="mt1">KULAWA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Kulawa chajendeleza ntamulizi ya mbuli zijnkile ikongele mwe chitabu cha Nkongo ikulanga mbuli za lukolo lwa Bulahamu. Ulosi Exodus utapitwa uge Kulawa manakwe ni kufifinya mwe nyivi na kufosa kuse, watambalisa ntendwa ya wantu wa Izulaeli cha kuchupuluka kulawa mo utumwa wa Misili na kuya kwe isi idya Chohile agambaga namwinke Abulahamu. Kulinana na mazwela, watakuwandika wazumila kugamba hantu hakulu mwe chitabu chino hawandikwa ni muwoni Musa, na imbuli ino yalagiswa mwe ichitabu chenye. Nkongo 24:4 yatambalisa ivyo Musa awandike hantu hasiku mwe chibu chino. Kafungu mwe chitabu cha Yoshuwa 8:31 chataja lagizo imwechitabu cha Kulawa 20:25, na kugamba, “Saviya viwandikwe mwe chitabu che Itolati ya Musa.” Vitabu vya Lagano Hya vyataja nkanana siku na kuvuzagiza mwe vitabu viwandikwe ni Musa, kwa mliganyo Lagano hya dikatambalisa mbuli za kisaka kakile moto hehena kutikimya, dyatambalisa kugamba mbuli ino yawandikagwa mndani mwe “Chitabu cha Musa.” Mako 12:26. Vyawoneka kugamba mbuli ya Wana wa Izulaeli kulawa kwe isi ya Misili ilaila hagatigati he mihilimo ya 1,300 hegu 1,400 Kulisito henati Kwelekwa. Mwe chitabu cha 1 cha Maseuta 6:1 itajwa kugamba mbuli ya kulawa yadamanyikaga yabula mihilimo 480 hewina mhilimo wa 4 wo ulongozi wa seuta Sulemani ywa Izulaeli. Chitabu cha Kulawa chalagisa kuhikiliza ivyo Chohile atendaga chani kuchintiza ukanuni wakwe mwe viya alongaga kwa Abulahamu, Isaka na Yakobo. Chitabu chino chatamwila kulanga mbuli nkulu ya wambul awa Chohile kwa wana wa Abulahamu awo nawo awantu wa Izulaeli, umo wakalawa kwe isi ya Misili, Kulawa 1-12. Kulawa uko Chohile awalongozaga wantu wakwe kubula mabwandasi yendile hasi ho lugulu lwa Sinai hantu hadya Chohile amwinkaga Musa sigilizi zilozize chani Waizulaeli wazitimile, Kulawa 12-19. Sigilizi izo zatambalisa ivyo nawakaungwa watende, ivyo nawakungwa walavye ntambiko, malavyo na malagizo yatendese mwe ivyo Idihema dyo kuduganila, hantu aho naho nahatende wikazi wa Chohile mgati mwawo, iviya shanduku dye Idilagano na vimpandwa vituhu kwachausa cho mviko mndani mwe Idihema ldyo mviko, na suche zesimile kwachausa cha walavyantambiko, Kulawa 20-31. Vikaheza vize vilaile kuhitukila kwihise kwa wana wa Izulaeli weze wadamanye tukulu dya ng'ombe ya zahabu, Musa niyo adugana vituhu na Chohile, Kulawa 32-33. Mwe ntendele zo udumo ze chitabu chino, chasoma vimpandwa vitajigwe mwe nkongo ivyo vidamanywe, Kulawa 33-40).</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya 1 yatambalisa ivyo wana wa Izulaeli wajeligwe mwe utumwa kwe isi ya Misili.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula za 2-4 zamtambalisa Musa na kutamwila wikazi wakwe kulawa ache mwana kubula hadya etangwe awakombole wantu wa Chohile.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Vikaheza mta kuwandika atamwila ivyo Kisha mwandishi anasimulia jinsi Chohile adamanye maula na kuitowa isi ya Misili kwa nkomano nkulu kwa mwalo wa kuwakombola wantu wakwe kulawa mwe idya isi, na iviya kulawa mwe kutiswa ni wagomba nkondo wa Falao, sula 5-15:21.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Kulawa aaho wantu wa Izulaeli watamba na kubula hantu ho lugulu lwa Sinai, sula 15:22-19.</para>
  <para style="io">5. Mwe sula ya 20-31 chasoma ivyo Chohile amwinkile Musa Tolati, sigilizi yendile ikaonyekeza ivyo wantu wa Chohile, Waizulaeli, nawakaungwa wekale na kuvika.</para>
  <para style="io">6. Mwe sula ya 32 iwandikwa ivyo wana wa Izulaeli wamhituke Chohile hadya wamluvize mlukolo ywa Musa akwitangwa Haluni awadamanyize tukulu dyumbigwe uge ng'ombe ya zahabu.</para>
  <para style="io">7. Sula 33-40 zatamablisa ivyo Musa awone ung'azi wa Chohile, na kuwahinya Waizulaeli sigilizi za Chohile, hamwenga na kuwaonyekeza ukuzenga idihema dyo kuduganila, shanduku dye Idilagano na vimpandwa vituhu vyo mviko mwe idihema dyo kuduganila, na mbuli zikungigwa yakulanga suche zesimile za walavyantambiko.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EXO 1" />
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli wakundugizwa kwe isi ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 1:1" />Wana wa Yakobo waitanye Misili chila yumwenga na wakazi zawo na wana wawo wendaga, <verse eid="EXO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 1:2" />Lubeni na Simeoni na Lawi na Yuda, <verse eid="EXO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 1:3" />na Isakali na Zabuloni na Benyamini, <verse eid="EXO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 1:4" />na Dani na Nafutali na Gadi na Asheli. <verse eid="EXO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 1:5" />Wantu wose walawane nolweleko lwa Yakobo nani milongo mfungate. Mazuwa ayo Yusufu alongolaga kale kwikala kwe isi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 1:6" />Mihilimo ilozize ize yomboke, Yusufu niyo abanika na walukolo wakwe wose na wantu wose we cheleko icho wabanikaga, <verse eid="EXO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 1:7" />na welekwa wa Izulaeli weze wajenyela vitendese, watenda walozese wajendeleza kutenda na nguvu, chila hantu mwe isi ya Misili wamema wowo.<verse eid="EXO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 1:8" />Mihilimo ilozize ize yomboke, niyo alaila Falao mtuhu hemanyize mbuli adamanye Yusufu, alongoza isi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 1:9" />Niyo awagamba wantu wakwe, “Kaulisani, Waizulaeli walozesa naho wana nguvu kujinka suwe. <verse eid="EXO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 1:10" />Elo, chizunguleni sila ikunga iwatende Waizulaeli wasekujenyela, naho kunalaila nkondo wowo wanase kulungana na wankondo wetu kutowana na suwe na kuchilavya mwe isi ino.” <verse eid="EXO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 1:11" />Ivyo, Wamisili niyo wawaika wachimaila wawasulumize kwa ndima ndala. Waizulaeli wadamanya ndima ya kumzengela Falao seuta ywa Misili mizi ya Pitomu na Lamesesi yakwikiya mpamba. <verse eid="EXO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 1:12" />Mna iviya Wamisili wakuwasulumiza Waizulaeli, nivyo wongezekela na kujenyela mwe isi. Wamisili niyo wakonga kuwogoha Waizulaeli. <verse eid="EXO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 1:13" />Wamisili niyo wawakunduganya Waizulaeli kwa ukali kudamanya ndima ndala. <verse eid="EXO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 1:14" />Wikazi wawo utendwa mdala kwa ndima ndala, ndima ya kudamanya chokaa na matofali na ndima zose za mwezinkonde zawo, ndima zose wakunduganywa kwa kuwafankila.<verse eid="EXO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 1:15" />Niyo Falao awagamba wakunga waidi wakuwambiza Waebulaniya kwefungula, yumwenga zina dyakwe ni Shifula na mtuhu ni Puwa, <verse eid="EXO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 1:16" />awagamba, “Umo mkamwambiza mvyele ywa Chiebulaniya kwefungula, uneva kefungula kazana kachilume kakomeni, mna uneva ni kachiche kalekeni.” <verse eid="EXO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 1:17" />Mna wadya wakunga wendaga wakamtunya Chohile ivyo hawadamanye saviya Falao awalagize, mna waleka kuwakoma wana chilume. <verse eid="EXO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 1:18" />Ivyo Falao niyo awetanga wakunga awo nakuwauza, “Ni mbwani mkudamanya vino? Ni mbwani hamkuwakoma wana chilume?”<verse eid="EXO 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 1:19" />Wakunga awo wamhitula Falao, “Wavyele wa Wachiebulaniya hawekale saviya wavyele wa Chimisili. Niwakankalu, wefungula vihufu vidala, hunati kubula kefungula kale.” <verse eid="EXO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 1:20" />Elo Chohile niyo awenka yedi wadya wakunga, Waizulaeli niyo wajenyelesa na kutendesa na nguvu.<verse eid="EXO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 1:21" />Kwaviya wadya wakunga nawakamtunya Chohile, niyo awenka yedi kawadahiza watende na nkolo zawo wenye. <verse eid="EXO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 1:22" />Niyo Falao awalagiza wantu wakwe wose, agamba, “Chila mwana chilume ywa Chiebulaniya nelekwe mduleni komto wa Naili, mna mwana chiche mlekeni.”<verse eid="EXO 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EXO 2" />
  <para style="s">Kwelekwa kwa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 2:1" />Kwendagaga na mntu yumwenga endaga ywa lukolo lwa Lawi asolaga mvyele Mlawi mnyawe. <verse eid="EXO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 2:2" />Yudya mvyele niyo atenda msoka efungula mwana chilume. Eze awone kugamba mwana uyo ni mtana niyo amfisa kwa myezi mitatu. <verse eid="EXO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 2:3" />Mna eze adunduge kumfisa, aguha ntangulu ilukigwe na makumbi niyo aisita na nyambu na lami isekujisa mazi. Niyo amjela yudya mwana, niyo aika hemanywenywe hankanda homto wa Naili. <verse eid="EXO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 2:4" />Lumbudye dya yudya mwana nakefisa hankanda hadodo chani akaule chikunga chilaile kwa yudya mwana.<verse eid="EXO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 2:5" />Elo, mndele mwana ywa Falao kaita kwekuhaka ko mto, wandima wakwe wa chivyele nawakajenda jenda mkanda mwo mto. Aho mwana ywa Falao awona idya intangulu mwa manywenywe niyo amsigila mndima ywakwe akaiguhe. <verse eid="EXO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 2:6" />Uyo mwana Falao eze avugule intangulu aho abunkula mna mwana chilume. Nakaila niyo amfila mbazi. Agamba, “Yuno ni mwana ywa Chiebulaniya.”<verse eid="EXO 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 2:7" />Aho lumbudye dya yudya mwana niyo elagisa mwenye amuza, “Nite hetange mvyele ywa Chiebulaniya akunga amonkeze yuno mwana?”<verse eid="EXO 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 2:8" />Yudya mndele ywa Falao amhitula, “Heye, hita ukamwitange.” Ivyo yudya mndele aita akumwitanga mamiyakwe dya yudya mwana. <verse eid="EXO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 2:9" />Mndele mwana ywa Falao amgamba yudya mvyele, “Guha yuno mwana ukamonkeze, nahulihe.” Ivyo amguha yudya mwana amonkeza. <verse eid="EXO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 2:10" />Eze amlekeze ukonka niyo amwigala kwa mndele mwana ywa Falao, kamtenda mwanawe. Agamba, “Simlavya mwa mazi, ivyo namwitanga Musa.”<verse eid="EXO 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa asumkila Midiyani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 2:11" />Umo Musa eze akule, aitaga kuwatalamkila Waebulaniya weyawe, niyo awona viya nawakadamanya ndima ndala. Niyo amwona Mmisili amtowa Mwebulaniya mnyawe dya Musa. <verse eid="EXO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 2:12" />Musa kasinya kuno na kuno, eze awone hahana mntu haguhi niyo amkoma yudya Mmisili niyo amfinankila momsanga. <verse eid="EXO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 2:13" />Zuwa ditimile auya niyo awona Waebulaniya waidi wakatowana. Amuza yudya abalange, “Ni mbwani ukumtowa Mwebulaniya mnyawo?”<verse eid="EXO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 2:14" />Yudya mntu amhitula, “Ni yuhi akutendile chilongozi na mlamuzi ywetu? Wonga unikome saviya umkomile yudya Mmisili?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 2:14">Niyo Musa engila woga nakufanyanya, “Wantu wanibunkula chiya nidamanye!” <verse eid="EXO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 2:15" />Umo Falao eze eve mbuli iyo, niyo onga amkome Musa. Mna Musa niyo amnyilika aita akwikala kwesi ikwitangwa Midiyani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 2:15">Zuwa dimwenga Musa nakekala haguhi na sima. <verse eid="EXO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 2:16" />Elo, Jetilo mlavyantambiko ywa Midiyani endaga na wana chiche mfungate, waita kwedisima wakateke mazi, wamemeza mwa mahondo, chani wanywese izimbuzi ne zingoto za tati yawo. <verse eid="EXO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 2:17" />Mna wadimi wamwenga weza nakuwabalaza wana wa Jetilo. Mna Musa niyo awambiza nakudinywesa idifyo dyawo. <verse eid="EXO 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 2:18" />Weze wauye kwa Jetilo tati yawo, zina dyakwe tuhu nuyo Lueli, awauza, “Ni mbwani dyelo msunguza kuya?”<verse eid="EXO 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 2:19" />Wamhitula, “Mmisili yumwenga kachihonya na wadimi, naho kachitekela mazi nakunywesa idifyo dyetu.”<verse eid="EXO 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 2:20" />Tati yawo awauza wanawe, “Uyo mntu, ekuhi? Ni mbwani mmwasa uko? Jendani mkamwitange eze adye.”<verse eid="EXO 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 2:21" />Ivyo Musa niyo azumila kwikala kwa yudya mntu, yudya mntu niyo amwinka mwanawe akwitangwa Zipola atende mkaziwe. <verse eid="EXO 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 2:22" />Zipola niyo amwelekele Musa mwana chigosi. Musa agamba, “Miye ni mjeni mwe isi ino, ivyo namwitanga Geshomu.”<verse eid="EXO 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 2:23" />Mihilimo ilozize itimile seuta ywa Misili abanikaga, mna Waizulaeli nawachei wakajugumila kulawana no utumwa. Niyo waila, ndilo yawo yabulaga kulanga kwa Chohile. <verse eid="EXO 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 2:24" />Chohile niyo eva ukujugumila kwawo nakukumbuka lagano aikiye na Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="EXO 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 2:25" />Chohile kawona utumwa wa Waizulaeli niyo awafila mbazi.<verse eid="EXO 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EXO 3" />
  <para style="s">Chohile amwitanga Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 3:1" />Zuwa dimwenga umo Musa endaga akadima ngoto za mkwewe uyo Jetilo, mlavyantambiko ywa Midiyani. Musa alongozaga idifyo kujinka idijangwa nakubula Holebu, ivya lwetangwa Sinai aho nkongo naluketangwa Sinai, lugulu lwa Chohile. <verse eid="EXO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 3:2" />Uko mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe kamlaila saviya mwale wa moto mgati mwe kasaka. Musa kawona kugamba akasaka kakwela moto mna hakakuhya. <verse eid="EXO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 3:3" />Musa afanyanya, “Ino ni njeni! Ni mbwani akasaka hakakuhya? Nanikasogeile hakaule.”<verse eid="EXO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 3:4" />Zumbe eze awone kugamba Musa asogela haguhi, niyo amwitanga kulaila mgati mwa kasaka akagamba, “Musa! Musa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 3:4">Musa ahitula, “Yee, miye ni hano.”<verse eid="EXO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 3:5" />Chohile amgamba, “Usekusogelesa. Vula ivilatu vyako, kwaviya kuchimala hantu hakukile. <verse eid="EXO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 3:6" />Miye ni Chohile ywa wakale wako, Chohile ywa Ibulahimu na Chohile ywa Isaka na Yakobo.” Ivyo Musa agubika uso wakwe, kwaviya nakogoha kumsinya Chohile.<verse eid="EXO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 3:7" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba, “Siviwona viya wantu wangu wakudamanywa vihiye uko Misili, siweva wakaila wahonywe mwe wadya wakuwatenda watumwa. Siyamanya masulumizo yawo, <verse eid="EXO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 3:8" />ivyo sisela niwakombole mwa Wamisili nakuwalavya mwe Misili kuwegala mwe isi yakudimila na kulima. Ina ugoli naho ina sanga ntana, umo Wakanani na Wahiti na Waamoli na Wapelizi na Wahivi na Wayebusi wakwikala. <verse eid="EXO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 3:9" />Ichendedi nguto za wantu wangu siziva, naho siviwona viya Wamisili wakuwasulumiza. <verse eid="EXO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 3:10" />Haluse nakusigila kwa Falao seuta ywa Misili chani ukawalavye wantu wangu, awo wana Waizulaeli wafose mwe isi ya Misili.”<verse eid="EXO 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 3:11" />Mna Musa amgamba Chohile, “Miye ni yuhi, navidahike vivihi kwita kwa Falao hawalavye Waizulaeli mwe isi ya Misili?”<verse eid="EXO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 3:12" />Chohile amhitula, “Usa nkama nanitende hamwenga na weye, nachilagiso kugamba sikusigila ni chino, umo unatenda kuwalavya kale awantu mwe isi ya Misili, namnivikile mwo lugulu luno.”<verse eid="EXO 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 3:13" />Mna Musa amhitula Chohile, “Umo haita kwa Wazilaeli nakuwagamba, ‘Chohile ywa wakale wenyu kanisigila kwenyu,’ nawanuze, ‘Zina dyakwe nuyo yuhi?’ Ivyo naniwagambe mbwani?”<verse eid="EXO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 3:14" />Chohile amgamba, “Miye nuyo Miye. Vino nivyo ukunga uwagambile wantu wa Izulaeli, ‘Uyo akwitangwa MIYE kanisigila kwenyu.’” <verse eid="EXO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 3:15" />Naho Chohile niyo amgamba Musa, “Wagambile wana wa Izulaeli kugamba ‘Miye Zumbe, Chohile ywa wakale wenyu, Chohile ywa Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo, kanisigila kwenyu.’ Dino nidyo idizina dyangu mazuwa yose, vyeleko vikwiza nivyo vikunga vinitange. <verse eid="EXO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 3:16" />Hita kawachisanye vilongozi wa Izulaeli hamwenga uwagambile kugamba, ‘Miye Zumbe, Chohile ywa wadalahala wawo, Chohile ywa Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo, kanilaila. Wagambile kugamba siwabasa naho siviwona viya mkudamanywa mwe isi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 3:17" />Naika lagano kugamba naniwalavye mwamasulumizo yenyu uko Misili na kuwegala mwe isi ya Wakanani na Wahiti na Waamoli na Wahivi na Wapelezi na Wayebusi. Isi yedi kwakudimila na kulima.’”<verse eid="EXO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 3:18" />“Awo wadalahala nawakwetegeleze viya ukunga uwagambile, wenawe nawite nawo kwa Falao mumgambe, ‘Zumbe, Chohile ywa Waebulaniya, kelagisa kwetu. Haluse chilekele chitambe kwa mazuwa matatu mwe dijangwa chikamvikile Zumbe, Chohile ywetu.’ <verse eid="EXO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 3:19" />Sivimanya kugamba Falao hawalekeleni mwite vihufu uneva hanakunkuswe kwa mkono una nguvu. <verse eid="EXO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 3:20" />Nanijeseze nguvu zangu nakuitowa isi ya Misili kwa chisimo hunga nidamanye uko. Vikaheza nawalekeleni mwite.”<verse eid="EXO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 3:21" />“Naho naniwatende Waizulaeli chani wazumilwe kulongozi kwa Wamisili, chani umo wantu wangu wakahalawa, wasekuhalawa mikono bule. <verse eid="EXO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 3:22" />Chila mvyele ywa Izulaeli nalombeze kwa mhajihi ywakwe ywa Chimisili na kwa mvyele yoyose ywa Chimisili akwikala mwe kaya yakwe naunge viya vya hela na viya vya zahabu na suche nanywi namwavise wanenyu wachilume na wachiche. Mwe chipindi icho nivyo namuwahoke Wamisli ugoli wawo.”<verse eid="EXO 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EXO 4" />
  <para style="s">Chohile amwinka Musa udahi wa kudamanya vilagiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 4:1" />Musa niyo amhitula Zumbe, “Nanitende vivihi uneva wantu hawanitegeleze na kuzumila yadya hulonga? Naho wanigamba hwelavyanye kwangu?”<verse eid="EXO 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 4:2" />Ivyo Zumbe amuza, “Kutoza mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 4:2">Musa ahitula, “Nkome ya kujendela.”<verse eid="EXO 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 4:3" />Zumbe agamba, “Idule hasi.” Musa eze aidule hasi, ihitukila nyoka, niyo ainyilika. <verse eid="EXO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 4:4" />Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Funama iguhe kwa komchila.” Ivyo Musa afunama nakuigwila niyo yahitukila nkome ya kujendela naho. <verse eid="EXO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 4:5" />Zumbe agamba, “Damanya vino kulagisa kwa Waizulaeli kugamba Zumbe Chohile ywa wakale wawo, Chohile ywa Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo, kakulaila.”<verse eid="EXO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 4:6" />Zumbe amgambila naho Musa, “Jela umkono wako mwe nkazu hechifuwa.” Musa niyo aujela umkono wakwe mwe nkazu hechifuwa, eze alavye umkono wakwe nawingila unyonje, uvavagala matana yang'aile chwee. <verse eid="EXO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 4:7" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba, “Jela naho umkono wako mwe nkazu hechifuwa.” Adamanya ivyo, ntambo ino eze aulavye, nanimjima, saviya umwili wakwe wendile nkongo. <verse eid="EXO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 4:8" />Zumbe agamba, “Uneva hawanakuzumile hegu kuligana ne chilagiso cha nkongo, chino nawaligane nacho. <verse eid="EXO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 4:9" />Uneva vilagiso vyose vidi wachei hawakuzumile naho, walemela kukwiva chiya ukulonga, teka mazi mwo mto Naili uyetile hasi. Amazi nayahitukile sakame.”<verse eid="EXO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 4:10" />Musa amgamba Zumbe usekunisigila miye, “Weye Zumbe, miye suyo mlongi kulaila kale naho kulaila aho ulongile na mndima ywako. Kwaviya miye suyo mhofu ywa kulonga, naho lulimi lwangu luzama.”<verse eid="EXO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 4:11" />Zumbe amgamba, “Mlomo wa mntu udamanywa ni yuhi? Hegu ni yuhi akumtenda mntu chimumu? Hegu ni yuhi akumtenda awone hegu kumtenda tuntu? Suyo miye, Zumbe? <verse eid="EXO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 4:12" />Haluse, hita! Nahudahize ivyo vyo kulonga, naho nahuhinye chokulonga.”<verse eid="EXO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 4:13" />Mna Musa ahitula, “Zumbe, bule, sigila mntu mtuhu.”<verse eid="EXO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 4:14" />Vize vibule aho, Zumbe amwihiwa Musa nakumgamba, “Togola! Ni vivihi! Mlukolo ywako Haluni ywa kabila dya Lawi? Sivimanya kugamba adaha kulonga vyedi. Ukajinka ayo kaula eza kukuhokela aho nakuwonele nelelwe mo moyo wakwe. <verse eid="EXO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 4:15" />Wenawe nolosane naye nakumgambila yose akunga alonge. Naniwadahize ukulonga woseni waidi, naho naniwagambileni woseni waidi chokudamanya. <verse eid="EXO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 4:16" />Natende mlongi ywako nakutamwila mwa wantu. Weye nawikale saviya Chohile kwakwe, ukamgambila chokulonga. <verse eid="EXO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 4:17" />Guha inkome ino, ukaijeseze kudamanyiza mpituko.”<verse eid="EXO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa auya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 4:18" />Musa niyo auya kwa uyo Jetilo mkwewe nakumgamba, “Hampu nilekela nuye kwa walukolo wangu uko Misili hakaule hegu wachei wajima.” Jetilo alagana naye nakumgamba ajende mpeho.<verse eid="EXO 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 4:19" />Umo Musa achei Midiyani, Zumbe amgamba, “Uya Misili, kwaviya wadya wose nawakaunga wakukome wabanika.” <verse eid="EXO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 4:20" />Ivyo Musa amguha mkaziwe na wanawe, awakweza mwe mpunda nakuhalawa nawo kubula Misili, akatenda nenkome mo mkono.<verse eid="EXO 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 4:21" />Zumbe naho amgamba Musa, “Umo ukabula Misili, kombaganya kugamba wadamanya vilagiso vyose viya hwinkile udahi wa kuvidamanya mwa meso ya Falao. Mna nanimtende mdala ywa kwiva, naho hawalekele wantu waite. <verse eid="EXO 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 4:22" />Kamgambe Falao kugamba Miye Zumbe, nagamba, ‘Izulaeli ni mwanangu mwelekwa ywangu ywa nkongo ywa chilume. <verse eid="EXO 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 4:23" />Nakugambilaga umlekele mwanangu aite, chani anisankanile, mna kuvilemela. Haluse nanimkome mwanawo ywa nkongo ywa chilume.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 4:24" />Umo achei mwe sila kuya Misili hantu wagonaga, Musa niyo adugana na Zumbe, Zumbe kamtisa kumkoma Musa kwaviya hamjeile ngasu mwanawe. <verse eid="EXO 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 4:25" />Mna Zipola niyo asunguza kuguluka aguha yuwe dikutwa, akanta idizoba dya mwanawe niyo amkufya nadyo Musa mweviga akagamba, “Kwesakame ino kutenda mgosi wangu chindedi.” <verse eid="EXO 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 4:26" />Kwachausa cha ngasu ya kuvinilwa alongaga kwa Musa. Ivyo Zumbe hamkomile Musa.<verse eid="EXO 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 4:27" />Zumbe amgamba Haluni, “Hita kwedijangwa ukadugane na Musa.” Niyo aita akumbwila he lugulu lwa Chohile, eze adugana naye, amlamsa kwa kumkubatila. <verse eid="EXO 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 4:28" />Niyo Musa amgambila Haluni chila chintu alongaga Zumbe umo amgambilaga auye Misili, niyo amgambila mpituko Zumbe amgambaga adamanye. <verse eid="EXO 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 4:29" />Ivyo, Musa na Haluni waita Misili niyo wawaduganya hamwenga wadalahala wose wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="EXO 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 4:30" />Aho, Haluni awagambila chila chintu Zumbe amlagize Musa, niyo Musa adamanya mpituko kulongozi kwa wantu wose. <verse eid="EXO 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 4:31" />Wantu niyo wazumila, weze weve kugamba Zumbe keza kuwambiza Waizueli naho kayawona amasulumizo yawo, wose niyo wenamiza imitwi yawo wamvikila Zumbe.<verse eid="EXO 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EXO 5" />
  <para style="s">Falao awongeza ndima ndala Waizulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 5:1" />Elo, Musa na Haluni niyo waita kwa Falao nakugamba, “Zumbe, Chohile ywa Izulaeli, agamba, ‘Walekele wantu wangu waite, chani wakanidamanyize ngasu yakunitunya kwedijangwa.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 5:2" />Falao auza, “Zumbe ni yuhi nimwetegeleze? Naho kwambwani niwalekeila Waizulaeli waite? Simmanyize uyo Zumbe, naho saniwalekeile Waizulaeli waite.”<verse eid="EXO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 5:3" />Musa na Haluni wahitula, “Chohile ywa Waebulaniya kelagisa kwetu. Kachunga chitambe kwa mazuwa matatu mwe dijangwa chikamlavize ntambiko Zumbe Chohile ywetu. Hachinavidamanye ivyo, nachikome kwa unyonje hegu nkondo.”<verse eid="EXO 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 5:4" />Falao awagamba Musa na Haluni, “Nimbwani mkuwatenda wantu waleke ndima zawo? Wagambeni wauye kwezindima zawo! <verse eid="EXO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 5:5" />Ukajika Falao awagamba, wantu wenyu waloza kujinka Wamisili. Haluse mwonga wasekudamanya ndima!”<verse eid="EXO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 5:6" />Mwe idizuwa idiya Falao kawagamba wachimaila wa watumwa wa Chimisili na wachimaila wa Chiizulaeli. <verse eid="EXO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 5:7" />“Msekuwenka wantu mani ya kudamanyiza matofali. Walekeni waite wakalonde wenye. <verse eid="EXO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 5:8" />Mna uwazwa wa matofali nawakadamanya kulaila aho nkongo, wekiyeni iyo, msekuhungula hata chidogo kwaviya ni wabwa awo. Ivyo watula lwasu wakagamba, chilekeile chikamlavize ntambiko Chohile ywetu! <verse eid="EXO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 5:9" />Wenkeni ndima ndala zitendese msekuwenka luhenyo, chani wasekutenda na chipindi cha kudantana.”<verse eid="EXO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 5:10" />Wachimaila wa watumwa na wachimaila wa Chiizulaeli waita kuwagambila Waizulaeli, “Falao kagamba hawenkeni mani naho. <verse eid="EXO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 5:11" />Hitani mkalonde wenye mani hohose mkunga muyawone, kwaviya ndima yenyu haihungulwe hata hadodo.” <verse eid="EXO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 5:12" />Ivyo wantu niyo wazagala mwe isi yose ya Misili chani wadahe kuchisanya mani yakudamanyiza matofali. <verse eid="EXO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 5:13" />Wachimaila wawo niyo wawahikiliza. Wakagamba, “Chintizani ndima yenyu ya chila zuwa saviya namkadamanya umo mwegailagwa mani.” <verse eid="EXO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 5:14" />Wachimaila wa Chimisili wawatowa wachimaila wa Waizulaeli wasagulwe kuchimaila ndima. Wakagamba, “Ni mbwani hamchintize ndima yenyu ya gulo na dyelo ya uwazwa wa matofali namkadamnya nkongo?”<verse eid="EXO 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 5:15" />Wachimaila wa wana wa Izulaeli niyo waita kwa Falao kumwilila wakagamba, “Falao vino wachusa mbwani suwe watumwa wako? <verse eid="EXO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 5:16" />Hachikwinkwa naho mani, mna chakunkuswa chidamanye matofali. Naho suwe wandima wako chatoigwa mna wabanasi ni wantu wako.”<verse eid="EXO 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 5:17" />Falao ahitula, “Mwiwabwa naho hamkunga kudamanya ndima, vino nivyo vikuleka mkununga niwalekele mwite mkalavye ntambiko kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 5:18" />Ivyo, hitani mkadamanye ndima! Kwaviya hamwinkigwe zani dyodyose, mna mdamanye uwazwa udya wa matofali.” <verse eid="EXO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 5:19" />Wachimaila wa Chiizulaeli wabunkula kugamba wemwe nkunto aho weze wagambilwe wadamanye uwazwa udya wa matofali chila zuwa saviya nkongo.<verse eid="EXO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 5:20" />Umo wakahalawa, wadugana na Musa na Haluni, nawakawagoja. <verse eid="EXO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 5:21" />Wawagamba Musa na Haluni, “Zumbe kaviwona ivyo mdamanye naho nawakantileni kwa kuchitenda suwe chitende chiha kwa Falao na wandima wakwe. Muwenka luhenyo lwa kuchikoma!”<verse eid="EXO 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa alombeza wambizi kwa Zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 5:22" />Niyo Musa amhitukila Zumbe naho nakugamba, “Zumbe, ni mbwani ukuwadamanya vihiye wantu wako? Ni mbwani ukanisigila miye? <verse eid="EXO 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 5:23" />Kukongela aho nitile kwa Falao kulonga idizina dyako, uyo kawadamanya wihi wantu wako. Mna weye hudamanye dyodyose kuwakombola!”<verse eid="EXO 5:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EXO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 6:1" />Elo, Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Haluse nokaule ivyo hunga nuse kwa Falao. Nanimkumpuse awalekeile wantu wangu. Ichindedi, nanimunge awakumpuseni mlawe mwe isi yakwe.”<verse eid="EXO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chohile amwitanga Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 6:2" />Chohile alonga naho na Musa, “Miye ni miye Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 6:3" />Simlaila Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo nili Chohile Mta udahi wose, mna sivyungile wanimanye kwa zina dyangu Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="EXO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 6:4" />Naho naikaga lagano dyangu nawo, silonga nawo kugamba naniwenke isi ya Kanani, isi nawekale saviya wajeni. <verse eid="EXO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 6:5" />Siva kuugula kwa Waizulaeli, watendigwe watumwa ni Wamisili. Ivyo sikumbuka idilagano dyangu. <verse eid="EXO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 6:6" />Ivyo wagambile Waizulaeli nawagambila, ‘Miye ni Zumbe, naniwalavye niwaike walekeilwe na utumwa wa Wamisili. Naninule mkono wangu una nguvu kujesa kanto dikulise mwawo, naho naniwahonye. <verse eid="EXO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 6:7" />Naniwatende wantu wangu, naho nanitende Chohile ywenyu. Namvimanye kugamba miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu umo hawatendani mlekeilwe mwo utumwa wa Misili. <verse eid="EXO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 6:8" />Naniwegaleni mwe isi nelisaga kugamba naniwenke Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo, naniwenke itende yenyu. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile nelisize vino.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 6:9" />Musa kavilonga vino kwa Waizulaeli, mna hawamwetegeleze, kwaviya nawafa chevu kwa kudamanywa vihiye kwa utumwa mkali.<verse eid="EXO 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 6:10" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Musa, <verse eid="EXO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 6:11" />“Hita ukamgambile Falao, seuta ywa Misili, kugamba awalekele Waizulaeli wayase isi yakwe.”<verse eid="EXO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 6:12" />Mna Musa amhitula Zumbe, “Kaula Waizulaeli hawanivile, togola Falao nanive? Miye sina umanyi wa kulonga.”<verse eid="EXO 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 6:13" />Zumbe awalagiza Musa na Haluni, “Hitani kwa Falao chani muwalongoze Waizulaeli wamlawe mwe isi ya Misili.”<verse eid="EXO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakale wa Musa na Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 6:14" />Wano nawo wakulu wa lweleko lwa Izulaeli iviya etangwa Yakobo, Lubeni mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa Yakobo endaga na wana chilume wane, Hanoki na Palu na Hesiloni na Kalimi, awo nani wakale wa nkolo za Lubeni. <verse eid="EXO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 6:15" />Wana mtandatu wa Simeoni wendaga ni, Yemueli na Yamini na Ohadi na Yakini na Sohali na Shauli. Uyo Shauli mamiyakwe endaga Mkanani, awo nani wakale wa nkolo za Simeoni. <verse eid="EXO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 6:16" />Lawi nendile ana wana chilume watatu, Gelishoni na Kohati na Melali. Lawi ekalaga mihilimo gana na milongo mitatu na mfungate. <verse eid="EXO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 6:17" />Gelishoni endaga na wana chilume waidi, Libini na Shimei, awo wendaga wakale wa nkolo zawo. <verse eid="EXO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 6:18" />Konati endaga na wana wane wa chilume, Amlamu na Ishali na Hebuloni na Uzieli. Kohati kekala mihilimo gana na milongo mitatu na mitatu. <verse eid="EXO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 6:19" />Melali endaga na wana chilume waidi, Mali na Mushi. Awo nawo wakale wa nkolo za Walawi.<verse eid="EXO 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 6:20" />Amlamu amsolaga Yokebeli ninesangazi, niyo amweleka Haluni na Musa. Amlamu ekelaga mihilimo gana na milongo mitatu na mfungate. <verse eid="EXO 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 6:21" />Ishali endaga na wana chilume watatu, Kola na Nefegi na Zikili. <verse eid="EXO 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 6:22" />Uzieli naye endaga na wana chilume watatu, Mishaeli na Elisafani na Sitili.<verse eid="EXO 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 6:23" />Haluni amsolaga Elisheba, mwana chiche ywa Aminadabu lumbudye dya Nashoni. Kamwelekela Nadabu na Abihu na Eliazali na Itamali. <verse eid="EXO 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 6:24" />Kola endaga na wana chilume watatu, Asili na Elikana na Abiyasafu. Awo wendaga ni wakale wa nkolo za Kola. <verse eid="EXO 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 6:25" />Eliazali, mwana chilume ywa Haluni, amsolaga yumwenga ywa wana chiche wa Putieli, amwelekelaga Finehasi. Awo wendaga wakulu wa kaya na nkolo za kabila dya Lawi.<verse eid="EXO 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 6:26" />Haluni na Musa nawo wagambilwe ni Zumbe, “Walavyeni wantu wa Izulaeli wamlawe mwe isi ino ya Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 6:27" />Musa na Haluni nawo walongaga na Falao, seuta ywa Misili, awalekeile wantu wa Izulaeli wamlawe mwe isi ya Misili.<verse eid="EXO 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi ya Zumbe kwa Musa na Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 6:28" />Umo Zumbe alongaga na Musa mwe isi ya Misili, <verse eid="EXO 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 6:29" />agambaga, “Miye ni miye Zumbe. Mgambile Falao seuta ywa Misili mbuli zose hukugambila.”<verse eid="EXO 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 6:30" />Mna Musa ahitula, “Kuvimanya kugamba miye sina umanyi wa kulonga, Falao adaha kunetegeleza?”<verse eid="EXO 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EXO 7" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe awasigila Musa na Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 7:1" />Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Kaula, nahutende saviya mnungu kwa Falao, mlukolo ywako Haluni natende mlongi ywako. <verse eid="EXO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 7:2" />Nomgambile Haluni chila chintu hukusigila, naye namgambile Falao awalekele Waizulaeli wamlawe mwe isi yakwe. <verse eid="EXO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 7:3" />Mna nanimtende Falao mdala ywa kwiva. Hata hegu nanitendese maula na mpituko zilozese mwe isi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 7:4" />Mna Falao hakwetegeleze. Aho nanilagise udahi wangu kuwahiga Wamisili, naniikantile vikulise isi ya Misili nakuwalavya wantu wangu makabila ya Izulaeli wamlawe mwe isi ya Misili. Nainidamanye ivyo kwa ntendwa nkulu isi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 7:5" />Wamisili nawavimanye kugamba miye ni Zumbe, aho nanichuluse umkono wangu na kuwalavya Waizulaeli mwe isi yawo.” <verse eid="EXO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 7:6" />Musa na Haluni niyo wadamanya saviya wasigilwe ni Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 7:7" />Musa endaga na mihilimo milongo mnane na Haluni endaga na mihilimo milongo mnane na mitatu umo wakalonga na Falao.<verse eid="EXO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkome ya Haluni ya kujendela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 7:8" />Zumbe awagamba Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="EXO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 7:9" />“Uneva Falao analonga na nyuwe akawagamba mdamanye mpituko, naho nomgambe Haluni aguhe nkome yakwe aidule hasi kulongozi kwakwe chani itende nyoka.” <verse eid="EXO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 7:10" />Ivyo Musa na Haluni waita kwa Falao nakudamanya viya wasigilwe ni Zumbe. Haluni niyo adula inkome yakwe kulongozi kwa Falao na vilongozi weyawe, niyo yahituka nyoka. <verse eid="EXO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 7:11" />Mna niyo Falao etanga wantu wakwe wata umanyi na wasai, nawo niyo wadamanya iviya kwa usai wawo. <verse eid="EXO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 7:12" />Chila yumwenga niyo adula inkome yakwe hasi, niyo zahituka nyoka. Mna inkome ya Haluni niyo yazimela izawo. <verse eid="EXO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 7:13" />Hata ivyo Falao niyo asigaila kutenda mdala ywa kwiva, hawetegeleze saviya Zumbe alongile.<verse eid="EXO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkomano yaigwela Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 7:14" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Falao ni mdala ywa kwiva, alemela kuwalekeila wantu waite zawo. <verse eid="EXO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 7:15" />Ivyo mbase luvi mtondo udugane naye umo akaita komto Naili. Mgoje hampezo homto chani uwonane naye, mo mkono wako guha idya inkome yako yahitukilaga nyoka. <verse eid="EXO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 7:16" />Weye nomgambe, ‘Zumbe, Chohile ywa Waebulaniya, kanisigila nize kwako agamba, walekele wantu wangu waite, chani wakanivikile kwe dijangwa. Mna kubula haluse huitegeleze imbuli iyo. <verse eid="EXO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 7:17" />Haluse, Zumbe agamba novimanye kugamba nuyo Zumbe. Kaula, naniyatowe yano mazi ye momto ne nkome ino imomkono wangu, nayo nayahitukile sakame. <verse eid="EXO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 7:18" />Naho samaki zimomto wa Naili nazife, na umto uno naununke huzi. Wamisili hawadahe kunywa amazi yakwe.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 7:19" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Mgambile Haluni aguhe nkome yakwe aichuluse mlanga mwe mito na makolongo na masima yawo yose ya mazi mwe isi ya Misili. Chani mazi yose yahitukile sakame, mwe isi yose nakutende na sakame, hata mwe viya vyose vyo kwikiya mazi.”<verse eid="EXO 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 7:20" />Musa na Haluni niyo wadamanya viya wasigilwe ni Zumbe. Niyo enula idya inkome na kuyotowa amamzi momto kulongozi kwa Falao na kulongozi kwa vilongozi weyawe, mazi yose niyo yahitukila sakame. <verse eid="EXO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 7:21" />Samaki momto niyo zafa, umto niyo wanunkisa huzi vilekile Wamisili wasekudaha kunywa amazi yomto. Chila hantu mwe isi yose ya Misili hendaga na sakame. <verse eid="EXO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 7:22" />Mna niyo wasai wa Misili wadamanya mliganyo sauwo kwa usai wawo. Falao achei mdala ywa kwiva, hawetegeleze saviya Zumbe Chohile alongile. <verse eid="EXO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 7:23" />Falao niyo azunguluka nakwingila kwenyumbakwe, naho du mbuli zilaile hazijeile momtwi. <verse eid="EXO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 7:24" />Wamisili wose niyo wasimba masima mnkanda mo mto wapate mazi ya kunywa, kwaviya wadunduga kunywa amazi yo mto uwo.<verse eid="EXO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 7:25" />Yajinka mazuwa mfungate hadya Zumbe atoile umto.<verse eid="EXO 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EXO 8" />
  <para style="s">Majula yenela mwe isi yose ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 8:1" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Hita kwa Falao ukamgambe Zumbe agamba, ‘Walekele wantu wangu waite, chani wakanivikile. <verse eid="EXO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 8:2" />Uneva unalemela, kaula naniitowe imihaka ye isi yako kwa kuigubika na majula. <verse eid="EXO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 8:3" />Mto Naili naumeme majula, nayakwele nakwingila mndani mwenyumbako na mndani mwechumba chako ukugona, na mlanga mo lusazi lwako na nyumba za vilongozi weyawo na wantu wako, na mwamaziko yako na mweviya vyako vya kusukumila unga. <verse eid="EXO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 8:4" />Majula ayo nayakupilikile weye, wantu wako na vilongozi weyawo wase!’ ”<verse eid="EXO 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 8:5" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Mgambe Haluni chulusa umkono wako nenkome yako mlanga mwe mito na makolongo na masima ya mazi, chani wigale majula yagubike isi yose ya Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 8:6" />Ivyo Haluni niyo achulusa umkono mlanga mwa mazi yose ya misili, majula niyo yalawa yagubika isi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 8:7" />Mna wasai nawo mo usai wawo, wahosa majula yalaile mwe isi ya Misili.<verse eid="EXO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 8:8" />Falao awetanga Musa na Haluni nakuwagamba, “Mlombezeni Zumbe chani ause amajula yano kwangu na kwawantu wangu, nami niwalekele wantu waite chani wakamvikile Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="EXO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 8:9" />Musa ahitula, “Nanelelwe mwe mbuli ino. Longa ni ini ukunga hulombezeze na vilongozi weyawo na wantu wako, majula ayo yabalangwe yamlawe mwako na mwezinyumba zako yekale momto du.”<verse eid="EXO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 8:10" />Falao ahitula, “Luvi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 8:10">Musa agamba, “Nanidamanye viya ulongile, chani umanye kugamba hahana mtuhu akuligana na Zumbe, Chohile ywetu. <verse eid="EXO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 8:11" />Majula ayo nayahalawe hako na mwezinyumba zako na kwa vilongozi weyawo na wantu wako, nayasigaile momto du.” <verse eid="EXO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 8:12" />Niyo, Musa na Haluni wahalawa ha Falao, Musa amlombeza Zumbe ause amajula amwigaile Falao. <verse eid="EXO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 8:13" />Zumbe niyo adamanya saviya Musa alombeze, majula ayo niyo yafa kulaila mwe izinyumba, na molwazo na mwe zinkonde. <verse eid="EXO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 8:14" />Wamisili niyo wayachisanya amajula madunda dunda isi niyo yanunka huzi. <verse eid="EXO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 8:15" />Mna Falao eze awone hana luhulwila niyo atenda mdala ywa kwiva naho saviya Zumbe alongaga. Falao hawetegeleze Musa na Haluni.<verse eid="EXO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntwazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 8:16" />Zumbe amgamba Musa, mgambile Haluni, “Chulusa inkome yako, utowe iditifili dye isi yose ya Misili, chani dyose dihitukile ntwazi.” <verse eid="EXO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 8:17" />Ivyo Haluni atowa hasi inkome yakwe, msanga wose we isi ya Misili wahitukila ntwazi zagubike wantu na wanyama mwe isi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 8:18" />Wasai nawo niyo wajeza kudidamanya iditifili dihituke ntwazi kwa usai wawo mna wadunduga. Kwendaga na ntwazi mwa awantu na mwa wanyama. <verse eid="EXO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 8:19" />Wasai wamgamba Falao, “Chohile nuyo adamanye vino!” Mna Falao endaga mdala ywa kwiva. Saviya Zumbe alongaga, Falao hawetegeleze Musa na Haluni.<verse eid="EXO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Si</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 8:20" />Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Luvi mtondo hita ukadugane na Falao umo akaita ko mto, mgambe, Zumbe agamba, ‘Walekele wantu wangu waite, chani wakanivikile. <verse eid="EXO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 8:21" />Hegu hukunga kuwalekeila wantu wangu kaula nanigale si zilozize kwako na kwavilongozi weyawo na wantu wako ziwavevengele. Izo nazingile mndani mwezinyumba zako, nyumba za Wamisili nazimeme si, isi naigugubikwe ni si. <verse eid="EXO 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 8:22" />Mna naniwase umzi wa Gosheni, uko wantu wangu wakwikala, hakutende na si. Nanidamanye ivyo chani umanye kugamba, miye ni Zumbe ywe izisi zose. <verse eid="EXO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 8:23" />Nanisente wantu wangu hawaziwone, mna wantu wako du. Chilagiso icho nanikilagise luvi.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 8:24" />Zumbe niyo asigila mafyo ya si mwe nyumba ya Falao na mwezinyumba ze vilongozi weyawe, na mwe isi yose ya Misili. Isi yose niyo yabalangwa ni si.<verse eid="EXO 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 8:25" />Falao niyo awetanga Musa na Haluni awagamba, “Jendani mkalavye ntambiko kwa Chohile ywenyu, mna umuno mwe isi ino ya Misili.”<verse eid="EXO 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 8:26" />Musa ahitula, “Havikudahika kutenda ivyo, kwaviya ntambiko chikunga chimlavize Zumbe, Chohile ywetu, naziwaihize Wamisili. Chinalavya ntambiko zikuwaihiza Wamisili wanachiwona nawachitowe mayuwe. <verse eid="EXO 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 8:27" />Chaungwa chitambe mwe dijangwa mazuwa matatu chikamlavize ntambiko Zumbe, Chohile ywetu, saviya nachilagize.”<verse eid="EXO 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 8:28" />Falao agamba, “Naniwalekeleni mwite mkalavye ntambiko kwa Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu, kwe dijangwa, mna hamwitise hale. Haluse nilombezezani kwa Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="EXO 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 8:29" />Musa ahitula, “Kaula miye nahalawa hako nanimlombeze Zumbe chani si izo zihalawe hako na kwevilongozi weyawo na kwa wantu wako luvi. Mna usekuchidanta naho usekulekeila wantu waite wakalavye ntambiko kwa Zumbe.”<verse eid="EXO 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 8:30" />Musa niyo ahalawa ha Falao nakumlombeza Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 8:31" />Zumbe niyo adamanya saviya Musa alombeze. Azusa izisi zihiye kwa Falao na kwevilongozi weyawe na wantu wakwe. Haisigale hata imwenga. <verse eid="EXO 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 8:32" />Mna hata ivyo Falao katenda mdala ywa kwiva, hawalekeile wantu wa Izulaeli waite.<verse eid="EXO 8:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EXO 9" />
  <para style="s">File ya wanyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 9:1" />Naho Zumbe amgambila Musa, “Hita kwa Falao ukamgambe Zumbe, Chohile ywa Waebulaniya agamba, ‘Walekele wantu wangu waite, chani wakanivikile. <verse eid="EXO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 9:2" />Uneva unalemela kuwalekeila waite na kujendeleza kuwachinda, <verse eid="EXO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 9:3" />Zumbe negale manyonje moludimo lwako lose ukudima kwezinkonde nezifalasi zako na mpunda na ngamiya na ng'ombe na mbuzi na ngoto nazingilwe ni ndigana ikutisa. <verse eid="EXO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 9:4" />Ukajika Zumbe nasente ludimo lwa Waizulaeli na ludimo lwa Wamisili, hahana mnyama ywa Mwizulaeli naife. <verse eid="EXO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 9:5" />Zumbe kaika chipindi akagamba, Luvi nanijese imbuli ino mwe isi ya Misili.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 9:6" />Zuwa ditimile Zumbe ajesa saviya alongaga. Wanyama wose wa Wamisili wafa, mna moludimo lwa Waizulaeli hahana hata imwenga ifile. <verse eid="EXO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 9:7" />Falao asigila wantu wakauze chilaile niyo agambilwa kugamba moludimo lwa Waizulaeli haifile hata imwenga. Mna Falao achei mdala ywa kwiva, hawalekele wantu waite.<verse eid="EXO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 9:8" />Zumbe niyo awagamba Musa na Haluni, “Guhani maivu mwevifumba vyenyu kulaila mwamatanuli yenyu, ukajika Musa ayafilise kulanga kwembingu kulongozi kwa Falao. <verse eid="EXO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 9:9" />Nayo nayatende saviya lumbi mwe isi yose ya Misili, nayatende maihu yakweukiza na kutumbuka mwa wantu na mwamakala mwe isi yose ya Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 9:10" />Ivyo waguha maivu mwamatanuli nakuchimala kulongozi kwa Falao. Musa niyo ayafilisa kulanga, niyo yatenda maihu yakweukiza na kutumbuka mwa wantu na makala. <verse eid="EXO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 9:11" />Wadya wasai wadunduga kuchimala na kuhigana na Musa, kwaviya wowo na Wamisili wose nawamema maihu. <verse eid="EXO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 9:12" />Mna Zumbe kamtenda Falao atende mdala ywa kwiva. Hawetegeleze Musa na Haluni saviya Zumbe alongaga.<verse eid="EXO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fula nkulu ya mayuwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 9:13" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Luvi mtondo kwelauke ukachimale kulongozi kwa Falao umgambe, Zumbe, Chohile ywa Waebulaniya, agamba, ‘Walekele wantu wangu waite, chani wakanivikile. <verse eid="EXO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 9:14" />Ntambo ino nahuzagile nkomano zangu zose weye mwenye na vilongozi weyawo na wantu wako, chani umanye kugamba hahali akuligana na miye mwe izisi zose. <verse eid="EXO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 9:15" />Kwaviya vino haluse nasiheza kale kuwajela manyonje wantu wako hamwenga na weye mwenye, nakubalangwa na kusigwa mwe isi. <verse eid="EXO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 9:16" />Mna sikuleka wikale chani hulagise udahi wangu, naho zina dyangu dimanyike mwe isi yose. <verse eid="EXO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 9:17" />Mna uchei walagisa ubezi mwa wantu wangu, walemela kuwalekela wantu wangu waite. <verse eid="EXO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 9:18" />Kaula luvi chipindi sachino nanigale fula nkulu ya mayuwe, hainatu ilaile mwe isi ya Misili kukongela ilaile kubula haluse. <verse eid="EXO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 9:19" />Haluse sigila wantu wasunguze kwingiza ludimo lwako na chila chintu unanacho chikwe hantu hatondowale. Kwaviya chila mntu na chila mnyama nabwilwe kwenkonde, hewevuzigwe kaya, fula iyo yamayuwe naiwanyele nawo nawafe wose.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 9:20" />Wadya wevile ulosi wa Zumbe mgati mwa vilongozi wa Falao niyo wasunguza kwingiza mnyumba watumwa wakwe no ludimo lwakwe hantu hatondowale. <verse eid="EXO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 9:21" />Wadya wabeile ulosi wa Zumbe, niyo wasa watumwa noludimo lwawo molumpwe.<verse eid="EXO 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 9:22" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Inula umkono wako koulanga, chani fula ya mayuwe inye mwe isi yose ya Misili, nainyele wantu na makala na nkande zose mwezinkonde.” <verse eid="EXO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 9:23" />Musa niyo enula inkome yakwe kulanga. Zumbe niyo egala mbaula na fula ya mayuwe na mwemwe mwe isi yose. Zumbe kanyesa fula ya mayuwe mwe isi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 9:24" />Ivyo, kwendaga na fula ya mayuwe na mbaula zihangane ne ifula iyo ya mayuwe ikulise, ivyo na ivyo hayanyaga fula saiyo mwe isi yose ya Misili kukongela itendeke. <verse eid="EXO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 9:25" />Fula iyo ya mayuwe ibalanga chila chintu nachikwenkonde, wantu na makala mwe isi yose ya Misili. Fula iyo ibalanga chila mmeya kwenkonde na kufyola chila mti kwenkonde. <verse eid="EXO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 9:26" />Gosheni ahodu, hantu nawakekala Waizulaeli nahehene fula ya mayuwe.<verse eid="EXO 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 9:27" />Falao niyo asigila wantu wawetange Musa na Haluni. Weze wabule awagamba, “Ntambo ino sikola masa, Zumbe nuyo akuwagila. Miye na wantu wangu chiwabanasi. <verse eid="EXO 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 9:28" />Mlombezeni Zumbe, kwaviya mbaula zino ne ifula nkulu ino ya mayuwe vyachinta. Naniwalekeni mwite, hamjendeleze kwikala hano vituhu.”<verse eid="EXO 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 9:29" />Musa amgamba, “Ivino hakufosa kuse komzi, naninule mikono yangu kwa Zumbe nimlombeze. Mbaula izo ne ifula ya mayuwe navileke, chani uvimanye kugamba ino is ni ya Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 9:30" />Mna sivimanya kugamba weye hamwenga na vilongozi weyawo mchei hamkumzumila Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="EXO 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 9:31" />Pamba na shayili vibalangwa, kwaviya pamba naikachakula shayili nayo naikalavya maiso. <verse eid="EXO 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 9:32" />Mna ngano na vikuligana na ngano havibalangwe kwaviya vyazigila kutoga.<verse eid="EXO 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 9:33" />Musa eze afose kuse komzi kulaila kwa Falao, niyo enula mikono yakwe kwa Zumbe. Mbaula na fula ya mayuwe niyo vyaleka, fula yaleka kunya mwe isi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 9:34" />Mna Falao eze awone viya, fula ya mayuwe na mbaula vileka, niyo akolesa masa, nakutenda mdala ywa kwiva, yeye hamwenga na vilongozi weyawe. <verse eid="EXO 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 9:35" />Elo, saviya Zumbe amgambile Musa, Falao katenda mdala hawalekeile wantu wa Izulaeli waite.<verse eid="EXO 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EXO 10" />
  <para style="s">Sije</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 10:1" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Hita ukengile kwa Falao, kwaviya simtenda mdala ywa kwiva uyo hamwenga na vilongozi weyawe, chani visimo vyangu vikutisa vimanyike mwawo, <verse eid="EXO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 10:2" />elo, nyuwe mtende na dyakutamwila kwa wanenyu na wezukulu wenyu, ni mbuli zani nidamanye mwe isi ya Misili, na visimo nusize mwawo, chani mmanye kugamba, Miye ni Zumbe.”<verse eid="EXO 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 10:3" />Ivyo Musa na Haluni waita kwa Falao na kumgamba, “Zumbe, Chohile ywa Waebulaniya, agamba ‘Nolemele kunyanyahala kulongozi kwangu kubula ini? Walekele wantu wangu chani wanivikile. <verse eid="EXO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 10:4" />Uneva uchekui kulemela kuwalekeila wantu wangu waite, kaula, luvi nanigale sije zingile mwe isi yako. <verse eid="EXO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 10:5" />Nazigubike isi yose mntu hadahe kuiwona isi iyo, nazidye chiya chisigazwe ni fula ya mayuwe. Nazidye chila mti ukusuka kwezinkonde. <verse eid="EXO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 10:6" />Nazimeme mwezinyumba zako na nyumba za vilongozi wako nezinyumba za Wamisili wose nazimeme sije, hazina mligano watati zako na wababa zako hawaziwonaga, kukongela zuwa wendaga mwe isi kubula vino dyelo.’ ” Musa niyo ahituka ahalawa ha Falao.<verse eid="EXO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 10:7" />Vilongozi wa Falao wamgamba, “Mntu yuno nachivinye kubula ini? Walekele wantu wano waite, chani wakamvikile Zumbe Chohile ywawo. Hubunkule kugamba isi ya Misili kaibalanga?”<verse eid="EXO 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 10:8" />Ivyo Musa na Haluni wavuzwa kwa Falao niyo awagamba, “Hitani mkamvikile Zumbe Chohile ywenyu. Mna ni wahi wakunga waite?”<verse eid="EXO 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 10:9" />Musa ahitula, “Nachite wose, wabwanga wetu na wadalahala wetu na wenetu na wandele wetu. Nachite na ngoto zetu na ng'ombe zetu na wanyama wetu, kwaviya chaungwa chimdamanyize ngasu Zumbe.”<verse eid="EXO 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 10:10" />Falao niyo awagamba nelisa kwa Zumbe, “Uneva ninawalekela mwite na wavyele wenyu na wenenyu, nipwilili mna fanyanyi zihiye mwe myoyo yenyu msekuya. <verse eid="EXO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 10:11" />Bule, hegu nivyo, hitani nyuwe wagosi du, mkamvikile Zumbe kwaviya niyo mbuli mkunga.” Musa na Haluni waguluswa wahalawe ha Falao.<verse eid="EXO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 10:12" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Chulusa umkono wako mlanga mwe isi ya Misili wigale sije chani zize mwe isi ya Misili zidye mimeya yose mwe isi, navyose visigazwe ni fula ya mayuwe.” <verse eid="EXO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 10:13" />Ivyo Musa enula nkome yakwe mwe isi ya Misili, Zumbe niyo egala nkung'unto kulaila ulailo wa zuwa kuhuta isi yose msi wose na chilo chose. Kwize kuche idya inkung'unto kulaila ulailo wa zuwa igala sije. <verse eid="EXO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 10:14" />Sije izo niyo zagubika isi yose, zichima mwe mihaka yose ye isi ya Misili. Nazihisa, hakwatendaga na sije saizo, naho zize zijinke izo hazilaile ntuhu saizo kubula vino dyelo. <verse eid="EXO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 10:15" />Kwaviya nazigubika ulanga we isi, isi niyo yakomela chiza, niyo zadya imimeya yose mwe isi, na matunda yose ye miti yasigazwe ni idya ifula ya mayuwe, hahasigaile hata zani dimwenga mti hegu mmeya mwe nkonde mwe isi yose ya Misili.<verse eid="EXO 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 10:16" />Falao niyo asunguza kuwetanga Musa na Haluni akagamba, “Sikola masa kwa Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu na kwenyu nyuwe. <verse eid="EXO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 10:17" />Haluse naweilani nilekeilani masa yangu nkanana inodu, naho nilombezezani kwa Zumbe Chohile ywenyu anusize ifile ino.” <verse eid="EXO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 10:18" />Ivyo Musa niyo ahalawa ha Falao akumlombeza Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 10:19" />Zumbe niyo ahitula nkung'unto ya uswelo wa zuwa itendese na nguvu, yusa ziya izisije nakuzigala kwe Ibahali ya Shamu. Hahasigale sije hata imwenga mndani mwe mihaka yose ye isi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 10:20" />Mna Zumbe kamtenda mdala ywa kwiva Falao, hawalekeile Waizulaeli waite.<verse eid="EXO 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ziza mwe isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 10:21" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Chulusa umkono wako koulanga, kutende na ziza digubike isi ya Misili wantu wate kuhahasa.” <verse eid="EXO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 10:22" />Musa achulusa mkono wake koulanga, niyo kwakomela ziza mwe isi yose ya Misili kwa mazuwa matatu. <verse eid="EXO 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 10:23" />Wamisili wadunduga kuwonana mntu na mnyawe, chila mntu aho ekale naho kwa chipindi cha mazuwa matatu. Mna Waizulaeli kudya na wakekala nakuna ulangazi.<verse eid="EXO 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 10:24" />Falao amwitanga Musa nakumgamba, “Hitani mkamvikile Zumbe. Mna ngoto zenyu ne zimbuzi zenyu ne zing'ombe zenyu du zasigwe hano, mna wanenyu mwadaha kwita nawo.”<verse eid="EXO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 10:25" />Musa ahitula, “Waungwa uchinke mwemikono yetu wanyama wa kumlaviza ntambiko Zumbe Chohile ywetu na malavyo ya kutikimya, chani chimchinjize ntambiko Zumbe Chohile ywetu. <verse eid="EXO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 10:26" />Nachite hamwenga na mafyo yetu yose, hachase hata mnyama yumwenga, kwaviya chaungwa mwe izo chiguhe ziya chikunga chimlavize Zumbe, Chohile ywetu. Suwe hachimanyize ni chintu chani icho chikungigwa chimlavize Zumbe kubula chibule uko.”<verse eid="EXO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 10:27" />Mna Zumbe niyo amjela moyo mdala Falao, hawalekile waite. <verse eid="EXO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 10:28" />Falao amgamba Musa, “Halawe hangu, kaulisa usekwiza naho kwangu. Zuwa hunga huwone nakukoma.”<verse eid="EXO 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 10:29" />Musa amhitula, “Kulonga vyedi, honiwone vituhu.”<verse eid="EXO 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EXO 11" />
  <para style="s">Musa alonga file ya welekwa wa nkongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 11:1" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Hana chisimo chikulu chisigale nanigale mwa Falao na wantu wakwe. Ikaheza iyo, nawalekele mhalawe hano. Umo nawekeleni nawaguluseni mhauke msekuhauya. <verse eid="EXO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 11:2" />Haluse wagambile wano wantu wa Izulaeli, chila yumwenga ywawo mgosi kwa mvyele nalombeze kwa mjihi ywakwe viya vya zahabu na vyamayuwe yang'aile vya yombe kulu.” <verse eid="EXO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 11:3" />Zumbe kawatenda Waizulaeli wazumilwe ni Wamisili. Ukaleka ayo Musa endaga mtu akutunyiswa mwe isi ya Misili ni vilongozi wa Falao na wantu wose.<verse eid="EXO 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 11:4" />Musa niyo amgamba Falao, “Zumbe agamba, ‘Dyelo chilo gati nanijinke mwe isi ya Misili yose, <verse eid="EXO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 11:5" />na welekwa wa nkongo wose mwe isi ya Misili nawabanike, kukongele kwa mwana chilume ywa Falao, akwikala mwe chiti chakwe cho useuta, hata mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa msunta viya akwikala hanyuma hediya idiyuwe dyo kusagila. Na welekwa wa nkongo wa ludimo nawo nawafe. <verse eid="EXO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 11:6" />Nakutende na ndilo ikulise mwe isi yose ya Misili, hainati ilaile ndilo saiyo, naho haize ilaile ntuhu saiyo. <verse eid="EXO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 11:7" />Mna mwa wantu wa Izulaeli hahana hata kuli dikunga dife, mntu hegu mnyama, chani mmanye ivyo Zumbe akuwasenta Wamisili na Waizulaeli.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 11:8" />Musa amgamba Falao, “Vilongozi weyawe wose naweze kwangu wefunamize, nawaneile, niguhe wantu wangu wose chihalawe. Haheza aho nanihalawe.” Musa niyo ahalawa ha Falao chimaya maya.<verse eid="EXO 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 11:9" />Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Falao najendeleze kutenda mdala ywa kwiva, chani visimo vyangu vikutisa vyongezekele mwe isi ya Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 11:10" />Ivyo Musa na Haluni wadamanya visimo vikutisa vyose ivyo kulongozi kwa Falao, mna Zumbe kamtenda Falao mdala ywa kwiva, hawalekile Waizulaeli wahalawe heisi yakwe.<verse eid="EXO 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EXO 12" />
  <para style="s">Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 12:1" />Zumbe niyo alonga na Musa na Haluni mwe isi ya Misili, awagamba, <verse eid="EXO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 12:2" />“Mwezi uno nautende nkongelo ya myezi kwenyu. Nautende ni mwezi wa nkongo wa mhilimo kwenyu. <verse eid="EXO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 12:3" />Wagambileni wantu wose wa Izulaeli, mwedizuwa dya mlongo dyo mwezi uno chila yumwenga naguhe kadolome kamwenga kwa chila nyumba imwenga, hegu kabehela chila nyumba. <verse eid="EXO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 12:4" />Uneva wantu wenyumba iyo ni wajeche wadunduga kudya nyama ya ngoto imwenga, nadye na wantu wehaguhi nenyumbakwe, nawaguhe kadolome kamwenga kuligana nomligano wa wantu, kuligana naviya akudya chila mntu. <verse eid="EXO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 12:5" />Mwana ngoto uyo asekutenda na lema dyodyose, katende kadolome hegu kabehehla ka mhilimo umwenga. <verse eid="EXO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 12:6" />Nanywi namzidime kubula mwe zuwa dya mlongo na mane dyo mwezi, wantu wose wa Izulaeli nawamchinje uyo mnyama nechisingi mo mwezi uno. <verse eid="EXO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 12:7" />Wantu nawaguhe sakame siku na kuihaka mlanga mwe zinyivi na mwevifigwe vya kulanga na mnkanda mwe zinyumba ziya nazidigwe. <verse eid="EXO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 12:8" />Chilo icho nyama nazokwe, niyo zadigwa hamwenga na mgate hewigwaduswe na mboga za mani zisungu. <verse eid="EXO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 12:9" />Msekuidya mbisi hegu itipwiliswe mwa mazi, mna yanikwe mo moto, hamwenga no mtwi na mahazi nevintu vyose vya kundani. <verse eid="EXO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 12:10" />Naho msekuisigaza kubula mtondo. Nyama iyo namsigaze yokeni mo moto. <verse eid="EXO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 12:11" />Nyama iyo namuidye vino, namtende mnyinya ivigudi vyenyu, mweviga mvala amakwapa yenyu na mwemikono mtoza izinkome zenyu. Naho msunguze kuidya iyo ni pasaka ya kumtunya Zumbe.”<verse eid="EXO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 12:12" />“Kwaviya chilo icho, nanijinke mwe isi ya Misili na kuwakoma welekwa wa nkongo wose mwe isi ya Misili, ywa mntu na ywa wanyama. Nanilavye nkanto kwe milungu yose ya Misili. Miye ni Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 12:13" />Sakame mlanga mwe zinyivi zenyu naitende chilagiso chenyu mwezinyumba mkwikala. Umo haiwona isakame iyo, nanijinke mlanga mwenyu, hamgwelwe ni chisimo chochose chikutisa umo haikantila isi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 12:14" />Zuwa idyo naditende lagizo kwenyu, mditende ni ngasu nkulu ya pasaka mwe vyeleko vyenyu kwa ntunyo yangu Miye Zumbe. Idyo ni lagiso dya mazuwa yose kwenyu.”<verse eid="EXO 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngasu ya migate heigwaduswe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 12:15" />Zumbe ajendeleza kulonga, “Namdye migate heigwaduswe kwa chipindi cha mazuwa mfungate. Zuwa dya nkongo mwa mazuwa ayo mfungate, namuse ugwadu wose mwezinyumba zenyu. Kwaviya mwe chipindi icho cha mazuwa mfungate mntu yoyose nadye mgate ugwaduswe, uyo nasentwe hale ni Waizulaeli. <verse eid="EXO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 12:16" />Zuwa dya nkongo na zuwa dya mfungate ni mdugano wa kunivikila Miye Chohile. Kusekudamanywa ndima yoyose mwa mazuwa ayo, mna mwadaha kwambika nkande. <verse eid="EXO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 12:17" />Tozani ingasu idya yemigate heigwaduswe, kwaviya mwedizuwa idyo nawalavyaga wantu wa Izulaeli kulaila Misili. Elo tozesani idizuwa idyo mwe vyeleko vyenyu vyose enga lagizo dya mazuwa yose. <verse eid="EXO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 12:18" />Namdye migate heigwaduswe kukongela chisingi cha zuwa dya mfungate dyo mwezi wa nkongo kubula chisingi cha zuwa dya milongo midi na dimwenga dyo mwezi uwo. <verse eid="EXO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 12:19" />Mwa mazuwa ayo mfungate kusekuwoneka ugwadu wowose mwezinyumba zenyu, kwaviya mntu yoyose mkaya hegu mjeni nadye migate igwaduswe, nasentwe ni wantu wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="EXO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 12:20" />Hohose namwikale mnasekudya chochose chigwaduswe. Mwaungwa mdye migate heigwaduswe.”<verse eid="EXO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pasaka ya nkongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 12:21" />Musa niyo awetanga wadalahala wose wa Izulaeli, awagamba, “Hitani, mkasagule kadolome hegu kabehela saviya nkolo zenyu zili, mkachinje mdye Pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 12:22" />Guhani kahuto mkachafike mwe sakame imwebakuli, imyageni mwevifigwe mlanga mwe mifumbati midi ye zinyumba zenyu. Chilo icho mntu yoyose asekufosa kuse kwe nyumbakwe kubula mtondo. <verse eid="EXO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 12:23" />Kwaviya, Zumbe najinke chani awakome Wamisili, aho naiwone isakame mwe chifigwe cha kulanga na mwe mifumbati midi, Zumbe najinke mlanga mo lwivi, naho hamleke mkomi engile mwe zinyumba zenyu na kuwakoma. <verse eid="EXO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 12:24" />Tozesani imbuli ino itende lagizo mwenyu na wanenyu mazuwa yose. <verse eid="EXO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 12:25" />Aho namwingile mwe isi idya Zumbe alongile nawenkeni, naho namjese mbuli iyo. <verse eid="EXO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 12:26" />Umo wanenyu nawawauzeni, ‘Imbuli ino yalagisa mbwani’? <verse eid="EXO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 12:27" />Nyuwe namuwagambe, ‘Ino ni Ntambiko ya Pasaka ya Zumbe, kwaviya ajinkaga mlanga mwe zinyumba za wana wa Waizulaeli uko Misili, umo awakomaga Wamisili mna suwe hachikomile.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 12:27">Waizulaeli wenamizaga imitwi yawo wakamvikila Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 12:28" />Niyo Waizulaeli waita wakudamanya saviya Zumbe awalagise Musa na Haluni.<verse eid="EXO 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukomwa kwa welekwa wa nkongo wa Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 12:29" />Eze ibule chilo gati, Zumbe niyo awakoma welekwa wa nkongo wose mwe isi ya Misili. Kukongela mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa Falao ekale mwe chigoda cho useuta, kubula mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa mntu emwechifungo. Kubula welekwa wa nkongo wa ludimo. <verse eid="EXO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 12:30" />Falao navilongozi weyawe na wekazi wose wa Misili niyo wenuka nechilo. Niyo kwatenda na ndilo ikulise, kwaviya nahahana nyumba heina ndilo. <verse eid="EXO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 12:31" />Falao niyo awetanga Musa na Haluni nechilo, na kuwagamba, “Inulani mwite! Mlaweni mgati mwa wantu wangu, nyuwe na Waizulaeli wose! Hitani, mkamvikile Zumbe saviya mlombeze. <verse eid="EXO 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 12:32" />Guhani ngoto zenyu na mbuzi na ng'ombe zenyu saviya mlongile, halaweni. Nilombezezani nijimbikwe miye nami.”<verse eid="EXO 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 12:33" />Wamisili niyo wawatintisa Waizulaeli wasunguze kuhalawa, wakagamba, “Hamna halaile chose nachibanike.” <verse eid="EXO 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 12:34" />Ivyo, Waizulaeli niyo waguha unga wawo hewinati kugwaduswa, na viya vyawo vyo kwambikila wavijela mwe mabundu wavihagata. <verse eid="EXO 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 12:35" />Waizulaeli wadamanya saviya Musa awalagize, wawalombeza Wamisili wawenke viya vidamanywe kwa hela, na viya vya zahabu na suche zedi. <verse eid="EXO 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 12:36" />Zumbe kawenka Waizulaeli wahingizwe ni Wamisili, wawenka chila chintu wongile. Nivyo Waizulaeli wawahokile Wamisili ugoli wawo.<verse eid="EXO 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli wakulawa Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 12:37" />Waizulaeli watamba kulaila Lamesesi, watamba lwaviga kuhinga Sukosi. Wendaga wagosi elufu magana mtandatu, ukaleka kuwaza wavyele na wana. <verse eid="EXO 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 12:38" />Kwendaga na fyo kulu dya wantu watuhu wahangane waitanye nawo. Na ngoto na mbuzi na ng'ombe zilozize. <verse eid="EXO 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 12:39" />Niyo woka migate heigwaduswe kwa udya unga walaile nawo kwe isi ya Misili. Haugwaduswe kwaviya nawalavigwa kwa kutintiswa wamlawe mwe isi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 12:40" />Waizulaeli wekalaga Misili kwa mihilimo, milongo magana mane na milongo mitatu. <verse eid="EXO 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 12:41" />Zuwa dya nkomelezo dyo mhilimo wa magana mane na milongo mitatu, mwedizuwa idiyo numo makabila yose ya Zumbe yamlaile mwe isi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 12:42" />Chilo icho Zumbe kacheleza akawalavya wana wa Izulaeli mwe isi ya Misili, vyaungwa chikumbukwe ni Waizulaeli wose na vyeleko vyawo vyose. Kwaviya ni chilo cha ncheleza kwa wana wa Izulaeli kumntunya Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="EXO 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo mwe Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 12:43" />Zumbe awagamba Musa na Haluna, “Yano nayo malagizo ye Pasaka. Mntu mjeni asekudya inkande ye Pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 12:44" />Mna mtumwa yoyose yudya aguligwe kwa hela, anajelwa ngasu nivyo adaha kudya inkande ye Pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 12:45" />Mntu akwikala kwenyu enga mjeni na mtafi yoyose hegu mchibaluwa yoyose asekudya inkande iyo ye pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 12:46" />Naidigwe mwe nyumba imwenga. Hamlavye nyama yoyose kuse kwenyumba iyo ichinjigwe, naho msekutula hata vuha dimwenga dyenyama iyo. <verse eid="EXO 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EXO 12:47" />Wantu wa Izulaeli wose nawajese imbuli iyo. <verse eid="EXO 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EXO 12:48" />Mjeni yoyose mkwikazanya, hegu aunga adye nkande ye Pasaka ya Zumbe wabwanga wose mwe nyumbakwe waungwa wajelwe ngasu, aho nawazwe enga mkaya nalekelwe aijese Ipasaka. Mgosi yoyose hejeligwe ngasu asekujeza kuidya. <verse eid="EXO 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EXO 12:49" />Sigilizi nazitende iziya kwa mkaya na kwa mjeni akwikala mgati mwenyu.” <verse eid="EXO 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EXO 12:50" />Waizulaeli wose niyo watoza izisigilizi izo saviya Zumbe awasigile Musa na Haluni. <verse eid="EXO 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EXO 12:51" />Zuwa idyo Zumbe niyo awalavya Waizulaeli mwe isi ya Misili, mabunga kwa mabunga.<verse eid="EXO 12:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EXO 13" />
  <para style="s">Kulenguswa kwa welekwa wa nkongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 13:1" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="EXO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 13:2" />“Nilengusiza miye welekwa wa nkongo wose wa chilume, chila ywa nkongo avugule inda mgati mwa Waizulaeli ni ywangu itende ni wagosi hegu wanyama.”<verse eid="EXO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chinyemi cha migate heigwaduswe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 13:3" />Musa kawagambila wantu, “Dikumbukeni idizuwa dino mlaile mwe isi ya Misili kulaila mwe nyumba yo utumwa. Kwaviya Zumbe kawalavyani kudya kwa nguvu za mkono wakwe. Msekudya mgate hewigwaduswe. <verse eid="EXO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 13:4" />Zuwa dino dyo mwezi wa nkongo ukwitangwa Abibu, mwafosa mwe isi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 13:5" />Aho Zumbe nawegaleni mwe isi ya Wakanani na Wahiti na Waamoli na Wahivi na Wayebusi. Umo isi idya awelisize wakale wenyu kugamba nawenkeni, isi yedi kwa kudimila na kulima, mwaungwa kutoza idizuwa dino mo mwezi uno. <verse eid="EXO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 13:6" />Mazuwa mfungate namdye migate heigwaduswe, na mwezuwa dya mfungate naitende ngasu kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 13:7" />Zumbe ajendeleza kulonga, namdye migate heigwaduswe kwa chipindi cha mazuwa mfungate. Zuwa dya nkongo mwa mazuwa ayo mfungate, namuse ugwadu wose mwezinyumba zenyu na hantu hohose mwe isi yenyu. <verse eid="EXO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 13:8" />Weye nauwagambile wanawo mwe dizuwa idyo, ukagamba ni kwachausa cha ayo Zumbe achidamanyize umo chikakulawa kwe isi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 13:9" />Fundo ino naitende enga lagiso mwe mikono yako na lukumbusa mwechinengo chako chani kugamba sigilizi ya Zumbe itende mo mlomo wako kwaviya Zumbe nakakusa ulawe Misili kwa mkono una nguvu. <verse eid="EXO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 13:10" />Namdamanye lukumbusa lwe ngasu ino mwe chipindi chikuligana chila mhilimo.”<verse eid="EXO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo yakumlanga mwelekwa ywa nkongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 13:11" />“Aho Zumbe nakwigale mwe isi ya Wakanani, saviya alagane na weye na wakale wako na kukwinka, <verse eid="EXO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 13:12" />nawike kwa Zumbe yudya mwelekwa ywa nkongo. Welekwa wose wankongo wo ludimo lwako yudya umgosi vyaungwa atende ywa Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 13:13" />Mna chila mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa mpunda na umkombole kwa ngoto uneva hunamkombole vyaungwa umvune isingo yakwe. Chila mwana chilume mgati mwa wanawo nomkombole. <verse eid="EXO 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 13:14" />Aho nyumani wanawo wakakuza, ‘Ni mbuli yani ino? Nowagambe, kwa udahi wa Zumbe kachusa Misili, kulaila mwenyumba yo utumwa. <verse eid="EXO 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 13:15" />Hadya Falao nakahiga akachilemeila chisekuhalawa, Zumbe kawakoma welekwa wankongo mwe isi ya Misili, hamwenga na mntu na mnyama. Vino nivyo vikuleka simlaviza Zumbe ntambiko chila mwana chilume ywa nkongo kwelekwa, mna chila mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa wanangu siwakombola. <verse eid="EXO 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 13:16" />Mbuli iyo naitende saviya hula mwe chinegwe chako na msipi kulongozi kwako kugamba kwa udahi wa Zumbe kuchilavya Misili.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mnala wa ingu dya moto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 13:17" />Hadya Falao eze awalekele wantu waite, Chohile hawalongoze kwa sila ya Wafilisiti, ukaleka idya injihi. Chohile agamba, “Wantu wano wadaha kudugana na nkondo na kuhitwila fanyanyi zawo na kuya Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 13:18" />Ivyo, Chohile kawalongoza wantu kwa kuzungulukila sila ya kwedijangwa, kwita kwe bahali ya Shamu. Waizulaeli wahalawa mwe isi ya Misili wakatenda wemalanya kale kwa nkondo. <verse eid="EXO 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 13:19" />Musa niyo aguha amavuha ya Yusufu saviya wamwelisize Yusufu henati kubanika wadamanye, akagamba, “Chohile nawezileni nyuwe, ivyo mwaungwa mguhe mavuha yangu kulaila hano.”<verse eid="EXO 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 13:20" />Awo watamba kulaila Sukosi, wazenga nkambi uko Esamu, mo mhaka wedijangwa. <verse eid="EXO 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 13:21" />Zumbe kaika kulongozi kwawo mnala wa ingu kwa nomsi, kuwalongoza mwe sila na mnala wa moto kwa neichilo, kuwenka ulangazi, chani wadahe kutamba msi na chilo. <verse eid="EXO 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 13:22" />Hata ivyo umnala we dingu hausike nomsi, hegu udya umnala wo moto hausike nechilo, kulongozi kwa Waizulaeli.<verse eid="EXO 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EXO 14" />
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli womboka Ibahali Shamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 14:1" />Akaheza, Zumbe kalonga na Musa, <verse eid="EXO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 14:2" />“Wagambile wantu wa Izulaeli wauye kunyuma, waike nkambi kulongozi kwa Pihahiloli, mgati mwo mzi wa Migidoli ne Ibahali ya Shamu, kulongozi kwa Balisefoni. Namzenge nkambi kulongozi kwakwe hajihi ne bahali. <verse eid="EXO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 14:3" />Kwaviya Falao nafanyanye, awo Waizulaeli wangadika mwe dijangwa nadyo diwachinda wasekudaha kufosa. <verse eid="EXO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 14:4" />Aho miye nanimtende Falao etende mta nkani, naye nawatimile. Miye nanehokeile ntunyo kwa kumbalanga Falao na wankondo wakwe wose. Aho Wamisili nawamanye kugamba miye ni miye Zumbe.” Waizulaeli watenda saivyo. <verse eid="EXO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 14:5" />Hadya Falao, eze eve kugamba Waizulaeli wasumka, uyo na vilongozi wakwe wahitwila fanyanyi zawo na kugamba, “Chitenda mbwani kuwalekeila Waizulaeli waite wasekuchisankanila vituhu?” <verse eid="EXO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 14:6" />Ivyo, Falao kamalanya myutuka yakwe ya nkondo ikubuluzwa ni falasi na wankondo wakwe. <verse eid="EXO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 14:7" />Kaguha myutuka yakwe yedi ya nkondo, magana mtandatu na myutuka yose mituhu ya nkondo ya Misili ikalongozwa ni vilongozi we nkondo. <verse eid="EXO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 14:8" />Zumbe kamtenda Falao kutenda mta nkani, niyo awatimila Waizulaeli wadya wendile nawahalawa Misili kwa ukankalu. <verse eid="EXO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 14:9" />Wamisili watimila mnyuma mwawo, falasi zose na myutuka ya Falao na wankondo wakwe watakukwela falasi na wankondo wakwe, nawo wawabwila wekala hadya hajihi ne bahali, hajihi na Pihahilosi, kulongozi kwa Balisefoni. <verse eid="EXO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 14:10" />Hadya Falao eze abule haguhi, Waizulaeli wengilwa ni nkama itendese wamwilila Zumbe awambize. <verse eid="EXO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 14:11" />Wamgamba Musa, “Togola, nendile hekwina mbila zilozize mwe isi ya Misili nivyo vilekile ukachigala chibanikile kwe dijangwa? Nimbwani ukachidamanyiza vino kuchilavya mwe isi ya Misili? <verse eid="EXO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 14:12" />Togola, hachikugambile izimbuli zino chichei Misili? Chakugambilaga uchileke chijendeleze kuwasankanila Wamisili. Nanivyedi kuwasankanila Wamisili ukaleka kubanikila kuno kwe dijangwa.”<verse eid="EXO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 14:13" />Musa awagamba Waizulaeli, “Msekogoha! Ikalani mtoge! Dyelo namwone ivyo Zumbe nawakombole. Kwaviya wano Wamisili mkuwawona vino dyelo hamuwawone vituhu. <verse eid="EXO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 14:14" />Zumbe nawagombeleni, nyuwe mnyamale du.” <verse eid="EXO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 14:15" />Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Nimbwani ukunila? Wagambe Waizulaeli wajendeleze kulongozi. <verse eid="EXO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 14:16" />Inula inkome yako nachulusa mlanga mwe bahali. Mazi nayepange haidi, ivyo Waizulaeli nawadahe komboka mgatigati mwe bahali hantu hanyaile. <verse eid="EXO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 14:17" />Miye naniwatende Wamisili watende na moyo mdala nawo nawawatimile mgatigati mwe bahali, wantu nawaninke ntogozi kujinkila ukukomwa kwa Falao na wankondo wakwe ne myutuka yakwe ye nkondo hamwenga na wakwela falasi wakwe. <verse eid="EXO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 14:18" />Wamisili nawamanye kugamba miye ni miye Zumbe. Hadya nanizile kumhuda Falao na wankondo wakwe hamwenga ne myutuka yakwe na wakwela falasi wakwe.”<verse eid="EXO 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 14:19" />Ivyo, Mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Chohile endile ekulongozi kwedibunga dya wantu wose wa Izulaeli ahalawaga niyo achimala kunyuma kwawo, udya umnala we dingu wasogelaga kulongozi kwawo niyo wachimila kunyuma kwawo, <verse eid="EXO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 14:20" />mnala uwo we idingu wekalaga hagatigati ha wagomba nkondo wa Misili na wantu wa Izulaeli, diya idingu diwajela chiza Wamisili mna diwalangaziza Waizulaeli nechilo. Ivyo, mabunga ayo maidi, wankondo wa Falao na bunga dya wankondo wa Waizulaeli hawasogeilane chilo chijima. <verse eid="EXO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 14:21" />Musa niyo achulusa umkono wakwe mlanga mwe bahali, Zumbe kaisindika ibahali kunyuma kwa nkung'unto ikulawa kwa mwenyemzi. Nkung'uto iyo ivumila chilo chijima niyo mazi yepanga haidi, hagati hakwe niyo hatenda hanyaile. <verse eid="EXO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 14:22" />Waizulaeli niyo womboka mgatigati mwe bahali hantu hanyaile, mazi nayakenga nkuta zikatenda kulume na kumoso. <verse eid="EXO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 14:23" />Wamisili wawatongela kwa kujinkila isi inyaile yendile imgatigati mwe bahali hamwenga na falasi zawo na myutuka yawo ye nkondo na wakwela falasi zawo zose. <verse eid="EXO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 14:24" />Haguhi no mtondo, Zumbe kakaula wankondo wa Wamisili kulaila mwe udya mnala wo moto na we dingu, kawajelesa nkama. <verse eid="EXO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 14:25" />Kayadidimiza maguludumu ye myutuka yawo, yatenda yadunduga ukujenda. Ivyo Wamisili wagamba, “Chiwasumke Waizulaeli. Zumbe awagombela Waizulaeli.” <verse eid="EXO 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 14:26" />Akaheza Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Chulusa umkono wako mlanga mwe bahali, chani mazi yauye na yawagubike Wamisili hamwenga ne myutuka yawo na wakwela falasi wawo.” <verse eid="EXO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 14:27" />Ivyo, Musa kachulusa umkono wakwe mlanga mwe bahali na eze kuche bahali yuya saviya yendaga. Wamisili wajeza kuyasumnka mazi mna Zumbe kawadidimiza mwe bahali. <verse eid="EXO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 14:28" />Mazi yauya yagubika imyutuka na wakwela falasi, wankondo wose wa Falao wendile wakawabalaza Waizulaeli wabanika mwe bahali. Hahonile hata Mmisili yumwenga. <verse eid="EXO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 14:29" />Mna Waizulaeli wajinka mnyaile mgatigati mwe bahali, mazi nayakenga nkuta zikatenda kulume na kumoso.<verse eid="EXO 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 14:30" />Ivyo nivyo Zumbe awakombolaga Waizulaeli mwe idizuwa idyo kulaila mo utumwa wa Wamisili, Waizulaeli wawawona Wamisili waumbala molujevu wabanika. <verse eid="EXO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 14:31" />Wazulaeli weze wawone imbuli iyo ya nguvu itendese adamanye Zumbe kwa Wamisili, wamzumila Zumbe na mndima ywakwe Musa.<verse eid="EXO 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EXO 15" />
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 15:1" />Elo, Musa hamwenga na Waizulaeli wamchemela Zumbe nchemo ino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:1">“Nani mchemele Zumbe kwaviya kahuda kwa chinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:1">falasi na mkwela falasi ywakwe kawadidimiza mwe bahali. <verse eid="EXO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 15:2" />Zumbe Chohile kaninka nguvu na udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">uyo mwenye nuyo anikombole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">Uyo ni Chohile ywangu miye, miye nanimtunye ni Chohile ywa tate miye nami nanimtogole. <verse eid="EXO 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 15:3" />Zumbe Chohile ni mkankalu ywa nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:3">Zumbe Chohile ni zina dyakwe.”<verse eid="EXO 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 15:4" />“Myutuka na wankondo wa Falao kawadidimiza mwe bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:4">vilongozi wakwe wasagulwe wadidimila mwe bahali ya Shamu.<verse eid="EXO 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 15:5" />Vina vya mazi viwagubika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:5">awadidimiza mwe bahali saviya yuwe.”<verse eid="EXO 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 15:6" />“Weye Zumbe Chohole mkono wako wa kulume watunywa kwa nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:6">kwa mkono wako wa kulume weye Zumbe kuwatowa wankondo. <verse eid="EXO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 15:7" />Kwa ukulu wako wawakoma wakondo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:7">wawalagaza hasi wadya wakuhigile kwa mpungile ya maya nayo yawoka saviya mabuwa. <verse eid="EXO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 15:8" />Kwa kuvila muye wako mawimbi ya mazi yenulwa molanga yachimala, saviya nkuta ne vina mgatigati mwe bahali niyo yaganda. <verse eid="EXO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 15:9" />Mnkondo kelongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">‘Naniwatimile na kuwagwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">nanipagule ugoli wawo na nkwina yangu isile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">Nanikwese idibamba dyangu na kuguha vyose wananavyo.’ <verse eid="EXO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 15:10" />Mna weye kuvumiza nkung'unto yako na bahali iwagubika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:10">Wadidimila mwa mazi yalozize saviya yuwe.”<verse eid="EXO 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 15:11" />“Weye Zumbe Chohile ni yuhi mgati mwa mazumbe aligane na weye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">Ni yuhi eli saweye mkuka mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">ukutisa kwa ntendwa zikukile, ukudamanya mbuli za maula? <verse eid="EXO 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 15:12" />Nakuchulusa umkono wako wa kulume una nguvu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:12">isi niyo yawamela wankondo wetu. <verse eid="EXO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 15:13" />Kwa wedi wako kuwalongoza wantu uwakombole, na kwa nguvu zako kuwalongoza ko wikazi wako utondowale. <verse eid="EXO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 15:14" />Wantu hewemmanyize Chohile wayeva ayo wazingiza kwa nkama, wekazi wa Filisitiya wengilwa ni woga. <verse eid="EXO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 15:15" />Wakulu wa Edomu wehelwa, vilongozi wa Moabu wengilwa ni chiholo chikulu, wekazi wose wa Kanani wafa chevu. <verse eid="EXO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 15:16" />Nkama na woga ziwengila. Kwachausa cha ukulu we zinguvu zako, wowo wanyamala dwi saviya yuwe, kubula wantu wako weye Zumbe Chohile, wajinke, heye, kubula wantu awo ukombole wawajinke. <verse eid="EXO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 15:17" />Weye nowegale wantu wako na kuwaika mo lugulu lwako, hadya usagule weye Zumbe Chohile hatende wikazi wako, hantu hakukile uzengile kwa mikono yako. <verse eid="EXO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 15:18" />Weye, Zumbe Chohile, naulongoze mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="EXO 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya Miliyamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 15:19" />Umo falasi za Falao ne myutuka yakwe hamwenga na wakwela falasi wakwe weze wengile hantu hanyaile mwe bahali, Zumbe kayavuza amazi ye bahali yawagubika. Mna Waizulaeli wajendeleza kujenda hanyaile mgatiagati mwe bahali. <verse eid="EXO 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 15:20" />Ivyo Muwoni Miliyamu, lumbudye dya Haluni, kaguha kagoma momkono na wavyele watuhu wose wamtimila wakatenda na wagoma wawo wakavina. <verse eid="EXO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 15:21" />Miliyamu kawalongoza kuchema, “Mchemeleni Zumbe kwaviya kadidimiza kwa wefenyi, falasi na mkwela falasi ywakwe kawajela mwe bahali.”<verse eid="EXO 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mazi Yesungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 15:22" />Akaheza, Musa kawalongoza Waizulaeli kulaila bahali ya Shamu, waita kubula kwe dijangwa dya Shuli. Niyo watamba kwa chipindi cha mazuwa matatu mwedijangwa hehena kuwona mazi. <verse eid="EXO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 15:23" />Weze wabule hantu hakwitangwa Mala, wadunduga kunywa mazi ya Mala kwaviya nendile yesungu. Kwachausa icho hantu hadya hetangwa Mala. <verse eid="EXO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 15:24" />Ivyo wantu wamwila Musa, wakagamba, “Chinywe mbwani?” <verse eid="EXO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 15:25" />Musa kamlombeza Zumbe Chohile, na Zumbe kamlagisa chihande cha kaziti, kachidula mwa mazi na mazi yatenda yempeho. Uko Zumbe kawenka sigilizi na kuwajeza awone hegu nawamzumile. <verse eid="EXO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 15:26" />Akawagamba, “Uneva mnanetegeleza miye Zumbe Chohile ywenyu na kudamanya yedi kulongozi kwangu na kutoza malagiso yangu yose, ivyo, miye saniwegaile yadya manyonje niwegaile Wamisili. Kwaviya, miye nuyo Zumbe Chohile huwahonyani nyuwe.” <verse eid="EXO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 15:27" />Akaheza Waizulaeli wabula uko Elimu kudya kwendile na sokwe mlongo na mbili na mitende milongo mfungate. Waika nkambi yawo uko haguhi na mazi.<verse eid="EXO 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EXO 16" />
  <para style="s">Nkande ikwitangwa Mana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 16:1" />Wantu wose wa Waizulaeli niyo watamba kulaila Elimu na kubula kwedijangwa Sini dendaga hagati hemizi ya Elimu na Sinai. Idyo dyendaga zuwa dya mlongo na shano dyo mwezi wa kaidi kukongela weze wakulawe kwe isi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 16:2" />Ivyo, wantu wose wa Waizulaeli niyo wawag'ung'uzikila Musa na Haluni uko kwedijangwa, <verse eid="EXO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 16:3" />wakagamba vino, “Navibuka mwile hegu Zumbe Chohile achikomaga umo nachikekala kwe isi ya Misili, uko nachikeguta kwa kudya nyama na migate. Mna nyuwe mchigala kuno kwe dijangwa mchikome na sala wantu wose!” <verse eid="EXO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 16:4" />Zumbe niyo amgamaba Musa, “Miye naniwanyesezeni fula ya migate kulaila kwe mbingu. Chila zuwa wantu nawafose na kuchisanya nkande ya zuwa idyo. Kwa sila ino nani wajeze nikaule hegu nawazitimile izisigilizi zangu hegu hawa zitimile. <verse eid="EXO 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 16:5" />Mna mwe dizuwa dya mtandatu, umo wakamalanya nkande wachisanye, wamalanye nkanana mbili ye nkande ya chila zuwa.”<verse eid="EXO 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 16:6" />Musa na Haluni Niyo wawagamba wantu wose wa Izulaeli, “Chisingi, nammanye kugamba Zumbe Chohile nuyo awalavize mwe isi ya Misili! <verse eid="EXO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 16:7" />Naho, luvi mtondo, namuwone ukulu wa Zumbe Chohile kwaviya keva mang'ung'uziko yenyu mkumng'ung'uzikila. Suwe chiwahi kubula mching'ungu'zikile?” <verse eid="EXO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 16:8" />Naho Musa awagambile, “Chisingi, Zumbe Chohile na wenkeni nyama mdye, mtondo na wenkeni migate mdye mwigute, kwaviya uyo keva amang'ung'uziko mkumng'ung'uzikila. Suwe chiwahi kubula mching'ung'uzikile? Msekuching'ungu'zikila suwe mna mng'ung'uzikileni Zumbe.” <verse eid="EXO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 16:9" />Akaheza Musa amgamba Haluni, “Wagambile wantu wose wa Waizulaeli weze wadugane na kuchimala kulongozi kwa Zumbe kwaviya keva ukung'ungu'zika kwenyu.” <verse eid="EXO 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 16:10" />Umo Haluni akalonga na wantu wa Izulaeli, niyo wantu wose wakaula uko kwe dijangwa, aho ukulu wa Zumbe Chohile uwoneka mwe ingu. <verse eid="EXO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 16:11" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="EXO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 16:12" />“Mang'ung'uziko ya Waizulaeli siyeva. Ivyo, wagambileni kugamba chipindi cha chisingi nawadye nyama, na mtondo nawadye migate nakwiguta. Naho nammanye kugamba miye ni Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu.” <verse eid="EXO 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 16:13" />Ivyo, chipindi cha chisingi nakwiza nkwale zilozese, zagubika inkambi ya Waizulaeli. Mtondo kulaila mnyuzu, mlanga mwe nkambi yawo yose. <verse eid="EXO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 16:14" />Hadya mnyuzu wize unyale, uko kwedijangwa kwasigaila chintu enga mgate msisili uhuhile. <verse eid="EXO 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 16:15" />Waizulaeli weze wawone ichintu icho wehelwa, wauzana, “Chino ni chibwani?” Hawa chimanyize chendaga chibwani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 16:15">Musa awagamba, “Ino ni nkande idya Zumbe Chohile awenkileni mdye. <verse eid="EXO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 16:16" />Zumbe Chohile kalagiza, chila mntu achisanye mafumba maidi akudaha kudya chila mntu emwedihema dyakwe.”<verse eid="EXO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 16:17" />Waizulaeli niyo wadamanya saivyo, watuhu wachisanya ilozese watuhu wachisanya mijeche. <verse eid="EXO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 16:18" />Mna weze wahime chihimo wachisanye, wabunkula kugamba achisanye ilozese nahana chongezekele na yudya achisanye mijeche hahungukilwe. Chila yumwenga nakachisanya chihimo akudaha kudya. <verse eid="EXO 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 16:19" />Musa awagamba, “Mntu yoyose asekusigaza nkande kubula mtondo.” <verse eid="EXO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 16:20" />Mna wantu awamwenga hawamwivile Musa, wasigaza nkande kubula mtondo. Mna mtondo nkande iyo iwola yabwanda ntende. Musa niyo awehiwa wantu. <verse eid="EXO 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 16:21" />Ivyo, chila mtondo nawachisanya nkande chihimo chiya mntu akungwa adye. Zuwa dize dikwele ditenda kali, idya inkande intuhu yalolomoka.<verse eid="EXO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 16:22" />Mwe dizuwa dya mtandatu, Waizulaeli wachisanya nkande iyo nkanana mbili, mafumba maidi kwa chila mntu. Ivyo, wadalahala wose wa Izulaeli niyo wambasa Musa, wamgambila imbuli iyo. <verse eid="EXO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 16:23" />Musa awagamba, “Dino ni lagizo dya Zumbe. Luvi ni Zuwa dya Kuhumula, ni Humulo dikukile dya Zumbe. Ivyo, hitani mkambike hegu kupwasa idya inkande mkunga mdye dyelo, naisigale ikeni kubula luvi.” <verse eid="EXO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 16:24" />Niyo, wadamanya saviya Musa alagise waileka idya inkande intuhu kubula luvi dyakwe. Mtondo wakwe wawona kugamba haibanike naho haikubwanda ntende. <verse eid="EXO 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 16:25" />Musa awagamba, “Dyani ino isigale kwaviya dyelo ni zuwa dya Zumbe Chohile. Dyelo hamwinkwe nkande uko kuse. <verse eid="EXO 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 16:26" />Namchisanya nkande ino kwa mazuwa mtandatu, mna zuwa dya mfungate ni Zuwa dya Kuhumula, haiwoneke.”<verse eid="EXO 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 16:27" />Mwe zuwa dya mfungate wantu watuhu niyo wafosa waite wakachisanye nkande, mna hawailondole. <verse eid="EXO 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 16:28" />Niyo Zumbe Chohile alonga na Musa, “Namlelmele miko na sigilizi zangu kubula ini? <verse eid="EXO 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 16:29" />Manyani kugamba miye Zumbe Chohile, siwenkani Zuwa dya Kuhumula, nivyo vikuleka siwenkani nkande ya mazuwa maidi mwe zuwa dya mtandatu. Ivyo, humulani chila mntu mwenyumba yakwe, mntu yoyose asekufosa mwedizuwa dya mfungate.” <verse eid="EXO 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 16:30" />Ivyo, wantu wahumula mwezuwa dya mfungate. <verse eid="EXO 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 16:31" />Waizulaeli waitanga inkande iyo “Mana.” Nendile ikenga mbeyu ya uhemba ung'aile na mwile wakwe naukenga mgate msisili ujeligwe lude. <verse eid="EXO 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 16:32" />Musa awagamba, “Dino ni lagizo dya Zumbe alagize, Guhani mafumba maidi ya mana myaike kwachausa cha lweleko lwenyu, chani wawone nkande nahawalisani nyuwe kwedijangwa umo nawalavyaga mwe isi ya Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 16:33" />Musa amgamba Haluni, “Guha debe mndani mwakwe ujele chihimo chimwenga cha mana uike kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, itende kwa chausa cha welekwa wenyu.” <verse eid="EXO 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 16:34" />Haluni niyo aika imana hantu hakukile kulongozi kwedishanduku dye dilagano chani ikigwe saviya Zumbe Chohile amsigile Musa. <verse eid="EXO 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 16:35" />Waizulaeli wadya mana kwa chipindi cha mihilimo milongo mine, kubula weze wabule mwe isi ikuwagila kwikala, kugamba isi ya Kanani. <verse eid="EXO 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 16:36" />Icho chihimo che mana chendaga ni fungu dya mlongo ikwitangwa efa.<verse eid="EXO 16:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EXO 17" />
  <para style="s">Mazi kulaila mwe luwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 17:1" />Wantu wose wa Izulaeli niyo watamba kulaila kwedijangwa nkacho kwa nkacho kubula Sini, saviya walagizwe ni Zumbe Chohile. Waika nkambi uko Lefidimu. Mna uko hakwendaga na mazi ya kunywa. <verse eid="EXO 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 17:2" />Ivyo wantu wamfuzumila Musa wamgamba, “Chinke mazi chinywe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 17:2">Musa niyo awauza, “Nimbwani mkunifuzumila miye? Nimbwani mwamjeza Zumbe Chohile?” <verse eid="EXO 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 17:3" />Mna wose wendaga wana nchilu, wamfuzumila Musa wamgamba, “Nimbwani kuchilavya kwe isi ya Misili uchikome kwa nchilu suwe chose na wenetu noludimo lwetu?”<verse eid="EXO 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 17:4" />Ivyo, Musa niyo amlombeza Zumbe Chohile amgamba, “Nani wadamanyize mbwani wantu wano? Wehaguhi kunitowa mayuwe!”<verse eid="EXO 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 17:5" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba Musa, “Jinka kulongozi kwa wantu wano guha wakale wa Izulaeli. Momkono wako guha inkome idya watoilaga umto wa Naili. <verse eid="EXO 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 17:6" />Kaula miye nanichimale kulongozi kwako mlanga mwe luwe aho Holebu iviya lwetangwa Sinai, towa uluwe ulo mazi nayalawe umo chani wantu wose wanywe.” Musa niyo adamanya ivyo kulongozi kwa wakale wa Izulaeli.<verse eid="EXO 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 17:7" />Hantu aho Musa kahetanga “Masa” na “Meliba”, kwaviya Waizulaeli wamfuzumila na kumjeza Zumbe Chohile wakagamba, “Togola, chindedi Zumbe Chohile ehamwenga na suwe?”<verse eid="EXO 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkondo na Waamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 17:8" />Waamaleki weza na kutowana na Waizulaeli uko Lefidimu. <verse eid="EXO 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 17:9" />Musa amgamba Yoshuwa, “Sagula wagosi wite utowane na Waamaleki. Luvi nanichimale kulanga kolunenengwe lwa kagulu, hatenda nenkome ya Chohile mo mkono wangu.” <verse eid="EXO 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 17:10" />Ivyo, Yoshuwa kadamanya saviya Musa alongile, kaita katowana na Waamaleki. Musa na Haluni na Huli niyo wakwela kolunenengwe lwa kagulu. <verse eid="EXO 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 17:11" />Chipindi chose Musa enule umkono wakwe kulanga, Waizulaeli wahuda. Mna anauseleza umkono wakwe, Waamaleki wawahuda. <verse eid="EXO 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 17:12" />Mna mikono ya Musa niyo yasokela. Ivyo Haluni na Huli wenula yuwe wadika haguhi naye niyo adikaila. Wakaheza watoza na kuinula imikono yakwe, yumwenga kenula umkono wa kulume na mtuhu mkono wa kumoso. Ivyo mikono ya Musa isigala itoga ikatenda inulwa kulanga kubula zuwa dikengila. <verse eid="EXO 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 17:13" />Yoshuwa na wantu wakwe wawahuda kwa kuwasengasenga mabamba Waamaleki.<verse eid="EXO 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 17:14" />Akaheza Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Wandika imbuli ino mwe chitabu, itende lukumbusa. Naho mgambile Yoshuwa eve kugamba, naniwabinde pele Waamaleki mwe isi.” <verse eid="EXO 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 17:15" />Musa niyo achisanya chuga cha mayuwe cha kulaviza ntambiko nakuchitanga “Zumbe Chohile ni Bendela yangu”, <verse eid="EXO 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 17:16" />agamba, “Inulani ibendela ya Zumbe Chohile! Zumbe Chohile nagombe nkondo na Waamaleki cheleko kwa cheleko.”<verse eid="EXO 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EXO 18" />
  <para style="s">Jetilo Amtalamkila Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 18:1" />Jetilo, mlavyantambiko ywa Midiyani, mkwewe dya Musa, evaga izimbuli zose ziya Zumbe amdamanyize Musa na Waizulaeli wantu wakwe umo akawausa mwe isi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 18:2" />Ivyo Jetilo niyo amguha Zipola mkaza Musa, kwaviya Musa amvuzaga kwa ise, <verse eid="EXO 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 18:3" />hamwenga na wana waidi wa Musa. Mwana uyumwenga naketangwa Gelishomu. Musa kamwinka zina dino kwaviya kagamba, “Sisumkila mwe si njeni.” <verse eid="EXO 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 18:4" />Zina dya mwana umtuhu naketagwa Eliazali, kwaviya nakagamba, “Chohile ywa tate nendile ni mwambizi ywangu, anikombolaga nisekukomwa ni Falao.” <verse eid="EXO 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 18:5" />Jetilo mkwewe dya Musa hamwenga na mkaza Musa na wana wa Musa, wambasa Musa uko kwedijangwa uko aikaga nkambi mo lugulu lwa Chohile. <verse eid="EXO 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 18:6" />Musa eze agambilwe kugamba mkwewe hamwenga na mkaziwe na wanawe waidi weza, <verse eid="EXO 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 18:7" />Musa niyo afosa aita akumsingila mkwewe, amwinamila na kumkubatila. Walamsana, wakaheza wengila mwe dihema. <verse eid="EXO 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 18:8" />Musa kamgambila mkwewe mbuli zose Zumbe Chohile amtendile Falao na Wamisili kwachausa cha Waizulaeli. Iviya kamgambila mbuli zose za nkunto wapatile mwe ntambo na ivyo Zumbe Chohile awambuleni. <verse eid="EXO 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 18:9" />Jetilo niyo elelwa kwa yose Zumbe Chohile adamanye kwachausa cha Waizulaeli, kwa kuwambula mo utumwa wa Wamisili. <verse eid="EXO 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 18:10" />Jetilo agamba, “Mtunyeni Zumbe Chohile yudya awambuleni mo utumwa wa Wamisili na kulaila mo utumwa wa Falao. <verse eid="EXO 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 18:11" />Haluse simanya kugamba Zumbe Chohile ni mkulu kujinka milungu yose, kwaviya kawambula wantu wano mo utumwa wa Wamisili wawadamanyizaga wihi.” <verse eid="EXO 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 18:12" />Jetilo mkwewe dya Musa niyo, amlaviza Chohile lavyo dya kutikimya na ntambiko. Haluni niyo eza hamwenga na wakale wose wa Izulaeli chani wadye nkande hamwenga na Jetilo kwa kumtunya Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="EXO 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa asagula wata kukantila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 18:13" />Mtondo wakwe, Musa niyo ekala kulamwila milosi ya Waizulaeli. Nawo nawachimala wamzunguluka, kukongela mtondo kubula chisingi. <verse eid="EXO 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 18:14" />Jetilo mkwewe dya Musa, eze awone izimbuli zose ziya Musa awatendele Waizulaeli, amuza, “Nimbwani ukuwatendela wantu mbuli zino? Nimbwani walamuila ichedu, wantu wose wakuzunguluka kukongela mtondo kubula chisingi?”<verse eid="EXO 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 18:15" />Musa amhitula, “Kwaviya wantu weza kwangu kuza mbuli akunga Chohile. <verse eid="EXO 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 18:16" />Wakatenda wana nkumbizi yoyose weza kwangu, nami nawalamwila mntu na mnyawe na kuwahinya malagiso ya Chohile na miko yakwe.” <verse eid="EXO 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 18:17" />Elo, Jetilo amgamba Musa, “Ivyo ukudamanya sivyo vyedi! <verse eid="EXO 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 18:18" />Nowesokeze wemwenye na wano wantu. Kwaviya ino ni ndima ndala hukwidaha kuidamanya ichedu. <verse eid="EXO 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 18:19" />Tegeleza ulangilizi wedi, Chohile atende hamwenga na weye. Weye wachimaile wantu kulongozi kwa Chohile na kumwigaila Chohile mbuli za mankunto yawo. <verse eid="EXO 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 18:20" />Ivyo wahinye malagiso na miko ya Chohile na kuwalagiza ivyo wakungwa kwikala na kudamanya. <verse eid="EXO 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 18:21" />Mna mwe mbuli ntuhu, sagula mgati mwa wantu wose, wantu wata udahi, wantu wakumvikila Chohile, wachindedi na wakwihiwa upati wa kubunyanya. Wenke awo udahi, watende na ndima ya kuwachimaila wantu mwe mabunga ya wantu mlongo gana, gana, milongo mishano na mlongo. <verse eid="EXO 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 18:22" />Awo nawo nawatende na vitala chila zuwa kulaha mbuli za wantu. Milosi midala na wakwigaile weye, mna idya imihufu na waibinde wenye. Kwa sila iyo naudahe kuhufya ndima yako kwaviya nawambizane na weye mwe indima iyo. <verse eid="EXO 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 18:23" />Una damanya ivyo, naho Chohile nivyo akunga, nodahe kutoga, wantu wano wose na wadahe kuya kwawo kwa utondowazi.”<verse eid="EXO 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 18:24" />Musa ketegeleza ulangilizi wa mkwewe na kudamanya savivya agambilwe. <verse eid="EXO 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 18:25" />Ivyo, Kawasagula wantu wata udahi mgati mwa Waizulaeli, kawaika kutenda vilongozi wa mabunga ya wantu gana mlongo, wantu gana, milongo mishano na wantu mlongo. <verse eid="EXO 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 18:26" />Niyo watenda walamuzi wa mbuli za wantu chila zuwa. Milosi midala wamwigaila Musa, mna chila milosi mihufu walamula wowo wenye.<verse eid="EXO 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 18:27" />Akaheza Musa niyo alagana na mkwewe, naye Jetilo kauya kwe isi yakwe.<verse eid="EXO 18:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EXO 19" />
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli kolugulu lwa Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 19:1" />Zuwa dya nkongo dya mwezi wa katatu kukongela walaile mwe isi ya Misili, wantu wa Izulaeli wabula kwedijangwa dya Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 19:2" />Weze wakulawe Lefidimu na kubula kwedijangwa dya Sinai, uko waika nkambi kulongozi ko lugulu lwa Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 19:3" />Musa niyo akwela kolugulu kudugana na Chohile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 19:3">Zumbe niyo amwitanga Musa kulaila kulanga ko lugulu, amgamba, “Vino nivyo nowagambile welekwa wa Yakobo, awo Waizulaeli, <verse eid="EXO 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 19:4" />‘Nyuwe wenye muwona ivyo niwatendile Wamisili na ivyo niwaguhile saviya gushu dikuguha wanawe mwa mawawa, siwegala kwangu. <verse eid="EXO 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 19:5" />Haluse, uneva mneva idizwi dyangu na kutoza idilagano dyangu, namtende wantu wangu wasagulwe mgati mwa wantu wose, kwaviya wantu wose ni wangu. <verse eid="EXO 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 19:6" />Kwangu namtende uzumbe wa walavyantambiko na isi ikukile.’ Niyo imbuli yangu nowagambile Waizulaeli.” <verse eid="EXO 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 19:7" />Elo, Musa niyo auya, awetanga wadalahala wa Waizulaeli na kuwagambila milosi iyo asigilwe ni Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="EXO 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 19:8" />Wantu wose wetikila hamwenga wakagamba, “Nachidamanye mbuli zose alongile Zumbe Chohile.” Musa kamgambila Zumbe Chohile, hitulo idyo dya wantu. <verse eid="EXO 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 19:9" />Zumbe Chohile amgamba Musa, “Nanize kwako mweingu dizamile chani Waizulaeli weve halonga na weye na kukuzumila mazuwa yose.” Akaheza Musa amgambila Zumbe Chohile ivyo wantu walongile. <verse eid="EXO 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 19:10" />Zumbe Chohile amgamba Musa, “Hita ukawalenguse wantu dyelo na luvi. Wagambe wafule suche zawo, <verse eid="EXO 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 19:11" />watende wemalanya mwezuwa dyakatatu, kwaviya zuwa idyo dya katatu miye Zumbe Chohile nanisele mlanga mo lugulu lwa Sinai kulongozi kwa wantu wose. <verse eid="EXO 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 19:12" />Naho weye nowaikiye wantu mhaka kuzunguluka ulugulu. Wafunde wasinyise chani wasekukwela kulanga kolugulu na kujinka umhaka wakwe. Yoyose nasogeile ulugulu, nakomwe. <verse eid="EXO 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 19:13" />Mntu asekumdonta uyo mntu adontile ulugulu. Namdonte nakomwe kwa kutoigwa mayuwe hegu kutungwa msale. Atende ni mntu hegu mnyama, hekale. Chipindi gunda dikatoigwa ulonaulo, wantu wose naho nawasogele ko lugulu.”<verse eid="EXO 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 19:14" />Musa niyo asela hasi ho lugulu na kuwabasa wantu, kawalengusa, nawo wafula suche zawo. <verse eid="EXO 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 19:15" />Akaheza awagamba wantu wose, “Chisindo mtende mwemalanya, mgosi yoyose asekugona na mvyele.”<verse eid="EXO 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 19:16" />Ivyo, mtondo zuwa dya katatu, kulaila mlulumo na mbaula na ingu dizamile mlanga mo lugulu. Niyo kwevika izwi kulu dya gunda, idyo diwatenda wantu wose mwenkambi wazingiza kwa woga. <verse eid="EXO 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 19:17" />Akaheza Musa awalongoza wantu kulaila mwe nkambi, waita wabwilane na Chohile. Wose waita niyo wachimala hasi ho lugulu. <verse eid="EXO 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 19:18" />Lugulu lose lwa Sinai na lugubikwa ni mosi kwaviya Zumbe Chohile nakasela mlanga mwakwe mwemoto. Mosi wo moto uwo ukwela kulanga saviya mosi wa tanuli kulu, lugulu lose lusingisika kwa nguvu. <verse eid="EXO 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 19:19" />Izwi dyedigunda dyongezekela, Musa alonga na Chohile. Chohile naye amhitula kwa mlulumo. <verse eid="EXO 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 19:20" />Zumbe Chohile kasela kulaila ko lunenegwe lo lugulu lwa Sinai, niyo amwitanga Musa kulaila uko kulanga, ivyo Musa niyo akwela kulanga. <verse eid="EXO 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 19:21" />Akaheza Zumbe Chohile amgamba Musa, “Sela hasi kawafunde wantu wose wasekujinka umhaka kwiza kuniwona. Hegu sivyo nawabanike walozize. <verse eid="EXO 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 19:22" />Hata walavyantambiko wakunizila welenguse, hegu sivyo naniwabalange.”<verse eid="EXO 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 19:23" />Musa amgamba Zumbe Chohile, “Wantu wano hawakudaha kukwela ulugulu lwa Sinai, kwaviya weye na kuchilagiza chike mhaka kuzunguluka ulugulu lukukile.”<verse eid="EXO 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 19:24" />Zumbe Chohile ahitula, “Sela hasi ukaheza kwela hamwenga na Haluni. Mna usekuwalekeila walavyantambiko na wantu watuhu wajinke umhaka weze kwangu, hegu sivyo naniwabalange.” <verse eid="EXO 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 19:25" />Ivyo, Musa asela hasi na kuwagambila wantu mbuli zose alagizwe.<verse eid="EXO 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EXO 20" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo Mlongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 20:1" />Chohile kalonga milosi yose ino akagamba,<verse eid="EXO 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 20:2" />“Miye nuyo Zumbe, Chohile ywako, hulavize mwe isi ya Misili, kudya wendile mtumwa.”<verse eid="EXO 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 20:3" />“Use kutenda na milungu mituhu mna miye.”<verse eid="EXO 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 20:4" />“Usekwedamanyiza tukulu, hegu mligano wa chintu chochose chikulanga kwembingu, hegu chimweisi hegu mndani mwa mazi hasi he isi. <verse eid="EXO 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 20:5" />Usekudivikila hegu kudisankanila, kwaviya miye Zumbe, Chohile ywako, ni Chohile mta chinyulu. Nawatimila wana masa ya watati zawo, hata cheleko cha katatu na cha kane cha awo wakunihiwa. <verse eid="EXO 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 20:6" />Mna nanilagise ungi wangu vyeleko magana mlongo ya wadya wakununga na kutoza malagizo yangu.”<verse eid="EXO 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 20:7" />“Usekuditaja vyabule idizina dya Zumbe, Chohile ywako. Kwaviya miye Zumbe Chohile sanileke kumkantila akujeseza idizina dyangu vihiye.”<verse eid="EXO 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 20:8" />“Kumbukani Zuwa dya Kuhumula na kudilenguse. <verse eid="EXO 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 20:9" />Mazuwa mtandatu damanya ndima naho udamanye ndima zako zose. <verse eid="EXO 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 20:10" />Mna zuwa dya mfungate ni Zuwa dya Kuhumula ya Zumbe, Chohile ywako. Zuwa idyo usekudamanya ndima yoyose, weye, hegu mwanawo hegu mndele ywako hegu mtumwa ywako hegu wandima wako wa chivyele hegu mnyama ywako wa ludimo hegu mjeni emwe nyumbako. <verse eid="EXO 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 20:11" />Kwaviya zuwa dya mtandatu miye Zumbe Chohile nazumbaga izimbingu ne isi, bahali na vyose viyumo, haheza sihumula zuwa dya mfungate. Ivyo miye Zumbe Chohile situnya Zuwa dya Kuhumula na kudilengusa.”<verse eid="EXO 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 20:12" />“Watunye tati yako na mami yako chani wikale wikazi mtali mwe isi hukwinka miye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako.”<verse eid="EXO 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 20:13" />“Usekukoma.”<verse eid="EXO 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 20:14" />“Usekugonya.”<verse eid="EXO 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 20:15" />“Usekubawa.”<verse eid="EXO 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 20:16" />“Usekumlongela lulimi mntu yoyose.”<verse eid="EXO 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 20:17" />“Usekutamila nyumba ya mbuyayo hegu mkaziwe hegu mtumwa ywakwe ywa chilume hegu ywa chivyele hegu ng'ombe yakwe hegu mpunda yakwe hegu chochose chiya ananacho mbuyayo.”<verse eid="EXO 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Woga wa wantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 20:18" />Wantu weze weve umlulumo na kuwona lumwemwe lukwaka na kwiva izwi dye digunda kulanga ko lugulu lwendile lukavunka mosi, wose wogoha na kuzingiza. Wose wachimaila hale, <verse eid="EXO 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 20:19" />wamgamba Musa, “Longa na suwe weye mwenye, suwe na chikwetegeleze mna chogoha Zumbe Chohile analonga na suwe nachibanike.” <verse eid="EXO 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 20:20" />Musa kawagambila wantu, “Msekogoha, kwaviya Chohile keza kuwajeza chani mumogohe msekumkola masa.”<verse eid="EXO 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 20:21" />Wantu wose nawachimaila hale umo Musa asogeile diya ingu titu dizamile Chohile andile.<verse eid="EXO 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi za chisunga cha mayuwe ya kulaviza ntambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 20:22" />Zumbe Chohile kamgamba Musa, Wagambe Waizulaeli, “Mwewonela wenye kugamba silonga na nyuwe kulaila kwembingu. <verse eid="EXO 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 20:23" />Mnivikile miye du, msekuvikila milungu ya hela hegu zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 20:24" />Nyuwe namnizengele chisungu cho ulongo icho mlanga mwakwe namnivikile ngoto zenyu na ng'ombe zenyu saviya malavyo ya kutikimya na malavyo ya utondowazi. Hantu hose naniwakumbuse wantu zina dyangu, aho miye naniwezile na kuwajimbika. <verse eid="EXO 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 20:25" />Uneva mnanizengela chisungu cha mayuwe, msekuchidamanya kwa mayuwe ya kusongola, kwaviya mnajeseza viya vya kusongwela hachiwagile kwangu. <verse eid="EXO 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 20:26" />Msekunizengela chisungu china vifigwe vya kukweila, lusi lwake lunase kuwonwa umo emlanga mwakwe.”<verse eid="EXO 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EXO 21" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo yakulanga Watumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 21:1" />“Malagizo yano nayo nowenke Waizulaeli. <verse eid="EXO 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 21:2" />Ukamgula mtumwa ywa Chiebulaniya nakudamanyize ndima kwa mihilimo mtandatu mna mo mhilimo wa mfungate mlekele ahalawe, ukaleka kumliha. <verse eid="EXO 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 21:3" />Uneva nakagulwa henati kusola nahalawe ichedu. Mna uneva nakeza na mkaziwe, ivyo nahalawe na mkaziwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 21:4" />Uneva sekulu ywakwe nakamloza mvyele, kamwelekela wana wa chivyele hegu wa chigosi, ivyo, uyo mvyele na wanawe na watende ugoli wa uyo sekulu ywakwe, nauyo mtumwa nahalawe ichedu. <verse eid="EXO 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 21:5" />Mna umtumwa uyo analonga molumpe amunga sekulu ywakwe, mkaziwe na wanawe hakunga kuhalawa na kulekelwa, <verse eid="EXO 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 21:6" />ivyo, sekulu ywakwe namwigale kulongozi kwe nyumba yo kumvikila Chohile na kumwigala holwivi hegu homfumbati wo lwivi, sekulu ywakwe na adimponkole idigutwi dyakwe kwa mtunga naho namdamanyize ndima mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="EXO 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 21:7" />“Mntu anamtaga mndele ywakwe kutenda mtumwa, uyo halekelwe saviya mtumwa ywa chigosi. <verse eid="EXO 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 21:8" />Uneva uyo sekulu ywakwe nakamgula atende yumwe mwa wakazize, uneva hanatamilwe, uyo sekulu namleke ise dya uyo mtumwa amkombole. Uyo sekulu hakungwa amtage kwa wantu watuhu, kwaviya natende kaswesa ukanuni kwa ise dya uyo mndele. <verse eid="EXO 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 21:9" />Uneva anaunga amloze kwa mwanawe uyo umndele umtumwa namdamanyize umtumwa uyo saviya mndele ywakwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 21:10" />Uneva sekulu anasola mvyele mtuhu, aungwa ajendeleze kumchintiza mkaziwe ywe nkongo kwa nkande na suche na chila chikungwa mwe nyinka. <verse eid="EXO 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 21:11" />Uneva sekulu hana mdamanyize vitegane ne milosi iyo mitatu, mvyele uyo nalekelwa ahalawe, mna sekulu halihwe maliho yoyose kulaila kwa ise dya uyo mndele.”<verse eid="EXO 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi yakulanga ubanasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 21:12" />“Yoyose akumtowa mntu na kumkoma, naye nakomwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 21:13" />Mna uneva hamkomile kasidi mna ni kwa kuhoswa, uyo mkomi adaha kusumkila kwedi hantu naniwasaguileni. <verse eid="EXO 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 21:14" />Mna mntu anamtowa mnyawe kasidi na kumkoma kwa ubala, hata uneva anasumkila kwe nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko, namumlavye uko na kumkoma.”<verse eid="EXO 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 21:15" />“Akumtowa ise hegu nine aungwa akomwe.”<verse eid="EXO 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 21:16" />“Akumtaha mntu chani amtage hegu kumtenda mtumwa ywakwe aungwa akomwe.”<verse eid="EXO 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 21:17" />“Akumligita ise hegu nine aungwa akomwe.”<verse eid="EXO 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 21:18" />“Wantu waidi wakalemana, yumwenga amtowa mnyawe yuwe hegu ihi mna hamkomile, kamlumiza du, vyamtenda augule na kuzagwa mo lusazi, <verse eid="EXO 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 21:19" />uneva uyo atoigwe anahona na kudaha kujendela kome, uyo amlumize nalekelwe. Mna, amlihe maliho ye chipindi chiya azagingwe mo lusazi, naho amuguze ahone.”<verse eid="EXO 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 21:20" />“Mntu ana mtowa mtumwa ywakwe ywa chilume hegu msuntaviya ywake kwa nkome ahadya niyo amkoma, aho nakantilwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 21:21" />Mna uyo mtumwa anatenda mjima kwa zuwa dimwenga hegu maidi, sekulu ywakwe hakantilwe, kwaviya uyo nendile ni ywakwe.”<verse eid="EXO 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 21:22" />“Wagosi waidi wakatowana niyo wamlumiza mvyele msoka, na usoka wakwe niyo walawa ukaleka ubanasi wowose utendese, yudya amlumize nalihe liho saviya natigize mgosiwe dyo uyo mvyele walamuzi wanazumila. <verse eid="EXO 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 21:23" />Mna hegu hana ubanasi mtuhu mo mvyele uyo, vyaungwa uyo ahosize amlihe seivyo amlimuze, ujima kwa ujima, <verse eid="EXO 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 21:24" />ziso kwa ziso, zino kwa zino, mkono kwa mkono, chiga kwa chiga. <verse eid="EXO 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 21:25" />Kokwa moto kwa kokwa moto, nkwenje kwa nkwenje, nkong'onto kwa nkong'onto.”<verse eid="EXO 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 21:26" />“Mntu anamtowa mtumwa ywakwe ywa chilume hegu msuntaviya ywakwe na kubalanga idiziso dyakwe, vyaungwa amlekele hehena maliho kwa chausa che idiziso dyakwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 21:27" />Hegu, anamtowa na kumng'ola zino mtumwa ywakwe ywa chilume hegu msuntaviya ywakwe, vyaungwa amlekele kwa chausa che dizino dyakwe.”<verse eid="EXO 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wata ugoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 21:28" />“Hegu njeku inamtunga hembe mntu mgosi hegu mvyele na kumkoma, ng'ombe iyo ikomwe kwa kutoigwa mayuwe, nyama yakwe isekudigwa. Mta ing'ombe iyo hakantilwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 21:29" />Mna uneva ing'ombe iyo izwela kutunga wantu mahembe, umwenye kalangilizwa mna haimfungile, uneva ing'ombe iyo inakoma mntu mgosi hegu mvyele itoigwe mayuwe, umwenye seivyo akomwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 21:30" />Ivyo, uyo mntu anatozwa liho chani akombole ujima wakwe, vyaungwa alihe jejeje chiya aungigwe alihe. <verse eid="EXO 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 21:31" />Uneva ng'ombe inamtunga hembe mbwanga hegu mndele ywa mntu mtuhu, mbuli iyo nailamulwe kwa sila seiyo. <verse eid="EXO 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 21:32" />Uneva ng'ombe inamtunga hembe mtumwa ywa chilume hegu msuntaviya, mwenye ing'ombe namlihe seuta ywa uyo mtumwa matundu yakubula shekeli milongo mitatu, ng'ombe iyo naikomwe kwa kutoigwa mayuwe.”<verse eid="EXO 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 21:33" />“Mntu anasa bome mwazi, hegu anasimba bome kaheza hadigubike, niyo ng'ombe hegu mpunda yapolobele umo, <verse eid="EXO 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 21:34" />uyo mta idibome idyo alavye liho dya matundu amlihe mta umnyama uyo, mnyama uyo afile natende ni ywa uyo asimbile idibome. <verse eid="EXO 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 21:35" />Ng'ombe ya mntu inalumiza ng'ombe ya mntu mtuhu niyo yafa, wantu naweitage ing'ombe iyo injima isigale na kusangana izihela zakwe, seivyo naho nawasangilane idya ing'ome ifile. <verse eid="EXO 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 21:36" />Mna hegu ing'ombe iyo naizwela kutunga mahembe ng'ombe ntuhu na umwenye haitalize, umwenye nalihe ng'ombe kwa ng'ombe, idya ikomigwe naitende yakwe.”<verse eid="EXO 21:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EXO 22" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo ya kukola masa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 22:1" />“Mntu anabawa ng'ombe hegu ngoto na kuichinja hegu kuitaga, natozwe ngo'mbe shano kwa chila ng'ombe imwenga, ngoto nne kwa chila ngoto imwenga. Mbavi uyo naungigwe adamanye ivyo uneva hanadahile natagwe ko ubavi wakwe.”<verse eid="EXO 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 22:2" />“Mbavi anagwilwa nechilo akavuna nyumba, anatoigwa niyo abanika, amkomile hana laho dya kukoma. <verse eid="EXO 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 22:3" />Mna mbavi anatozwa umo zuwa ditontomoka na kukomwa, amkomile nalahwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:3">“Mbavi aungwa alihe, uneva hana chintu cha kuliha, uyo mwenye natagwe chani alihile ubavi wakwe. <verse eid="EXO 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 22:4" />Uneva umnyama uyo abaigwe anabwilwa ni mjima kwa uyo mbavi, uyo mbavi nalihe nkanana mbili, itende ni ng'ombe hegu mpunda hegu ngoto.”<verse eid="EXO 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 22:5" />“Mntu anadimila mwe nkonde hegu mwe nkonde ya mizabibu ya mntu mntuhu nalihe ubanasi uwo, nalihe vintu vyedi vimwenkonde yakwe, hegu nkonde yakwe ye mizabibu.”<verse eid="EXO 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 22:6" />“Mntu anoka moto niyo woka miti ya miwa niyo wajendeleza woka machisa ya mhunga, hegu uhemba wa mntu mtuhu heunati kuvunwa, hegu nkonde yose inahya, okile umoto uwo alihe ubanasi wose.”<verse eid="EXO 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 22:7" />“Mntu anamwasiza mnyawe hela hegu ugoli mtuhu amwikiye, niyo wabaigwa mwe nyumbakwe, mbavi anagwilwa naungwe alihe idiyombe dyakwe nkanana mbili kwa imwe. <verse eid="EXO 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 22:8" />Mna mbavi hanawoneke, mwenye inyumba nelavize kulongozi kwa Chohile chani kwelagisa kugamba suyo uyo abaile ivintu vyo mnyawe.”<verse eid="EXO 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 22:9" />“Mbuli yoyose ya uhiganyi, hegu niwang'ombe, hegu niwampunda, hegu niwangoto, hegu niwasuche, hegu chintu chochose chagile, chila yumwenga agamba ni chakwe, mbuli iyo ya wantu awo waidi naigalwe kulongozi kwa Chohile. Yudya akunga akantilwe ni Chohile kugamba kabalanga, namlihe mnyawe nkanana mbili kwa imwe.”<verse eid="EXO 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 22:10" />“Mntu anamwinkaga mnyawe mpunda hegu, ng'ombe hegu, ngoto hegu mnyama mntuhu amdimile, mnyama uyo hegu anafa hegu analumila hegu anaguhigwa hanawoneke, <verse eid="EXO 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 22:11" />nahatende na cheliso cha Zumbe chilamule mgati mwawo, kulagisa kugamba uyo ekiwe hamuli mo ubavi wo ugoli wo mnyawe. Mta umnya uyo nazumile cheliso icho, na uyo mnyawe halihe maliho yoyose. <verse eid="EXO 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 22:12" />Mna uneva naibaigwa kwakwe, vyaungwa amlihe umwenye. <verse eid="EXO 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 22:13" />Uneva umnyama uyo kagwilwa ni kala dya kumbago, egale inyama isigale itende ukuzi. Halihe maliho yoyose kwa chausa cho umnyama agwiligwe ni dikala.”<verse eid="EXO 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 22:14" />“Mtu anaolwa mnyama ni mnyawe, akaheza mnyama uyo alumila hegu abanika chipindi umwenye hahali, yudya aoligwe umnyama uyo vyaungwa alihe ubanasi uwo wose. <verse eid="EXO 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 22:15" />Mna uneva umwenye neyaho, hamwenga nomnyama ywakwe halihe chochose. Uneva nanimnyama ywa ndima ya maliho, umwenye nazumile idiyombe dya maliho.”<verse eid="EXO 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi mo wikazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 22:16" />“Mntu anamluvya mwali henati kulombwa niyo agona naye, aungwa alihe mali ya mwali na kumsola mndele uyo. <verse eid="EXO 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 22:17" />Ise dya uyo mndele analemela lemeleme kumloza mndele ywakwe, mntu uyo nalihe hela ya mali ikuligana no mwali.”<verse eid="EXO 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 22:18" />“Mvyele msai mkomeni.”<verse eid="EXO 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 22:19" />“Akugonya mnyama akomwe.”<verse eid="EXO 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 22:20" />“Mntu namlavize lavyo mnungu yoyose, akaleka Zumbe Chohile ichedu, uyo nakomwe.”<verse eid="EXO 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 22:21" />“Msekumzila mjeni hegu kuwabunyanya, kwaviya nyuwe mwendaga wajeni uko Misili. <verse eid="EXO 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 22:22" />Msekumbunyanya mvyele abanikilwe ni mgosiwe hegu mwananchiwa. <verse eid="EXO 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 22:23" />Uneva mna wabunyanya awo niyo wanilila, chindedi ndilo yawo naniive, <verse eid="EXO 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 22:24" />maya yangu nayachimpuke, nami naniwakomeni kwa bamba na wavyele wenyu nawatende wabanikilwe ni wagosi na wanenyu wananchiwa.”<verse eid="EXO 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 22:25" />“Unamkopesha mntu yoyose hela mgati mwa wantu wangu wachiwa, unase kutenda enga mtigiza, hegu unase kumtoza chongezekelo. <verse eid="EXO 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 22:26" />Unaguha suche ya mnyawo kuika ukombo, waungwa umvuzize zuwa hadinati kuswa, <verse eid="EXO 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 22:27" />kwaviya iyo nisuche yakwe iyodu negubikile. Hegu wagamba negubuke mbwani? Ananila nanimwive, kwaviya miye ni mta mbazi.”<verse eid="EXO 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 22:28" />“Use kumhuluta Chohile hegu kumligita mkulu ywa wantu wako.”<verse eid="EXO 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 22:29" />“Usekukawa kunilaviza fungu dyangu kulawana na ulozo wako na divai yako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:29">“Mwelekwa ywako ywa nkongo ywa chilume noninke miye. <verse eid="EXO 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 22:30" />Namtende seivyo mwa welekwa wa nkongo wa ng'ombe na ngoto zenyu. Namumleke chila mwelekwa ywa nkongo nomwike kwa mazuwa mfungate, na zuwa dya mnane namnilavize.”<verse eid="EXO 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 22:31" />“Nyuwe namtende wantu wakukile kwangu. Ivyo msekudya nyama ya mnyama akomigwe ni kala dya kumbago. Nyama iyo namduile makuli.”<verse eid="EXO 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EXO 23" />
  <para style="s">Vikuwagila kwa wantu na wanyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 23:1" />“Usekulavya mbuli za udanti. Usekwambizana na mntu mwihi kwa kutenda mukuzi ehiye. <verse eid="EXO 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 23:2" />Usekutimila bunga dya wantu kutenda wihi, hegu usekwelunga na bunga dya wantu kulavya ukuzi wo udanti mwe chitala chani wazaganye ichindedi. <verse eid="EXO 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 23:3" />Usekumhingiza mchiwa mwe malaho kwaviya ni mchiwa.”<verse eid="EXO 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 23:4" />“Ukabwila ng'ombe hegu mpunda ya mnkondo ywako yagile, mvuzize umwenye. <verse eid="EXO 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 23:5" />Unawona mpunda ya mntu akukwihiwa igwa na mzigo wakwe, mwambize umntu uyo kwinula impunda yakwe mna usekuyasa na kuhalawa.”<verse eid="EXO 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 23:6" />“Usekwazaganya uwagila wa mchiwa mwe malaho yakwe. <verse eid="EXO 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 23:7" />Usekumlaha mntu kwa udanti hegu kuwakoma hewena masa na wachindedi, kwaviya miye sanimwonele mbazi mntu mwihi. <verse eid="EXO 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 23:8" />Usekuhokela upati wa kubunyanya kwaviya upati wa kubunyanya wajela utuntu wakulu na kwazaganya mbuli za wawagila.”<verse eid="EXO 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 23:9" />“Usekumzila mjeni, nyuwe mmanya kugamba vili mjeni, kwaviya mwendaga wajeni mwe isi ya Misili.”<verse eid="EXO 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhilimo wa mfungate na zuwadya mfungate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 23:10" />“Kwa chipindi cha mihilimo mtandatu nauhande nkonde zako na kulozola ulozo wakwe. <verse eid="EXO 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 23:11" />Mna mwo mhilimo wa mfungate, nawase zinkonde zako ukaleka kuhanda mbeyu chani wachiwa mgati mwa wantu wako wasokoze nkande isigale umo na makala ya kumbago yadye. Nautende seivyo mwe nkonde yako ye mizabibu na ye mizeituni.”<verse eid="EXO 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 23:12" />“Kwa mazuwa mtandatu nodamanye ndima zako mna zuwa dya mfungate nauhumule chani ng'ombe zako na mpunda zako nazo zihumule na wana wa mntumwa ywako ywa chivyele na wajeni wabwede.”<verse eid="EXO 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 23:13" />“Tozesa yose hugambile. Usekulonga hata hadodo mazina ya milungu mituhu, ayo yasekwivika mo mlomo wako.”<verse eid="EXO 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mazuwa makulu matatu ya ngasu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 34:18-26">Kulawa 34:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-17">Lukumbusa 16:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 23:14" />“Nkanana ntatu chila mhilimo namtende na ngasu kwa kunitunya. <verse eid="EXO 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 23:15" />Namvine ngasu ya migate heigwaduswe, saviya niwalagize, namdye migate heijeligwe hamila kwa mazuwa mfungate chipindi chikigwe mo mwezi wa Abibu, kwaviya mo mwezi uwo numo mlaile Misili. Mntu yoyose asekwiza kunivikila mikono bule.”<verse eid="EXO 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 23:16" />“Namvine ngasu ya uvuni ya nkongo ye zindima zenyu na ya uvuni we zinkonde zenyu. Namvine ngasu ya kuchisanya ulozo nkomelezo yo mhilimo mkachisanya ulozo we zindima zenyu. <verse eid="EXO 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 23:17" />Nkanana ntatu mo mhilimo wantu wako wagosi wose nawadugane kulongozi kwangu miye Zumbe Chohile chani wanivikile.”<verse eid="EXO 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 23:18" />“Usekunilaviza sakame ya ntambiko yangu hamwenga na mgate ujeligwe hamila, hegu usekuleka mavuta ye nyama ye ngasu yangu yekale kubula luvi mtondo.”<verse eid="EXO 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 23:19" />“Ulozo wa nkongo we isi yako nauwigale mwe nyumba yangu miye Chohile, Chohile ywako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:19">“Usekupwasa nyama ya kadolome hegu kabehela mwa mele ya nine.”<verse eid="EXO 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndagano na Malagizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 23:20" />“Kaulani, miye namsigila mndima ywangu ywa kwembingu awalongwele intambo chani awadimeni na kuwabuza hantu hadya niwaikiyeni. <verse eid="EXO 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 23:21" />Mtegelezeni na kutimila icho nalonge, naho msekumbalanga, kwaviya hawalekeleni wihi wenyu kwaviya simsigila kwa zina dyangu. <verse eid="EXO 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 23:22" />Mna uneva mkamwetegeleza vyedi na kudamanya yose hulonga, miye nanitende mnkondo ywa wankondo wenyu na mhigi ywa wakuhigani. <verse eid="EXO 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 23:23" />Mndima ywangu ywa kwembingu nawalongoze na kuwabuza mwe isi ya Waamoli na Wahiti na Wapelezi na Wakanani na Wahivi na Wayebusi, miye naniwabalange wose, <verse eid="EXO 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 23:24" />msekwinama kulongozi kwe milungu yawo na kuivikila, naho kuidamanyiza ndima, naho msekutimiliza mbuli zawo. Mna namuibalangise imilungu yawo na kuzitula vihande hande izinguzo zawo.”<verse eid="EXO 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 23:25" />“Mnisankanile miye du Zumbe Chohile ywenyu, mnadamanya ivyo miye nanijimbike inkande na mazi na kuyausa manyonje mgati mwenyu. <verse eid="EXO 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 23:26" />Hakutende na mvyele yoyose naze usoka hegu kutenda hekweleka mwe isi yenyu. Naniwenkeni wikazi mtali.”<verse eid="EXO 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 23:27" />“Nanigale tiso dyangu kulongozi kwenyu na kuwatibilinkanya wantu wose namuwabase na wankondo wenyu naniwatende wahituke na kuwasumkani. <verse eid="EXO 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 23:28" />Nanigale makozela kulongozi kwenyu nayawabalaze Wahivi na Wakanani na Wahiti. <verse eid="EXO 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 23:29" />Saniwause awo mo mhilimo umwenga, isi inasekusigala ichedu na makala ya kumbago yakongezekela vitendese na kuwahuda nguvu. <verse eid="EXO 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 23:30" />Mna naniwause hadodo dodo kubula aho namongezekele mwe isi na kuitenda yenyu. <verse eid="EXO 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 23:31" />Mihaka ye isi yenyu naitende kulaila kwe bahali ya Shamu kubula bahali ya Meditelaniya na kulaila kwedijangwa kubula umto Efulati, kwaviya naniwenkeni nguvu muwahude wekazi we isi iyo, nanywi namuwabalaze wahalawe. <verse eid="EXO 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 23:32" />Msekudamanya lagano dyodyose na wowo hegu imilungu yawo. <verse eid="EXO 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 23:33" />Mse kuwaleka wekale mwe isi yenyu wanase wakawatenda mdamanye wavu kwa Chohile, kwaviya mnavikila milungu yawo, chindedi uwo nautende mtego wa kuwakomani.”<verse eid="EXO 23:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EXO 24" />
  <para style="s">Lagano Dyelaviza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 24:1" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba Musa, “Kwelani kuno kulanga kolugulu, weye na Haluni na Nadabu na Abihu, hamwenga na wadalahala milongo mfungate wa Izulaeli, msogele haguhi mnivikile kwa hale. <verse eid="EXO 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 24:2" />Weye Musa ichedu nonisogeile, mna wantu watuhu wasekwiza haguhi, Waizulaeli wasekukwela kolugulu hamwenga na weye.” <verse eid="EXO 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 24:3" />Musa niyo aita akuwagambila wantu wose milosi yose Zumbe amsigile. Wantu wose wamhitula kwa izwi dimwenga, “Milosi yose alongile Zumbe chohile nachiidamanye.” <verse eid="EXO 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 24:4" />Elo, Musa niyo ayawandika malagizo yose yadya Zumbe amgambile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 24:4">Niyo enuka mtondo chilochilo, achisanya chisungu cha mayuwe hantu hakulaviza ntambiko hasi ho lugulu, niyo asagula mayuwe mlongo na midi ayachimalisa saviya nguzo kuligana na makabila mlongo na maidi ya wana Waizulaeli. <verse eid="EXO 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 24:5" />Akaheza awegala wabwanga wa Izulaeli wamlavize Zumbe Chohile malavyo ya kutikimya na kumchinjiza malavyo ya utondowazi ya njeku. <verse eid="EXO 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 24:6" />Musa kateka nusu ye sakame ya wanyama awo na kuika mwe bakuli, nusu ntuhu aikupuila mwechiya ichisungu cha mayuwe chokulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="EXO 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 24:7" />Akaheza aguha chitabu cha lagano dya Zumbe Chohile, kachisoma kulongozi kwa wantu. Nawo wagamba, “Ayo yose alongile Zumbe Chohile nachiyatoze, naho nachiyadamanyize ndima.” <verse eid="EXO 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 24:8" />Musa kaguha idya isakame achingile mwe bakuli na kuwamyagila wantu, akagamba, “Ino niyo isakame ye dilagano diya Zumbe adamanye na yuwe kuligana na milosi ino yose.”<verse eid="EXO 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 24:9" />Akaheza Musa na Haluni na Nadabu na Abihu na wadalahala mlongo mfungate wa Izulaeli wakwela kolugulu, <verse eid="EXO 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 24:10" />niyo wamwona Chohile ywa Izulaeli. Hasi he viga vyakwe hendaga na bahali ya chelole ing'aile saviya yuwe ding'alise, saviya mbingu ing'aile. <verse eid="EXO 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 24:11" />Na Chohile hawabalange awo vilongozi wa wantu wa Izulaeli. Wamwona Chohile, wadya na kunywa.<verse eid="EXO 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa mo Lugulu lwa Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 24:12" />Zumbe amgamba Musa, “So kuno kwangu kulanga ko lugulu ugoje. Miye nahwinke vibawo vya mayuwe vina sigilizi na malagizo niwandike kwa chausa cha kuwahinya Waizulaeli.” <verse eid="EXO 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 24:13" />Musa niyo ahalawa hamwenga na Yoshuwa mndima ywakwe, Musa niyo akwela ko lugulu lwa Chohile.<verse eid="EXO 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 24:14" />Henati kuhalawa, Musa kawagambila wadya vilongozi, “Chigojeni hano kubula aho nachiwawiye. Haluni na Huli wehamwenga na nyuwe, yoyose mta milosi nawabase.”<verse eid="EXO 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 24:15" />Musa niyo aita kolugulu, ulugulu niyo lwagubikwa ni ingu. <verse eid="EXO 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 24:16" />Ung'azi wa Zumbe Chohile uchima mlanga mo lugulu lwa Sinai na ingu digubika ulugulu kwa chipindi cha mazuwa mtandatu. Zuwa dya mfungate Zumbe Chohile kamwitanga Musa kulaila mwe diya idingu. <verse eid="EXO 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 24:17" />Ung'azi wa Zumbe Chohile uwoneka kulongozi kwa meso ya wantu wa Izulaeli saviya moto ukwaka mlanga mo lugulu. <verse eid="EXO 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 24:18" />Musa kakwela kulanga kolugulu niyo engila mndani mwe diya idingu. Kekala uko kwa chipindi cha mazuwa milongo mine, msi na chilo.<verse eid="EXO 24:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EXO 25" />
  <para style="s">Malavyo ya Hema Dikukile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 25:1" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="EXO 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 25:2" />“Wagambe Waizulaeli waninke nchango za malavyo, weye nawe unihokeile. Nauhokele kulaila kwa mntu yoyese nalavye kwa moyo uchumile. <verse eid="EXO 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 25:3" />Malavyo yano nayo nohokele, zahabu na hela na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 25:4" />sufu ibuluu na izambalau na inkundu, suche yedi ing'aile idamanywe na mazoya ya mbuzi, <verse eid="EXO 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 25:5" />nchingo za ndolome zijeligwe langi inkundu, nchingo za mbuzi, mbawo za mijoholo, <verse eid="EXO 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 25:6" />mavuta kwachausa cha taa, vilungo kwa chausa cha mavuta ya kukile na kwachausa cha ubani una mhepe, <verse eid="EXO 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 25:7" />mayuwe ya yakwitangwa sadoniki, na mayuwe matuhu kwachausa cha kudolonya kasuche kakugubika mwechifuwa cha mlavyantambiko mkulu na kakwiji.<verse eid="EXO 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 25:8" />Wanidamanyize Hema Dikukile, chani nitende na wikazi mgati mwawo.”<verse eid="EXO 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 25:9" />“Hema idyo nodidamanye kwa vimpandwa vyose vikungwa kulawana na mligano nahulagise weye.”<verse eid="EXO 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shanduku dye Dilagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 25:10" />“Waizulaeli wadamanye shanduku dya mbawo za mjoholo, dina utali futi nne, wangalamu futi mbili, chimo futi mbili. <verse eid="EXO 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 25:11" />Shanduku idyo nodigubike na zahabu yedi kundani na kuse, na msilimbo wa zahabu ntendele zose. <verse eid="EXO 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 25:12" />Ukaheza udamanye madanga mane ya zahabu na kuyajela mwa matengu mane, madanga maidi ntendele imwenga na madanga maidi ntendele ya kaidi kwachausa cha kudinuila. <verse eid="EXO 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 25:13" />Damanya mitengo ya mijoholo na kuihaka zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 25:14" />Mitengo iyo nauijele mwe yadya amadanga mwezimpembe mbili ze dishanduku, kwachausa cho kudinuila. <verse eid="EXO 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 25:15" />Mitengo iyo naisigaile mwa madanga, isekusigwa chipindi chochose. <verse eid="EXO 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 25:16" />Mndani mwe dishanduku idyo nawike yadya amayuwe yadamanywe enga vibawo vye dilagano viwandikwe izisigilizi nahwinke.”<verse eid="EXO 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 25:17" />“Ukaheza damanya ngubiko ya shanduku dya zahabu yedi ikwitangwa Hantu ha Mbazi, utali wakwe futi chenda na nusu, na wangalamu wakwe futi milongo midi. <verse eid="EXO 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 25:18" />Damanya vyumbe vidi vina mawawa kwa zahabu visanigwe vikwitangwa makelubi. Vike mwe zimpembe mbili za ahantu aho. <verse eid="EXO 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 25:19" />Ika kelubi dimwenga kouhelo na kelubi idituhu kouhelo wakaidi. Vyumbe ivyo visanigwe vike uhelo hantu ha mbazi, mna vilunganye vitende chintu chimwenga hantu ha mbazi. <verse eid="EXO 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 25:20" />Makelubi ayo nayenule mawawa yawo kulanga, na kukigubika hantu ha mbazi na kwa mawawa yawo ne vinengo vyawo navisinyane. <verse eid="EXO 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 25:21" />Mndani mwedishanduku ika ivibawo vye miko nahwinke nakuchika hantu he zimbazi mlanga mwe ngubiko ye dishanduku. <verse eid="EXO 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 25:22" />Miye nanidugane na weye aho na chilosane hatenda mlanga mwe ngubiko ya hantu ha zimbazi, hagati mwa ayo makelubi maidi yemlanga mwengubiko ye dishanduku dye dilagano, nanilosane na weye nakukwinka miko yose kwachausa cha Waizulaeli.”<verse eid="EXO 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meza ya migate ilavigwe kulongozi kwa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 25:23" />“Nodamanye meza ya mbawo za mjoholo ina utali wa futi ntatu, wangalamu futi imwenga na nusu na chimo futi mbili. <verse eid="EXO 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 25:24" />Meza iyo ihake zahabu yedi na kuidamanyiza msilimbo wa zahabu kuizunguluka mpande zose. <verse eid="EXO 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 25:25" />Ukaheza idamanyize lupapi luna wangalamu wa nyanda ntatu luzunguluse mlanga mwe mweza, luchinde vintu visekugwa. Lupapi ulo uludamanyize msilimbo wa zahabu kuzunguluka mpembe zose. <verse eid="EXO 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 25:26" />Idamanyize madanga mane ya zahabu na kuyajela mwezimpembe nne za matengu ye meza. <verse eid="EXO 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 25:27" />Madanga ayo nayatende haguhi na ludya ulupapi luzunguluke imeza nayatende ni hantu hakwingiziza idya imitengo ya kwinuila imeza iyo. <verse eid="EXO 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 25:28" />Damanya mitengo midi ya mijoholo na kuihaka zahabu, mitengo iyo naitende ya kwinuila iyo imeza. <verse eid="EXO 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 25:29" />Damanya sahani na vikombe na bakuli na nyungu vya kujeseza kulaviza malavyo ya kunywa. Viya vyose vidamanye kwa zahabu yedi. <verse eid="EXO 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 25:30" />Imeza iyo ike kulongozi kwe Idishanduku dye Dilagano, mlanga mwe meza iyo nawike idya imigate ikukile kwangu mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="EXO 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiya cha kwikiya taa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 25:31" />“Damanya chiya cha kwikiya taa cha zahabu yedi. Chitako chakwe na mti wakwe visanigwe kutenda chintu chimwenga, naho ivikombe vyakwe na nkuvu zakwe na maluwa yakwe, vyose navihakwe kwa chihande chimwenga cha zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 25:32" />Matambi mtandatu nayalaile chila ntendele yo mti wakwe, matambi matatu ntendele imwenga na matambi matatu ntendele ntuhu. <verse eid="EXO 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 25:33" />Mwe chila tambi nakutende na vikombe vitatu mliganyo wa maluwa ya mti ukwitangwa mlozi, chila chimwenga na kuvu dyakwe na luwa dyakwe. <verse eid="EXO 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 25:34" />Na momti namtende na vikombe vine mliganyo wa maluwa ya mlozi, hamwenga na matumba yakwe na maluwa yakwe. <verse eid="EXO 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 25:35" />Nakutende na fundo chila hantu matambi maidi yakulaila kutimilana na matambi yadya mtandatu yakulaila mwe chiya ichinala. <verse eid="EXO 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 25:36" />Mafundo ayo na matambi yakwe nayatende chintu chimwenga nechiya icho, chose nachisanwe kwa zahabu yedi. <verse eid="EXO 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 25:37" />Damanya taa mfungate kwachausa che kinala nakuzika mlanga mwakwe chani zilangaze kulongozi kwakwe. <verse eid="EXO 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 25:38" />Damanya chiya cha kuhituila utambi na visahani vyakwe kwa zahabu yedi. <verse eid="EXO 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 25:39" />Damanyiza chilo milongo mitatu na shano za zahabu yedi kudamanya ichinala icho na ivimpandwa vyakwe ivyo. <verse eid="EXO 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 25:40" />Kaulisa kugamba kuvidamanya kwa mliganyo saviya ulagiswe kudya kolugulu.”<verse eid="EXO 25:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EXO 26" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo ya kudamanya Hema Dikukile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 26:1" />“Ukaheza damanya Hema Dikukile ditende na mapaziya mlongo kwa suche ing'aile isumigwe na malembo ya sufu ya langi ibuluu na zambalau na inkundu hamwenga na vyumbe visanigwe vikwitangwa makelubi. <verse eid="EXO 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 26:2" />Utali wa chila paziya nautende ni futi milongo mine na mbili na wangalamu wakwe futi mtandatu. Mapaziya yose yatende ya chihimo chimwenga. <verse eid="EXO 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 26:3" />Mapaziya mashano yalunganywe yatende chihande chimwenga, na mapaziya matuhu mashano yalunganywe hamwenga yatende chihande cha kaidi. <verse eid="EXO 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 26:4" />Ukajika suma matasi ye buluu mwe dipindo dye dipaziya dya kumpezo kwe dipaziya chihande cha nkongo, seivyo nausumile matasi kumpezo kwe dipindo dye dipaziya dya kaidi. <verse eid="EXO 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 26:5" />Damanya sigi milongo mishano mwe paziya dimwenga na sigi ntuhu milongo mishano mwedilepe dwe dipaziya dya kaidi, sigi zose nazingilane. <verse eid="EXO 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 26:6" />Ukaheza damanya vifungo milongo mishano vya zahabu chani kulunganya viya vihande vidi vya mapaziya, ivyo hema naditende dimwenga.”<verse eid="EXO 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 26:7" />“Naho nodamanye ngubiko ya hema kwa mapaziya mlongo nadimwenga ya mazoya ya mbuzi. <verse eid="EXO 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 26:8" />Utali wa chila paziya nautende futi milongo mine na shano na wangalamu futi mtandatu. Mapaziya yose mlongo na dimwenga nayatende na chihimo chimwenga. <verse eid="EXO 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 26:9" />Nolunganye mapaziya mashano hamwenga na mapaziya mtandatu hamwenga. Paziya dya mtandatu na udizingilize nkanana mbili kulongozi kwe dihema. <verse eid="EXO 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 26:10" />Damanya sigi milono mishano mwe dipindo dye dipaziya kumpezo kwe chihande cha nkongo na sigi milongo mishano mwe dipindo dye dipaziya dya nkomelezo dye chihande cha kaidi. <verse eid="EXO 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 26:11" />Nodamanye vifungo milongo mishano vya shaba na kuvijela mwe ziya izisigi milongo mishano chani kulunganya viya ivihande vidi vya mapaziya chani ditende hema dimwenga. <verse eid="EXO 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 26:12" />Chiya ichihande chisigale che dipaziya, uchitungike kungwelo kwe dihema. <verse eid="EXO 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 26:13" />Chihande icho nusu mita yo utali wa mapaziya chisigale chikunje chinemeneme ntendele zose mo lubavu lwe dihema chani udigubika idihema.”<verse eid="EXO 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 26:14" />“Nodamanye ngubiko mbili kwa mkota udeleke wa ndolome ujeligwe langi inkundu na mkota udeleke wa mbuzi.”<verse eid="EXO 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 26:15" />“Nodamanye fulemu ya mjoholo ya kuchimaila Idihema Dikukile. <verse eid="EXO 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 26:16" />Chila fulemu naitende futi mlongo na shano, kwa kulanga na hasi ilunganye na lubawo lwa wangalamu lwa futi mbili. <verse eid="EXO 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 26:17" />Chila fulemu naitende na mbulo mbili za kulunganya. Nivyo nozidamanye izo izifulemu mbulo mbili. <verse eid="EXO 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 26:18" />Ivyo, nodamanye fulemu ye Dihema vino. Fulemu milongo midi ntendele ya kwamwenye, <verse eid="EXO 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 26:19" />nodamanye vitako milongo mine vya hela hasi hezifulemu milongo midi, vitako vidi kwa chila fulemu kuhokela ziya izimbulo zakwe mbili na vitako vidi hasi ha chila fulemu kutozeza ziya izimbulo zakwe mbili. <verse eid="EXO 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 26:20" />Na ntendele ya kaidi ye Dihema, ntendele ya chenya, fulemu milongo midi, <verse eid="EXO 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 26:21" />naho vitako vyakwe milongo mine vya hela, vitako vidi hasi he chila fulemu. <verse eid="EXO 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 26:22" />Kungwelo kwe Idihema, uswelo wa zuwa we Dihema, nodamanye fulemu mtandatu. <verse eid="EXO 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 26:23" />Nodamanye naho fulemu mbili mwe zimpembe ze Dihema ntendele ya kunyuma. <verse eid="EXO 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 26:24" />Ifulemu iyo mwezimpembe ilungane hasi kubula kulanga kwedidanga dya nkongo. Fulemu zose za mwezimpembe zitendwe seivyo chani zitende mpembe mbili. <verse eid="EXO 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 26:25" />Ivyo nachitende na fulemu mnane hamwenga ne vitako vyakwe mlongo na mtandatu vya hela, vitako vidi hasi ha chila fulemu na vitako vidi hasi he fulemu ya kaidi.”<verse eid="EXO 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 26:26" />“Nodamanye migamba ya mti wa mjoholo, migamba mlongo na shano, shano kwachausa cha kulunganya ifulemu ntendele imwenga ye Dihema, <verse eid="EXO 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 26:27" />migamba mishano kwachausa cha kulunganya ntendele ya kaidi ye Dihema, migamba mishano kwachausa cha kulunganya izifulemu ntendele ya kungwelo kwe Dihema, kusinya uswelo wa zuwa. <verse eid="EXO 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 26:28" />Mwigala nguzo wa hagati, hefulemu naufifinye hagatigati kulaila uhelo kubula uhelo mtuhu we Dihema. <verse eid="EXO 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 26:29" />Fulemu zose nozihake zahabu na kuzitendela madanga ya zahabu nayatoze imigamba iyo, nayo noyahake zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 26:30" />Ivyo nodidamanye Idihema kutimilana na mliganyo hulagise kolugulu.”<verse eid="EXO 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 26:31" />“Nodamanye paziya tuhu. Paziya idyo disumilwe vyumbe vidolonywe vina mawawa vikwitangwa makelubi disumwe kwa nyuzi za langi ya buluu na zambalau na zinkundu na suche ing'aile ilukigwe. <verse eid="EXO 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 26:32" />Nodihasike mwe nguzo nne za mti wa mjoholo zihakigwe zahabu. Zina ndwana za zahabu kulanga na vitako vine vihakigwe langi ya hela hasi. <verse eid="EXO 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 26:33" />Unajika kudihasika idipaziya idyo, dilete diya idishanduku dye dilagano udingize kunyuma kwe dipaziya. Paziya idyo, nadisente Hantu Hakukile na Hantu Hakukise mndani mwe Dihema. <verse eid="EXO 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 26:34" />Nawike ngubiko ikwitangwa Hantu ha Mbazi mlanga mwe diya Idishanduku dye Dilagano mndani mwa Hantu Hakukise. <verse eid="EXO 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 26:35" />Idya imeza iike kulongozi kwe dipaziya na chiya ichiya chokiya taa nochike ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi ye idihema, chisinyane ne Meza yokwikiya migate ikukile. Meza iyo noike ntendele ya chenya mndani mwe dihema.”<verse eid="EXO 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 26:36" />“Nodamanye paziya tuhu kwa sufu ya buluu na zambalau na inkundu na suche ing'aile isumigwe na kudolonywa vyedi kwachausa cho lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="EXO 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 26:37" />Nodamanye nguzo shano za mijoholo na kuzihaka zahabu. Nguzo izo nazitende na ndwana za zahabu zakuhasikila idihema, chila imwenga naitende na chitako cha shaba.”<verse eid="EXO 26:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EXO 27" />
  <para style="s">Nchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 27:1" />“Nodamanye chintu cha mlaba saviya shanduku naditende wani wa kokela wanyama kwa mbawo za mjoholo. Shanduku idyo naditende diligana, utali wakwe futi mfungate na nusu, na wangalamu wakwe futi mfungate na nusu, chimo chakwe nachitende futi nne na nusu. <verse eid="EXO 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 27:2" />Nodamanye vintu vikale enga mahembe mwe zimpembe zakwe nne, ayo mahembe nayatende chintu chimwenga no wani uwo wo kokela awanyama, yose yahake shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 27:3" />Nodamanye viya vyakwe vya kusiza maivu na makulega yakwe na mabakuli yakwe na uma zakwe na makalai yakwe viya vyakwe vyose novitende vya shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 27:4" />Damanya lwavu lwa shaba luna madanga mane ya shaba mwe izo izimpembe nne. <verse eid="EXO 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 27:5" />Lwavu ulo nolwike hagatigati hasi ho wani wo kokela awanyama ntendele ya hasi, chani ulo ulwavu lukabule mgatigati mo wani wo kokela awanyama. <verse eid="EXO 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 27:6" />Damanya mitengo ya mijoholo ya kwinuila uwani uwo wo kokela awanyama na uihake shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 27:7" />Na imitengo iyo naijelwe mwamadanga na idya imitengo naitende ntendele mbili ze inchanja yo kulaviza intambiko, chipindi cho kuiguha. <verse eid="EXO 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 27:8" />Na widamanye kwa mbawo hagati itende na mpong'a mndani mwakwe, saviya ulagiswe kolugulu.”<verse eid="EXO 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwa we Dihema Dikukile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 27:9" />“Damanya uwa wa Hema Dikukile. Kwentendele ya kwamwenyemzi yo uwa nakutende na mapaziya yadamanywe kwa chitambala chedi ching'aile chilukigwe nachitende na utali wa futi gana na milongo mishano ntendele imwenga. <verse eid="EXO 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 27:10" />Mapaziya ayo nayatozwe ni nguzo milongo midi za shaba na vitako vyakwe milongo midi vya shaba. Mna mwigalanguzo nezindwana zakwe navitende vidamanywa kwa feza. <verse eid="EXO 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 27:11" />Damanya seivyo ntendele ya chenya, utali wa mapaziya nautende futi gana na milongo mishano nguzo zakwe milongo midi za shaba, mna madanga ye zinguzo na ndwana zakwe navidamanywe kwa chumbu.<verse eid="EXO 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 27:12" />Ntendele ya uswelo wa zuwa wo uwa, nautende na paziya dina utali wa futi milongo mfungate na shano na nguzo zakwe mlongo na vitako vyakwe mlongo. <verse eid="EXO 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 27:13" />Seivyo ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa kolwivi lo uwa nakutende na wangalamu wa futi milongo mfungate na shano. <verse eid="EXO 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 27:14" />Paziya dye ntendele imwenga yo lwivi naditende na wangalamu wa futi milongo midi na nusu, hamwenga na nguzo ntatu na vitako vyakwe vitatu. <verse eid="EXO 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 27:15" />Seivyo mwe ntendele ya kaidi yo lwivi, paziya naditende futi milongo midi na nusu, hamwenga na nguzo ntatu na vitako vyakwe vitatu. <verse eid="EXO 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 27:16" />Ulwivi lwenye lwo uwa nalutende lwa paziya dina utali wa futi milongo mitatu, didamanywe kwa chitambala ching'aile chihambigwe vyedi kwa nyuzi za langi ya buluu na zambalau na inkundu. Paziya idyo naditozwe ni nguzo nne zina vitako vine. <verse eid="EXO 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 27:17" />Nguzo zose kuzunguluka uwa nazilunganywe kwa nkombosha zidamanywe kwa feza, ndwana zakwe nazitende zidamanywa kwa feza na vitako vyakwe navitende vya shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 27:18" />Uwa uwo nautende na utali wa futi gana na milongo mishano na wangalamu wa futi milongo mfungate na nusu na chimo cha futi milongo mfungate na nusu. Mapaziya yakwe nayatende ya chitambala chedi ching'aile na vitako vyakwe vya shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 27:19" />Viya vyose vye Dihema Dikukile vya kusankanila, hamwenga ne vijinji vyose ne viya vyose ivituhu vyo uwa navitende vya shaba.”<verse eid="EXO 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuidima Ita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 27:20" />“Walagize Waizulaeli wakwigaile mavuta yedi vitendese kwachausa che ita, kutende na ta ikwaka mazuwa yose. <verse eid="EXO 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 27:21" />Mndani mwe Dihema Dikukile kuse kwe dipaziya idyo kulongozi kwe Dishanduku dye Dilagano, Haluni na wanawe naikaule ita iyo isekufa kulongozi kwangu kukongela chisingi kubula mtondo. Lagizo dino dyaungwa ditozwe mazuwa yose ni Waizulaeli wose, cheleko kubula cheleko.”<verse eid="EXO 27:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EXO 28" />
  <para style="s">Suche za Walavyantambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 28:1" />“Weye Musa wasente mkuluwo Haluni hamwenga na wanawe Nadabu na Abihu na Eleazali na Itamali mgati mwa Waizulaeli chani wanisankanile mwe ndima ya ulavyantambiko. <verse eid="EXO 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 28:2" />Nomsumile mkuluwo ywako Haluni suche ikukile vitendese awoneke ni mkulu na kuwagiza, awagile kutenda mlavyantambiko. <verse eid="EXO 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 28:3" />Wagambile wasumi wose wadya ninkile ubala wa kusuma wamsumile Haluni suche navale umo akasentwe kwachausa cha ndima ya ulavyantambiko. <verse eid="EXO 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 28:4" />Wagambile wamsumile vintu savino, kakwiji ka mwechifuwa, kasuche kakugubika mwechifuwa na nkazu na juba didolonywe na chilemba na msipi. Uyo mlukolo ywako Haluni na wanawe nawazivale chani wanisankanile mwe ndima ya ulavyantabiko. <verse eid="EXO 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 28:5" />Wasumi awo nawajeseze nyuzi za zahabu na nyuzi zibuluu na nyuzi zinkundu na suche yedi ing'aile.”<verse eid="EXO 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 28:6" />“Wasume kasuche kakugubika mwechifuwa kwa chitambala chedi ching'aile chihambigwe kwa nyuzi za zahabu na nyuzi zinkundu na nyuzi zibuluu na nyuzi za zambalau. <verse eid="EXO 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 28:7" />Nachitende na sigi mbili mwa mayega zisumigwe mwa malepe yakwe maidi. <verse eid="EXO 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 28:8" />Msipi udamanywe kwa chitambala ching'aile kutozeza nawo udamanywe kwa vintu savino kwa nyuzi za zahabu na nyuzi zibuluu na nyuzi za zambalau na nyuzi zinkundu chilukigwe na kutenda chintu chimwenga na kasuche kakubika mwechifuwa.” <verse eid="EXO 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 28:9" />Ukaheza guha mayuwe maidi yakwitangwa sadoniki yadya nosongole mlanga mwakwe mazina mlongo na maidi ya wana wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="EXO 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 28:10" />Wandika mazina mtandatu mwe yuwe dimwenga na mazina mtandatu yasigale mwe diya idiyuwe dya kaidi kuligana na viya welekwe. <verse eid="EXO 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 28:11" />Noyasongole amazina ayo saviya mta kusongola akudolonya hula mlanga mwe mayuwe maidi, ukaheza uyajele mwe vintu vya kutozeza vya zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 28:12" />Yaike amayuwe amaidi mlanga mwe misipi yakasuche kakugubika mwechifuwa ntendele za mwa mayega vitende lukumbusa kwa wana mlongo na waidi wa Izulaeli. Haluni nayenule amazina ayo kulongozi kwa Zumbe mlanga mwa mayega yakwe chani kutenda lukumbusa. <verse eid="EXO 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 28:13" />Damanya vintu vidi vya kutozeza vya zahabu, <verse eid="EXO 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 28:14" />na mikufu midi ya zahabu yedi, ilukigwe saviya sigi na wiijele iyo imikufu mwe viya ivintu vyo kutozeza.<verse eid="EXO 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakwiji ka mwechifuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 28:15" />“Nodamanye kakwiji ka mwechifuwa kakulondela ulamuzi kulaila kwa Chohile, kadamanywe vyedi saviya kadamanywe akasuche kakugubika mwechifuwa. Kwa nyuzi za zahabu, kwa nyuzi za buluu na nyuzi za zambalau na nyuzi zinkundu na chitambala ching'aile chedi. <verse eid="EXO 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 28:16" />Kakwiji ako nakazingwe ntendele zakwe nne nazitende na nyanda cheda. <verse eid="EXO 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 28:17" />Mlanga mwa kakwiji ako wike misitali mine ya mayuwe ya yombe kulu, msitali wa nkongo mayuwe ya akiki na wakaidi mayuwe ya yakuti na wakatatu mayuwe ya lubi na wakane mayuwe ya topazi. <verse eid="EXO 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 28:18" />Mo msitali wakaidi nautende zumalidi na yakuti samawi na alimasi, <verse eid="EXO 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 28:19" />msitali wa katatu nautende yakinto na akiki inkundu na amesisito, <verse eid="EXO 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 28:20" />na msitali wa kane nautende ni zabalajani na shohamu na yasipi, mayuwe ayo nayajelwe mwe vintu vya kutozeza vya zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 28:21" />Nakutende na mayuwe mlongo na maidi chila dimwenga nadisongolwe zina dimwenga dya wana wa Izulaeli kutenda enga hula hantu hamakabila mlongo na mbili. <verse eid="EXO 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 28:22" />Udamanye mikufu ya zahabu yedi ilukigwe enga luzigi. <verse eid="EXO 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 28:23" />Damanya madanga maidi ya zahabu uyajele mwe kadya akakwiji ka mwe chifuwa na kuyajela amadanga ayo maidi mwa malepe ya kakwiji ka mwechifuwa. <verse eid="EXO 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 28:24" />Ujele iyo imikufu midi ye zahabu ilukigwe italize mwe ziya izi mpembe mbili zimwa malepe yakakwiji ka mwechifuwa. <verse eid="EXO 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 28:25" />Mbulo ziya izintuhu za iyo imikufu ye zahabu yo kulukwa mwamalepe amaidi na kuvilunganya mwe viya vitozezo vyamwamayega ye kizibawo ntendele ya kulongozi. <verse eid="EXO 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 28:26" />Naho nodamanye madanga maidi ya zahabu, nakuzijela mwezimbulo mbili zihasi ntendele ya kundani yakakwiji ka mwechifuwa hajihi ne kasuche kakugubika mwechifuwa. <verse eid="EXO 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 28:27" />Damanya adanga matuhu maidi ya zahabu na kuyajela kulongozi kwa malepe ye hasi hakasuche kagubika ichifuwa. Hantu akasuche kakugubika ichifuwa kikulungana no msipi ulukigwe kwa untanda. <verse eid="EXO 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 28:28" />Kakwiji kamwechiwa nakatalizwe mwa kasuche kakugubika mwechifuwa kwa kulunganya amadanga yakwe na kasuche kakugubik mwechifuwa kwa luzigi lwa langi ya ibuluu, chani kakwiji ako kasekulegela mna kasigaile mo msipi udya ulukigwe chintanda.”<verse eid="EXO 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 28:29" />“Kwakudamanya ivyo Haluni akengila Hantu Hakukile natende kaguha mazina mlongo na maidi ya wana wa Izulaeli momoyo wakwe mlanga mwa kakwiji ako kulonda ulamuzi wa Chohile. Mwesila iyo miye Chohile naniwakumbukeni nyuwe wantu wangu wa Izulaeli mazuwa yose. <verse eid="EXO 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 28:30" />Jela mndani mwa kakwiji ako viya ivintu vidi vikwitangwa Ulimu na Sumimu viya wakujeseza walavyantambiko kulondela ulamuzi mwe yadya hunga. Chila hadya akwizila kulongozi kwangu navitende mwe chifuwa chakwe najeseze chani amanye yadya hunga kwachausa cha Waizulaeli.”<verse eid="EXO 28:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Suche ntuhu za Walavyantambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 28:31" />“Nosume nkazu ya kuvaila kasuche kakugubika mwe chifuwa kwa nyuzi ya langi ibuluu. <verse eid="EXO 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 28:32" />Nayo naitende na langa hagatigati dya kujisiza umtwi, nadisumwe kuzungulukila idilanga idyo chani disekutatuka. <verse eid="EXO 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 28:33" />Mwedipindo dya hasi kuzunguluka ntendele zose nazihambwe kwa makomamanga ya langi ibuluu na zambalau na inkundu na kutende naho na mbuji za langi ya zahabu mgati mwa ayo makomamanga, <verse eid="EXO 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 28:34" />mbuji ya zahabu na makomamanga, mwedipindo kuizunguluka inkazu ntendele zose. <verse eid="EXO 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 28:35" />Haluni navale isuche iyo chila amkasankanila Zumbe, izwi dye izimbuji izo nadivigwe umo akengila na kufosa Hantu Hakukile kulongozi kwa Zumbe, chani anasekubanika.”<verse eid="EXO 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 28:36" />“Ukaheza, nodamanye kapati ka zahabu yedi, mlanga mwakwe songola saviya mntu akudolonya mahula, ‘Mkuka kwa Zumbe.’ <verse eid="EXO 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 28:37" />Wenawe dijele kapati ka zahabu, kapati ako nokatalize kwa luzigi lwi buluu. <verse eid="EXO 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 28:38" />Haluni navale kabati ako mwe chinengo cho uso wakwe. Kwa akabati ako, Haluni nenule malavyo yo ubanasi yadya wana wa Izulaeli wadaha kudamanya mo kunilaviza malavyo yakukile, miye nami naniyazumile amalavyo yawo.”<verse eid="EXO 28:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 28:39" />“Msumile Haluni shati tali kwa chitambala chedi ching'aile chidolonywe na kumsumila chilemba cha suche ya nyuzi zedi, naho udamanye msipi udolonywe vyedi.”<verse eid="EXO 28:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 28:40" />“Nauwadamanyize wana wa Haluni nkazu na misipi na nkofiya chani wawoneke ni wakulu naho wawagiza. <verse eid="EXO 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 28:41" />Mvise mlukolo ywako Haluni na wanawe suche izo, ukaheza uwahake mavuta na kuwekiya mikono chani uwakukize wanisankanila mwe ndima ya ulavyantambiko. <verse eid="EXO 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 28:42" />Wasumile putula ya suche za chitambala ching'aile, chani wagubike umwazi wawo. Putula izo nazikongele mwe chigudi kubula mwa mavindi. <verse eid="EXO 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 28:43" />Haluni na wanawe na wavale iziputula izo chila wakengila mwe Dihema dyo mdugano, hegu wakasogela haguhi he inchanja yokulaviza intambiko, kudamanya ndima za walavyantambiko Hantu Hakukile. Kwa sila iyo hawalagise umwazi wawo na kutenda na luhosa lwa kukomwa. Idyo naditende ni lagizo dyakutimilwa ni Haluni na welekwa wakwe mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="EXO 28:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EXO 29" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo ya kuwaikiya mikono Haluni na wanawe watende walavyantambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 29:1" />“Zino ni mbuli nowadamanyize Haluni na wanawe chani wanisankanile mwe ndima ya ulavyantambiko. Noguhe njeku imwenga na ndolome mbili hezina lema, <verse eid="EXO 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 29:2" />kwakujeseza unga wedi wa ngano damanya migate heigwaduswe na mandazi heyegwaduswe yakandigwe kwa mavuta na migate misisili heigwaduswe, mna ihakwa mavuta. <verse eid="EXO 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 29:3" />Wenawe novike vyose mwe ntangulu imwenga, na kunilaviza chipindi chimwenga na idya injeku na ziya izindolome izimbili.”<verse eid="EXO 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 29:4" />“Ukaheza wegale Haluna na wanawe holwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile na kuwalengusa saviya vili mwa mazwela yenyu. <verse eid="EXO 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 29:5" />Ukaheza guha ziya izisuche za walavyantambiko umvise Haluni shati tali dya chitambala ching'aile didolonywe vyedi, na nkazu na kasuche kakugubika mwechifuwa na kakwiji ka mwechifuwa na kumtaliza udya umsipi ulukigwe kwa untanda. <verse eid="EXO 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 29:6" />Naho mvise chiya ichilemba mo mtwi na kwika mlanga mwe ako akapati kezahabu kawandikwe ‘Mkuka kwa Zumbe’ <verse eid="EXO 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 29:7" />Ukaheza kudamanya ivyo, guha yadya amavuta yo kuhaka, mjuluzize Haluni mo mtwi wakwe umwike mwe ndima ya ulavyantambiko.”<verse eid="EXO 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 29:8" />“Ukaheza waleta wanawe uwavise mashati yawo matali ya chitambala ching'aile. <verse eid="EXO 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 29:9" />Watalize misipi mwe vigudi vyawo wanawe na kuwavisa nkofiya zawo zing'aile. Ivyo nivyo nowaike Haluni na wanawe wawatende walavyantambiko mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="EXO 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 29:10" />“Ukaheza igala idya injeku kulongozi kwe Dihema Dikukile. Haluni na wanawe nawaike imikono yawo mlanga mo mtwi we injeku iyo, <verse eid="EXO 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 29:11" />nauichinje holwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile kulongozi kwangu, miye Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="EXO 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 29:12" />Ukajika guha chihendo che sakame na kuihaka mwa mahembe ye inchanja yo kulaviza intambiko kwa dole dyako, na sakame yose ikusigala itile hasi henchanja yo kulaviza intambiko. <verse eid="EXO 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 29:13" />Ukaheza guha amavuta yose yakugubika utumbo, ntendele yedi ya maini hamwenga ne izifigo zose mbili na mavuta yakwe, uvyoke vyose mlanga mwe nchanja yo kulaviza intambiko. <verse eid="EXO 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 29:14" />Mna inyama ye injeku iyo hamwenga nomkota wakwe na mavi yakwe noviguhe na kuvyoka kuse kwe nkambi yenyu. Dino naditende lavyo dya kusa masa ya walavyantambiko.”<verse eid="EXO 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 29:15" />“Ukaheza guha ndolome imwenga mweziya izimbili nakumgamba Haluni na wanawe waike imikono yawo mlanga mo mtwi wendolome iyo. <verse eid="EXO 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 29:16" />Ichinje indolome iyo, isakame yakwe waimyagila inchanja yo kulaviza intambiko ntendele zakwe zose. <verse eid="EXO 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 29:17" />Ukaheza ikante vihande hande indolome iyo, na kusunta utumbo wakwe, neviga vyakwe, uvike vyose hamwenga ne vihande vituhu nomtwi wakwe. <verse eid="EXO 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 29:18" />Yoke indolome yose mlanga mwe nchanja yokulaviza intambiko chani unilavize lavyo dya kutikimya, mhempe wedi ikulavigwa kwa moto ikumuwagila miye Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="EXO 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 29:19" />“Guha idya indolome intuhu, Haluni na wanawe nawaike mikono yawo mlanga mo mtwi we ndolome iyo. <verse eid="EXO 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 29:20" />Ichinje niyo waguha kihendo cha sakame na kumhaka Haluni na wanawe mwe zimpembe za magutwi yawo ya kulume na amadole amakulu ye mikono yawo ya kulume na madole amakulu ye viga vyawo vya kulume. Sakame ikusigala imyagile mwe inchanja yo kulaviza intambiko ntendele zakwe zose. <verse eid="EXO 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 29:21" />Guha chihendo cha sakame imlanga mwe inchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko hamwenga na yadya mavuta yo kuhaka umyagile Haluni nezisuche zakwe, seivyo uwamyagile wanawe ne zisuche zawo. Haluni na wanawe nawasentwe kwachausa changu.”<verse eid="EXO 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 29:22" />“Kwaviya ino niyo indolome yokujeseza kuwajekela mikono walavya ntambiko wangu, guha amavuta ye ndolome iyo, nomchila wakwe, na mavuta yakugubika utumbo na ntendele yedi ye idini, ne zifigo zakwe mbili na mavuta yakwe, hamwenga na wambo dya kulume. <verse eid="EXO 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 29:23" />Kulaila mwe idya intangulu ye migate heigwaduswe ikulongozi kwangu miye Zumbe, noguhe mgate umwenga na ndazi dimwenga dijeligwe mavuta na mgate msisili umwenga. <verse eid="EXO 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 29:24" />Vyose vino nomwinke Haluni na wanawe, wagambe wavinule kulanga kutenda chilagiso cha kunilaviza malavyo miye Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 29:25" />Ukaheza noviguhe vituhu kulaila mwe mikono yawo na kuvyoka mlanga mwe inchanja yo kulaviza intambiko hamwenga na diya idilavyo dyo kutikimya, vitende mhempe wedi na iniwagile miye Zumbe. Idyo ni lavyo dikulavigwa kwa sila ya moto.”<verse eid="EXO 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 29:26" />“Guha ichifuwa cha iyo indolome yo kusentwa kwa Haluni, nakuchinula kulanga nakutenda chilagiso cha kunilaviza miye Zumbe. Nadyo naditende chihande chako cha kudya.”<verse eid="EXO 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 29:27" />“Ukajika guha ichichifuwa na idya indolome ya nkongo ya kumsenta mlavyantambiko, vihendo vya idya indolome vinulwe kulanga kulagisa mwanilaviza miye, izo nazitende niza Haluni na wanawe wenkigwe chani wadye. <verse eid="EXO 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 29:28" />Ivyo mazuwa yose, Waizulaeli nawaguhe vihendo ivyo kulaila mwa malavyo yawo yo utondowazi na kumwinka Haluni na wanawe. Idyo ni lavyo dyawo kwangu miye Zumbe.”<verse eid="EXO 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 29:29" />“Umo Haluni anabanika, suche zakwe zikukile zinkizwe kwa wanawe nawo nawazivale zuwa dyawo dya kujelekwelwa mikomo watende walavyantambiko. <verse eid="EXO 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 29:30" />Mwanawe dya Haluni natende mlavyantambiko hantu ha tati yakwe navale suche izo mazuwa mfungate nakusigaila mwe Dihema Dikukile, chani kusankanila Hantu Hakukile.”<verse eid="EXO 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 29:31" />“Guha inyama ye ndolome yokusentwa na kuitipwilisa mo uwa we Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="EXO 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 29:32" />Ukaheza nowenke Haluni na wanawe, nawo nawaidye holwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile hamwenga na idya imigate isigale mwe ntangulu. <verse eid="EXO 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 29:33" />Nawadye ivintu ivyo vitendigwe vya kulekeilwa masa na kwachausa cha kuwadamanyiza wivano, mna mntu mtuhu asekujeza kuvidya kwaviya vikuka. <verse eid="EXO 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 29:34" />Uneva nyama yoyose hegu migate iyo naisigale kubula mtondo wakwe, ivyo noitikimye momoto, isekudigwa kwaviya ni vintu vikukile.”<verse eid="EXO 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 29:35" />“Ivyo nivyo nowadamanyize Haluni na wanawe kutimilana na yose yadya hulagise, nowasente kwa mazuwa mfungate, <verse eid="EXO 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 29:36" />chila zuwa nolavye njeku itende lavyo dya kusa masa chani kutenda wivano, iviya nauikukize inchanja yo kulaviza intambiko na kuimyagila mavuta chani kuikukiza. <verse eid="EXO 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 29:37" />Kwa mazuwa mfungate nawitendele inchanja yo kulaviza intambiko wivano na kuikukiza. Ukaheza aho, inchanja iyo naitende ikukizwa vitendese na chochose nachidonte nachinde chikuka kwe nguvu yo ukuka wakwe.”<verse eid="EXO 29:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malavyo ya chila zuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 29:38" />“Chila zuwa, chipindi chose chikwiza, nolavye malavyo mlanga mwe inchanja yo kulaviza intambiko, ndolome mbili zina mhilimo umwenga. <verse eid="EXO 29:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 29:39" />Ndolome imwenga noilavye lavyo nomtondo intuhu nechisingi. <verse eid="EXO 29:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 29:40" />Hamwenga ndolome ya nkongo, nolavye chilo imwenga ya unga wedi usungigwe uhanganywe na lita imwenga ya mavuta yedi, na lita imwenga ya divai enga lavyo dya kunywa. <verse eid="EXO 29:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 29:41" />Seivyo naho, idya indolome intuhu ye chisingi noilavize ntambiko hamwenga na lavyo dya unga nadya kunywa enga viya udamanye mtondo. Mpofa ye ntambiko ikulavigwa kwa moto nainelele miye Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 29:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 29:42" />Lavyo idi dyo kutikimya nadilavigwe mazuwa yose, cheleko kubula cheleko, kulongozi kwangu miye Zumbe Chohile, kolwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile. Uko nanidugane na nyuwe na kulonga na weye Musa. <verse eid="EXO 29:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 29:43" />Aho naho nanidugane na Waizulaeli na ukulu wangu nauhatende ahantu aho hakuke. <verse eid="EXO 29:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 29:44" />Nanidikukize Idihema idyo ne inchanja yo kulaviza intambiko. Iviya naniwakukize Haluni na wanawe chani wanisankanile mwendima ya ulavyantambiko. <verse eid="EXO 29:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 29:45" />Nanikale mgati mwa Waizulaeli, miye nanitende Chohile ywawo. <verse eid="EXO 29:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 29:46" />Nawamanye kugamba miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywawo, niwaletile kulaila kwe isi ya Misili, chani nikale mgati mwawo. Miye ni Zumbe, Chohile ywawo.”<verse eid="EXO 29:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EXO 30" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo mwe chanja ya kokela Ubani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 30:1" />“Damanya shanduku kwa mbawo za mjoholo chani hatende hantu hakokela ubani. <verse eid="EXO 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 30:2" />Shanduku idyo naditende na ndendele nne ziligane, utali no wangalamu wakwe futi imwenga na nusu chila ntendele na chimo cha futi ntatu. Mahembe mwe zimpembe yatende yalungane nedishanduku dyenye. <verse eid="EXO 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 30:3" />Dyose nodihake zahabu yedi, ntendele yakwe ya kulanga, ntendele zakwe zose za mwe zimbavu ne zimpembe zakwe zose, naho na uizungulusize msilimbo wa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 30:4" />Idamanyize madanga maidi ya zahabu na kuyajela hasi ho msilimbo wakwe kwezintendele zose mbili zikusinyana, ayo nayatende hantu hakwingiziza imitengo yakuinuila. <verse eid="EXO 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 30:5" />Damanya mitengo ya mti wa mjoholo wa kuinuila, naho ihakwe zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 30:6" />Nchanja iyo ikigwe kulongozi kwedipaziya mnkanda mwe Dishanduku dye Dilagano kulongozi Hantu ha Mbazi hadya nanidugane na weye.”<verse eid="EXO 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 30:7" />“Chila zuwa mtondo, Haluni akengila kumalanya izita, navunkize ubani una mhempe wedi mlanga mwe iyo ishanduku. <verse eid="EXO 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 30:8" />Naho navunkize ubani chipindi cha chisingi akawasha izita. Lavyo dino dyo ubani nadilavigwe mazuwa yose disekujeza kulekwa mwe vyeleko vyenyu vyose vikwiza. <verse eid="EXO 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 30:9" />Kwedishanduku idyo, msekujeza kuvunkiza ubani hewikukizwe, naho msekulavya lavyo dya kutikimwa hegu lavyo dya unga hegu kumyagila lavyo dya kunywegwa mlanga mwakwe. <verse eid="EXO 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 30:10" />Haluni nadamanye wivano mlanga mwe zimpembe zikale enga mahembe ye idishanduku idyo nkanana imwenga du kwa mhilimo. Naidamanyize wivano kwa sakame ya kusizwa masa nkanana imwenga chila mhilimo mwe vyeleko vyenyu vyose kwaviya shanduku idyo dikuka vitendese kwangu miye Zumbe.”<verse eid="EXO 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kodi mwe Dihema Dikukile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 30:11" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="EXO 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 30:12" />“Chila ukawawaza Waizulaeli, chila yumwenga nalihe kodi kwachausa chakwe mwenye kulongozi kwangu chani hasekutenda na nkomano mgati mwawo chipindi wakawazwa. <verse eid="EXO 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 30:13" />Chila yumwenga nawazwe aungwa alihe hela ikuzumilika mwe vihimo vikigwe kulihwa mwe Dihema Dikukile. Dino ni lavyo dyakwe nanilavize. <verse eid="EXO 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 30:14" />Chila yumwenga nawazwe, kukongela mihilimo milongo midi na kujinka, nuyo nalavye ikodi iyo. <verse eid="EXO 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 30:15" />Mgoli asekulavya vitendese mchiwa naye aselavya vijeche nusu ye izihela zikigwe umo mkaliha ikodi iyo chani kudamanya wivano. <verse eid="EXO 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 30:16" />Weye nohokele hela izo zo wivano kulaila kwa Waizulaeli, wenawe nauzijeseze kwa ndima mwe Dihema Dikukile, iyo itende ni lukumbusa lwa Waizulaeli kulongozi kwangu, iyo ni kodi ya wikazi wenyu.”<verse eid="EXO 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalai kulu dya Shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 30:17" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="EXO 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 30:18" />“Damanya kalai kulu dya kutawaziza dina chitako cha shaba, udike hagatigati he Dihema Dikukile nedishanduku dyo kulaviza ntambiko, dijele mazi mndani mwakwe. <verse eid="EXO 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 30:19" />Haluni na wanawe nawajeseze amazi ayo kwa kusuntila imikono neviga vyawo, <verse eid="EXO 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 30:20" />hewenati kwingila mwe Didihema Dikukile hegu kusogeila idishanduku chani kunilaviza ntambiko miye Zumbe, ntambiko zikulavigwa kwa moto. Wadamanye ivyo wanase kubanika. <verse eid="EXO 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 30:21" />Waungwa wasunte imikono ne viga vyawo chani wanase kubanika. Dino naditende lagizo kwawo mazuwa yose, kukongela Haluni no lukolo lwakwe na vyeleko vyose mazuwa yose yakwiza.”<verse eid="EXO 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo mwe mavuta ya kuhaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 30:22" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="EXO 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 30:23" />“Guha vilungo vyedi vitendese savino, mavuta ya usula wa mti ukwitangwa manemane chilo mtandatu, unga wa mdalasini una mhempe wedi chilo ntatu, unga wa miguwa una mhempe wedi chilo ntatu, <verse eid="EXO 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 30:24" />mdalasini wesimane ukwitangwa kida chilo mtandatu, vihimo vyose vitende kutimilana na vihimo vye Dihema Dikukile, naho noguhe lita nne za mavuta ya mzaituni. <verse eid="EXO 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 30:25" />Kulawana ne vilungo ivyo nodamanye mavuta yakukile uyahanganye saviya mntu akudamanya mavuta yakupwepweleka, ayo nayajeseze kusenta vintu kwachausa cha Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 30:26" />Ukaheza ayo mavuta udihake Idihema Dikukile, ne Dishanduku dye Dilagano, <verse eid="EXO 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 30:27" />meza ne viya vyakwe vyose, chiya chokwikiya ita na viya vyakwe, ne Dishanduku dyo kuvunkiziza ubani, <verse eid="EXO 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 30:28" />no wani wa malavyo yo kutikimya ne viya vyakwe vyose, kalai kulu ne chitako chakwe. <verse eid="EXO 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 30:29" />Visente kwachausa changu, chani vitende vikuka vitendese. Chochose na chividonte iviya ivyo, nachitende chikuka. <verse eid="EXO 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 30:30" />Ukaheza mhake mavuta Haluni na wanawe na kuwakukiza, ivyo notende wawasenta kwachausa changu chani wanisankanile mwendima yo ulavyantambiko. <verse eid="EXO 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 30:31" />Wagambile Waizulaeli kugamba, ‘Mavuta yano nayatende mavuta yangu yakukile ya kuhaka mwe vyeleko vyenyu vyose. <verse eid="EXO 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 30:32" />Mavuta yano yasekujezwa kuhakwa mntu yoyose suyo mlavyantambiko, naho yasekudamanywa mavuta matuhu ye namna ino, yano ni mavuta yakukile, yaungwa yatende yakukile kwenyu mazuwa yose. <verse eid="EXO 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 30:33" />Yoyose nadamanye mavuta sayano, hegu kumhaka mntu hekuligana kuhakwa mavuta yano, mntu uyo nengaswe mwa wantu wangu.’”<verse eid="EXO 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo mwe ubani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 30:34" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Noguhe vihimo vikuligana vya vilungo vinamwile savino, usula wa natafi, na usula wa shekelesi, na usula wa kelibena na ubani wedi. <verse eid="EXO 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 30:35" />Vintu ivyo novijeseze kudamanyiza ubani saviya ukudamanywa ni mta kudamanya vintu vikupwepweleka, ujelwe munyu utende wedi na ukukile. <verse eid="EXO 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 30:36" />Ukaheza ubunde utende unga uhuhile, chani ujesezwe mndani mwe Dihema Dikukile na kudihaka Idishanduku dye Dilagano, hantu nanidugane na weye, uwo nautende ubani ukukise kwenyu. <verse eid="EXO 30:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 30:37" />Msekujeza kudamanya ubani una vilungo saivyo kwachausa chenyu kwaviya ubani uwo nautende ukukile kulongozi kwangu. <verse eid="EXO 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 30:38" />Mntu yoyose nadamanye ubani wenamna iyo na kuujeseza saviya mavunkizo yakwe mwenye, nengaswe hale mwa wantu wangu.”<verse eid="EXO 30:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EXO 31" />
  <para style="s">Wandima wakudamanya Idihema Dikukile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 31:1" />Zumbe kamgamba Musa, <verse eid="EXO 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 31:2" />“Kaula simsagula Bezaleli, mwana ywa Huli, mwezukulu ywa kabila dya Yuda, <verse eid="EXO 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 31:3" />na simmemeza Muye wangu. Atende na ubala utendese na umanyi wa kudamanya vintu vyesimile, <verse eid="EXO 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 31:4" />chani abunkule na kudamanya ndima za kusana, asane vintu vya zahabu na mayuwe ya feza na mayuwe ya shaba. <verse eid="EXO 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 31:5" />Simwinka umanyi wa kusongola vintu vya mbawo na umanyi wesimile wa kukanta mayuwe ya yombe kulu nakudamanya ndima za chifundi. <verse eid="EXO 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 31:6" />Ivyodu simsagula Oholiabu mwana ywa Ahisamaki ywa kabila dya Dani, adamanye ndima hamwenga naye. Naho seivyo siwenka udahi mkulu wantu watuhu kwa chausa cha ndima zesimile, chani wadamanye viya vyose nilagise vidamanywe. <verse eid="EXO 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 31:7" />Hema ikukile, shanduku dye Dilagano na ngubiko ikwitangwa Hantu Hambazi, na viya vyose vye Dihema, <verse eid="EXO 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 31:8" />meza na viya vyakwe, chiya chakwiya taa chidamanywe kwa zahabu yedi na viya vyakwe, na nchanja ya kuvunkiziza ubani, <verse eid="EXO 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 31:9" />na inchanja ya kutikimya malavyo na viya vyakwe vyose, na kalai kulu dya kwelenngusiza ne chitako chakwe, <verse eid="EXO 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 31:10" />suche ntana vitendese ya mlavyantambiko Haluni na wanawe kwachausa che ndima yo ulavyantambiko, <verse eid="EXO 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 31:11" />mavuta ya kuhaka na ubani una mhempe wedi kwa chausa cha Hantu Hakukile. Vintu ivyo vyose na vidamanywe kuligana saviya hulagise.”<verse eid="EXO 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo mwe zuwa dya Kuhumula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 31:12" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="EXO 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 31:13" />Wagambile Waizulaeli vino, “Nyuwe na mtoze Mazuwa yangu ya kuhumula, kwaviya icho ni chilagiso mgati mwenyu na miye kwa vyeleko vyose kugamba miye siwasagulani mtende wantu wangu. <verse eid="EXO 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 31:14" />Mditoze Zuwa dya kuhumula, nadyo naditende zuwa dikukile kwenyu. Yoyose nadijele uzavu idizuwa idyo vyaungwa akomwe. Mntu nadamanye ndima yoyose mwe dizuwa idyo nengaswe mwa wantu wangu. <verse eid="EXO 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 31:15" />Damanyani ndima kwa mazuwa mtandatu, mna zuwa dya mfungate ni Zuwa dya Kuhumula du, ni zuwa dyangu Dikukile. Mntu yoyose nadamanye ndima yoyose mwe Idizuwa idyo vyaungwa akomwe. <verse eid="EXO 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 31:16" />Kwaivyo Waizulaeli nawatoze zuwa dya Kuhumula mwe vyeleko vyawo vyose saviya chilagiso cha lagano dya mazuwa yose. <verse eid="EXO 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 31:17" />Ulosi uno nautende chilagiso cha mazuwa yose mgati mwa Waizulaeli na miye, kwaviya miye Zumbe nadamanyaga imbingu ne isi kwa chipindi cha mazuwa mtandatu, mna zuwa dya mfungate nasileka kudamanya ndima, niyo nahumula.” <verse eid="EXO 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 31:18" />Chohile eze aheze kulonga na Musa molugulu lwa Sinai, niyo amwinka Musa viya ivibawo vidi vya mayuwe viya yeye Chohile awandike yadya malagizo kwa dole dakwe mwenye.<verse eid="EXO 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EXO 32" />
  <para style="s">Tukulu dya Zahabu dikale enga njeku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 32:1" />Wantu weze wawone kugamba Musa kakawa ukuya kulaila kolugulu, wachintana kulongozi kwa Haluni na kumgamba, “Hake! Chidamanyize milungu naichilongoze kwaviya hachimanyize dimbwile Musa uyo achilavize mwe isi ya Misili, ivyo damanya tukulu dya zahabu dikale enga njeku ditende mlungu dichilongoze.” <verse eid="EXO 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 32:2" />Haluni niyo awagamba, “Guhani sitadi za zahabu mwamagutwi ya wavyele wenyu, na wenenyu we chiche mnigaile.” <verse eid="EXO 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 32:3" />Ivyo, wantu wose niyo wavula sitadi zose za zahabu mwa magutwi yawo, wamwigaila Haluni. <verse eid="EXO 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 32:4" />Kaziguha nakuzilujula, na kusana tukulu dikale enga ndama.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 32:4">Wantu niyo waguta, “Weye Izulaeli, nuyo mnungu ywetu achilavize kwe isi ya Misili.”<verse eid="EXO 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 32:5" />Akaheza Haluni niyo adizengela idyo itukulu dye ndama nchanja kulongozi kwakwe, Haluni niyo alonga, “Luvi nakutende na chinyemi kwa chausa cha Zumbe.” <verse eid="EXO 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 32:6" />Luvi dyakwe mtondo wantu niyo wenuka walavya malavyo ya kutikimya, na malavyo ya utondowazi kwa Chohile. Wantu wekala hasi wadya na kunywa, wakaheza wachimala na kuvina vikwihiza.<verse eid="EXO 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 32:7" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Sela hasi kwaviya wantu wako uwaletile kulaila kwe isi ya Misili wadamanya wavu na kunilemela, <verse eid="EXO 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 32:8" />Waleka kale isila idya niwalagize, wedamanyiza tukulu dya ndama, nawo wadivikila na kudilaviza ntambiko wakagamba, ‘Weye Izulaeli, nuyo mnungu ywetu uchilavize mwe isi ya Misili!’” <verse eid="EXO 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 32:9" />Naho Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Miye simanya kugamba wantu wano, wana mitwi midala. <verse eid="EXO 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 32:10" />Haluse, usekujeza kunichinda. Nileka niwakome kwa maya yatendese. Vikaheza kulaila kwako nahutende utende na wantu walozize.”<verse eid="EXO 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 32:11" />Mna Musa kamweila Zumbe, Chohile ywakwe, akagamba, “Bwawe Zumbe, nimbwani ukatenda na maya sayano kwa wantu wako uwalavize kwe isi ya Misili kwa udahi mkulu na mkono una nguvu? <verse eid="EXO 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 32:12" />Unadamanya ivyo, Wamisili nawalonge, wakagamba, ‘Kawalavya kwa wihi chani akawakomele kolugulu na kuwabinda pele mwe isi.’ Bwawe Zumbe Chohile, seleza amaya yako yatendese na kuileka imbuli ino ihiye ungile udamanye kwa wantu wako. <verse eid="EXO 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 32:13" />Wakumbuke wandima wako, Bulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo wadya uwelisize weye mwenye, ukagamba, ‘Nanongeze lweleko lwenyu saviya ntondo za kwe mbingu mwe isi yose ino niwenkileni lweleko lwenyu itende yawo mazuwa yose.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 32:14" />Ivyo, Zumbe niyo ahitwila izifanyanyi zakwe za kuwadamanyiza wantu wakwe udya ulosi wihiye endile alongile.<verse eid="EXO 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 32:15" />Musa kasela kulaila kolugulu akatenda na vibawo vidi vya mayuwe viwandikwe malagizo ya Chohile, vibawo viwandikwe ntendele zose mbili. <verse eid="EXO 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 32:16" />Vibawo ivyo navidamanywa ni Chohile mwenye na mawandiko ayo nakawandika yeye mwenye.<verse eid="EXO 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 32:17" />Yoshuwa eze eve ulwasu lwa wantu, amgamba Musa, “Kuna lwasu lwa nkondo kwe nkambi.”<verse eid="EXO 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 32:18" />Mna Musa amhitula, “Sulo lwasu lwa kuhuda hegu lwasu lwa kuhudwa, mna lwasu hwiva ni lwasu lwa wantu wakuchema.”<verse eid="EXO 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 32:19" />Weze wabule haguhi nenkambi wawona diya iditukulu dikale enga ndama na wantu wakuvina, aho Musa kemukwa ni maya enga moto, kavidula hasi viya ivibao kulaila mwe mikono yakwe niyo vyatulika hadya hasi holugulu. <verse eid="EXO 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 32:20" />Ivyo, niyo aguha diya iditukulu dikale enga ndama na kudyoka moto, nakudisiliginta kubula ditenda unga, kakologa unga uwo mwe mazi na kuwalahiliza Waizulaeli wanywe.<verse eid="EXO 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 32:21" />Musa amuza Haluni, “Wantu wano wakutenda mbwani ukawajela mwe masa makulu sayano?”<verse eid="EXO 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 32:22" />Haluni amhitula, “Nakulombeza sekulu yangu maya yako yasekunimukila miye mndima ywako. Kuwamanya wantu wano wahingiza kudamanya yehiye. <verse eid="EXO 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 32:23" />Wanigamba, ‘Chidamanyize milungu naichilongoze kwaviya uyo Musa achilavize mwe isi ya Misili hachimanyize idyo dimbwile.’ <verse eid="EXO 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 32:24" />Siwagamba, chila yumwenga mta vintu vya zahabu anigaile. Ivyo, waninka, miye sividula momoto niyo vyalujuka niyo nasana tukulu dya ino indama.”<verse eid="EXO 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 32:25" />Ivyo, Musa eze awone kugamba wantu awo wahitukila na kudamanya viya wakunga, kwaviya Haluni kawaleka wahitukile wadanye viya wakunga, na kwejela soni kulongozi kwa wankondo wawo. <verse eid="EXO 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 32:26" />Musa niyo achimala kulongozi kwe nchili ye nkambi niyo agamba, “Mntu yoyose akumwiva Zumbe neze kwangu.” Welekwa wose wa Lawi welunja hamwenga kulongozi kwakwe. <verse eid="EXO 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 32:27" />Awagamba, “Zumbe, Chohile ywa Izulaeli, agamba vino, ‘Chila mntu nachoheke bamba dyakwe mwechigudi, azunguluke chila hantu mwenkambi, kulaila mwe nchili imwenga kubula ntuhu, na chila yumwenga amkome mlukolo ywakwe, mbuyaye na ehaguhi hakwe.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 32:28" />Wantu wose welekwa wa Lawi wadamanya saviya Musa awalagize. Zuwa idyo wakomwa wantu wakubula magana milongo mitatu. <verse eid="EXO 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 32:29" />Musa awagamba Walawi, “Dyelo mwesenta nyuwe wenye kwa kumsankanila Zumbe Chohile, kwaviya hamlekile kuwakoma wanenyu hegu walukolo wenyu. Chohile awajimbikeni dyelo dino.”<verse eid="EXO 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa awalombezeza Waizulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 32:30" />Mtondo wakwe Musa awagamba wantu, “Mkolesa masa! Haluse na nikwele kolugulu naho, mafani nadaha kudamanya wivano kwa chausa cha masa yenyu.” <verse eid="EXO 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 32:31" />Ivyo Musa niyo auya kwa Zumbe Chohile, na kumgamba, “Neila! Wantu wano wakolesa masa. Wedamanyiza wenye tukulu dya ndama na kudivikila. <verse eid="EXO 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 32:32" />Mna haluse, nakulombeza uwalekeile masa yawo. Uneva huna walekeile, nakweila unuse miye mwe chitabu uwandike wantu wako.”<verse eid="EXO 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 32:33" />Mna Zumbe Chohile amgamba Musa, “Nanimuse mwe chitabu changu mntu yoyose anikoile masa. <verse eid="EXO 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 32:34" />Mna haluse hita ukawalongoze wantu kubula hantu hugambile. Kaula, mndima ywangu ywa kwembingu na kulongwele. Hata ivyo, zuwa dya kukantila aho dikwizila, naniwakantile kwa chausa cha masa yawo.”<verse eid="EXO 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 32:35" />Zumbe niyo awegaila wantu unyonje wa tauni, kwa viya na wamtenda Haluni awadamanyize tukulu dikwinga ndama ya zahabu.<verse eid="EXO 32:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EXO 33" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe amlagiza Musa wajendeleze ne ntambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 33:1" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Halaweni hano, weye na awantu awo uwalavize mwe isi ya Misili, mwite mwe isi nilagane na Bulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo, hagamba, ‘Naniwenke welekwa wenyu isi ino.’ <verse eid="EXO 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 33:2" />Nanimlagize mndima ywangu ywa kwembingu awalongoze. Naniwabalaze Wakanani na Waamoli na Wahiti na Wapelizi na Wahivi na Wayebusi. <verse eid="EXO 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 33:3" />Hitani kwe isi iyo yedi na ntana ikuwagila kwa kulima na kufuga. Mna kwaviya mitwi yenyu ni midala, sanite hamwenga na nyuwe, ninase kuwakomani mwe sila.”<verse eid="EXO 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 33:4" />Wantu weze weve izimbuli izo zihiye waila, naho hahana mntu availe vintu vyawo vidamanywe kwa mayuwe ya yombe kulu. <verse eid="EXO 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 33:5" />Waila kwaviya Zumbe kamgamba Musa awagambe, “Nyuwe Waizulaeli, mwiwantu hemkwiva, uneva ninaitanya na nyuwe chipindi chiguhi du, nani wakomeni. ‘Ivyo hambulani mahambo yenyu chani nimanye ivyo vyo kuwadamanyani.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 33:6" />Ivyo, Waizulaeli wahambula mahambo yawo kukongela hadya wakulaile kolugulu lwa Holebu naho lwetangwa Sinai.<verse eid="EXO 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hema Dikukile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 33:7" />Wantu wa Izulaeli hadya wakatamba, na chila hantu wachimale na kuzenga nkambi kwa chausa cha kuhumula, naho Musa endile akaguha Idihema Dikukile nakudizenga kuse kwenkambi, kaditanga idihema idyo, Hema Dikukile. Mntu yoyose akunga kuza ulosi wowose kwa Zumbe aita kwe Dihema Dikukile kuse kwe nkambi. <verse eid="EXO 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 33:8" />Chila nkanana Musa akaita kwe Dihema idyo, chila mntu nakachimala holwivi lwe dihema dyakwe na kumkaula Musa kubula akengila mndani mwe Idihema idyo. <verse eid="EXO 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 33:9" />Hadya Musa akwingila mndani mwe Dihema idyo, nguzo ya ingu yasela na kuchimala holwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile, na Zumbe alonga na Musa. <verse eid="EXO 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 33:10" />Wantu wose weze wawone idya inguzo ye idingu ichimala mo lwivi lwe Idihema, chila yumwe kachimala na kwenamila hasi holwivi lwe dihema dyakwe na kuvika. <verse eid="EXO 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 33:11" />Ivyo nivyo Zumbe endile akalonga na Musa chimntumntu, saviya mntu na mbuyaye. Akaheza Musa auya vituhu kwe nkambi. Uyo mbwanga Yoshua mwana ywa Nuni yudya endile mndima ywakwe hamlaile mwe Dihema Dikukile.<verse eid="EXO 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe Kalagana kutenda na Wantu wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 33:12" />Musa amgamba Zumbe, “Kaula! Weye wanigamba, ‘Walongoze wantu wano.’ Mna hunigambile niyuhi nomsigile anambize. Hata ivyo kugamba kunimanya kwa zina naho kugamba sizumilwa kulongozi kwako. <verse eid="EXO 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 33:13" />Elo haluse, nakweila, uneva chindedi sizumilwa kulongozi kwako, nilagisa haluse izisila zako, chani humanye na kwinkwa wedi wako kulongozi kwako. Nalombeza ukumbuke naho kugamba isi ino ni wantu wako.”<verse eid="EXO 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 33:14" />Zumbe agamba, “Miye mwenye nanite hamwenga na weye, naho nahwinke mbwedo.”<verse eid="EXO 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 33:15" />Musa agamba, “Uneva weye hawite hamwenga na miye, ivyo, usekuchusa hano hantu. <verse eid="EXO 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 33:16" />Elo watuhu nawamanye vivihi kugamba sizumilwa kulongozi kwako, miye na wantu wako uneva hawite hamwenga na suwe? Unaita hamwenga na suwe navichitende miye na wantu wako chitende wantu wesimile mgati mwa wantu wose mwe isi.”<verse eid="EXO 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 33:17" />Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Kwaviya kuzumilwa kulongozi kwangu, miye nami sikumanya kwa zina dyako, chino chintu ulongile nanichidamanye.”<verse eid="EXO 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 33:18" />Musa agamba, “Nalombeza unilagise ung'azi wo ukulu wako.”<verse eid="EXO 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 33:19" />Zumbe amhitula, “Nanijinke kulongozi kwako na kukulagisa wedi wangu wose hadilonga pwipwipwi idizina dyangu. Miye namtendela yedi yudya hunga nimtendele yedi. Nakumuwonela mbazi yudya hunga nimwonele mbazi. <verse eid="EXO 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 33:20" />Mna honiwone uso wangu kwaviya hahana mntu yoyose na niwone niyo ajendeleza kwikala.” <verse eid="EXO 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 33:21" />Akaheza Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Kaula hana hantu hajihi na miye aho nochimale mlanga mwe yuwe. <verse eid="EXO 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 33:22" />Ung'azi wo ukulu wangu umo ukajinka, nahujele mwe mpanga mwe idyo idiyuwe na kukugubika kwa mkono wangu, kubula hadya nanomboke. <verse eid="EXO 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 33:23" />Akaheza nanuse umkono wangu wenawe nauwone umgongo wangu, mna uso wangu hauwone.”<verse eid="EXO 33:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EXO 34" />
  <para style="s">Vibawo vihya vya Lagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 34:1" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Songola vibawo vidi vya mayuwe saviya vya nkongo, miye naniwandike milosi idya yendile mwe vibawo viya vya nkongo utwile. <verse eid="EXO 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 34:2" />Luvi mtondo utende kwemalanya kale, wize udugane na miye kulanga kolunenengwe lolugulu lwa Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 34:3" />Mntu yoyose asekwiza hamwenga na weye, naho asekuwoneka kolugulu, hegu ngoto hegu ng'ombe zise kudimwa haguhi hakwe.” <verse eid="EXO 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 34:4" />Ivyo, Musa niyo asongola vibawo vidi vya mayuwe saviya vya nkongo. Mtondo chilochilo ahalawa, akwela kulanga kolugulu lwa Sinai, saviya Zumbe amlagize, akatenda naviya ivibawo ividi vya mayuwe mwe mikono yakwe.<verse eid="EXO 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 34:5" />Zumbe niyo asela mwe diya idingu, kachimala hamwenga na Musa, akalonga idizina dyakwe, “Zumbe Chohile.” <verse eid="EXO 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 34:6" />Akaheza Zumbe ajinka kulongozi kwa Musa akalonga vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 34:6">“Miye Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 34:6">ni Chohile mta wedi na mta mbazi kwa wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 34:6">suyo mhufu ywa maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 34:6">siloza ungi na ukanuni.<verse eid="EXO 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 34:7" />Miye naniwaunga wantu vyeleko kwa vyeleko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 34:7">mta kulekeila wavu na ubanasi na masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 34:7">mna sanileke kumkantila mbanasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 34:7">mta kuwenkiliza wana na wezukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 34:7">wavu wa watati zawo, na wababa zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 34:7">kubula cheleko cha katatu na cha kane.”<verse eid="EXO 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 34:8" />Musa niyo asunguza kufika madi nakwinamiza umtwi wakwe kubula hasi, amvikila Chohile. <verse eid="EXO 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 34:9" />Akaheza agamba, “Weye Zumbe dyangu, hegu sizumilwa kulongozi kwako, nakulombeza wite na suwe. Wantu wano mitwi yawo ni midala, mna chilekele wavu wetu na masa yetu, uchihokele saviya wantu wako mwenye.”<verse eid="EXO 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lagano dyadamanywa Uhya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 34:10" />Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Haluse nanidamanye lagano na wantu wa Waizulaeli. Nanidamanye maula kulongozi kwawo ayo heyenati kutendwa mwe isi yose, naho mwe wantu wowose. Na wantu wose mkwikala mgati mwawo nawawone ntendwa zangu nkulu. Kwaviya nanidamanye ntendwa ya maula kwa chausa chako.”<verse eid="EXO 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 34:11" />“Mtoze malagizo huwenkani dyelo. Nani wabalaze kulongozi kwenyu Waamoli na Wakanani na Wahiti na Wapelezi na Wahivi na Wayebusi. <verse eid="EXO 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 34:12" />Mkaulise mnase kudamanya lagano na wekazi we isi mkwita, kwaviya idyo na ditende mtego mgati mwenyu. <verse eid="EXO 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 34:13" />Mna nambomole izinchanja zawo zokulaviza ntambiko, namvune nguzo zawo zo kuvikila tukulu dyawo dya mlungu ywa chivyele akwitangwa Ashela.”<verse eid="EXO 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 34:14" />“Msekuvikila milungu yoyose mituhu, kwaviya Miye Zumbe Chohile ni mta chisetama, kwaviya nanihiwe mnavikila mlungu mtuhu. <verse eid="EXO 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 34:15" />Msekudamanya wivano wowose na wekazi we isi iyo, kwaviya hadya nawavikile milungu yawo ya udanti na kuilaviza malavyo, nawawagonekeni chani mdye nkande walavize wakavikila milungu yawo. <verse eid="EXO 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 34:16" />Wabwanga wenyu wanasola wandele wawo, na wandele awo wakuvikila milungu yawo nawawaluvye wabwanga wenyu nawatimile milungu yawo.”<verse eid="EXO 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 34:17" />“Msekwedamanyiza milungu ya udanti ya chuma na.”<verse eid="EXO 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 34:18" />“Chila mhilimo mo mwezi wa Abibu, namtende ngasu ya migate heigwaduswe. Kwa mazuwa mfungate namdye migate heigwaduswe, saviya niwalagizeni, kwaviya mo mwezi uwo wa Abibu mwalawaga Misili.”<verse eid="EXO 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 34:19" />“Chila mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa chilume ni ywangu, na ywa nkongo ywa chilume ywa mnyama yose ni kwachausa changu. <verse eid="EXO 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 34:20" />Mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa mpunda na umkombole na ngoto, naho uneva hunamkombole, namkome kwa kumfyola isingo. Wana wenyu wose welekwa wa nkongo nowakombole.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:20">“Naho hahana neze kulongozi kwangu mikono ibule.”<verse eid="EXO 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 34:21" />“Mazuwa mtandatu namdamanye ndima, mna zuwa dya mfungate namhumule, hatahegu vikatenda ni chipindi cha kulima hegu chipindi cha kuvuna.”<verse eid="EXO 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 34:22" />“Namtoze zuwa dya ngasu ya ulozo nkongelo mwe chipindi cho kuvuna uhemba, na kudamanya ngasu ya kuchisanya ulozo mo udumo wo mhilimo.”<verse eid="EXO 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 34:23" />“Nkanana ntatu kwa mhilimo wagosi wose nawadugane kulongozi wanivikile miye Zumbe, Chohile ywa Waizulaeli. <verse eid="EXO 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 34:24" />Nanibalaze wantu watuhu kulongozi kwenyu na kwangalamula isi yenyu, hahana mntu yoyose natahe isi yenyu hadya na mkwele nkanana ntatu chila mhilimo kunivikila miye Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="EXO 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 34:25" />“Msekunilaviza sakame ya lavyo dyangu hamwenga na chintu chochose chigwaduswe, naho mse kwika lavyo dyodyose dya zuwa dya ngasu ya Pasaka disigale kubula mtondo.”<verse eid="EXO 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 34:26" />“Ulozo wa nkongo we nkonde yako nowigale mwe nyumba yangu miye Zumbe, Chohile ywako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:26">“Usekwambika nyama ya mwana ngoto hegu nyama ya mwana mbuzi mwa mele ya nine.”<verse eid="EXO 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 34:27" />Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Wandika milosi ino, kwaviya kuligana na milosi ino, nanidamanya lagano na weye na wantu wa Izulaeli.” <verse eid="EXO 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 34:28" />Musa kekala uko ko lugulu hamwenga na Zumbe mazuwa milongo mine, msi na chilo, hadile nkande naho hanywele mazi. Kawandika milosi yose ye dilagano ne Miko Mlongo.<verse eid="EXO 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa Asela kulaila Kolugulu lwa Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 34:29" />Umo Musa akasela kulaila kolugulu lwa Sinai na viya ivibawo ividi viwandikwe Miko mlongo ye dilagano mwe mikono yakwe, hamanyize kugamba uso wakwe nendile ukang'ala kwaviya nakalonga na Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 34:30" />Ivyo, Haluni na wantu wose Waizulaeli weze wamwone wogoha kumsogeila, kwaviya uso wakwe nendile ukang'alisa. <verse eid="EXO 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 34:31" />Mna Musa niyo amwitanga Haluni na vilongozi wa wantu wa Izulaeli waite hajihi naye, akaheza alonga nawo. <verse eid="EXO 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 34:32" />Vikaheza Waizulaeli wose weza haguhi naye, uyo kawenka malagizo yose yadya Zumbe amwinkile kudya kolugulu lwa Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 34:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 34:33" />Musa eze abinde kutamwila na wantu kagubika uso wakwe kwa chitambala. <verse eid="EXO 34:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 34:34" />Mna vitenda kugamba chila nkanana Musa akaita kulonga na Zumbe mwe Dihema Dikukile, ausa chiya ichitambala kubula hadya akulaila kuse. Eze afose kawagambila Waizulaeli mbuli zose agambilwe ni Zumbe, <verse eid="EXO 34:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 34:35" />nawo Waizulaeli wauwona uso wakwe wang'ala, naho Musa agubike vituhu uso wakwe kwa chitambala kubula hadya akwitila kulonga na Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="EXO 34:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EXO 35" />
  <para style="s">Miko ya Zuwa dya kuhumula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 35:1" />Musa kawachisanya wantu wose wa Izulaeli, niyo awagamba, “Ino niyo milosi Zumbe awalagizeni mdamanye. <verse eid="EXO 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 35:2" />Damanyani ndima zenyu kwa mazuwa mtandatu, mna zuwa dya mfungate ni Zuwa dya Kuhumula idyo dikuka kwa Zumbe. Yoyose nadamanye ndima mwe idizuwa idyo vyaungwa akomwe. <verse eid="EXO 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 35:3" />Msekujeza kujimba moto aho mkwikala zuwa dya kuhumula.”<verse eid="EXO 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vintu kwa chausa cha Hema Dikukile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 35:4" />Musa kawagambila wantu wose wa Izulaeli, “Uno nulosi Zumbe awalagizeni mdamanye. <verse eid="EXO 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 35:5" />Namlavye mwo ugoli wenyu malavyo ya kumwinka Zumbe. Chila mntu mta moyo wedi namwigaile Zumbe malavyo ya zahabu na feza na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 35:6" />nyuzi zibuluu na nyuzi zambalau na nyuzi zinkundu, chitambala chedi ching'aile chilukigwe na mazoya ya mbuzi, <verse eid="EXO 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 35:7" />mikota ya ndolome ihakigwe langi inkundu, mikota ya mbuzi na mbawo za mjoholo, <verse eid="EXO 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 35:8" />mavuta kwa chausa cha taa na vilungo kwa cha mavuta ya kuhaka na kwachausa cha ubani una mhempe wedi, <verse eid="EXO 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 35:9" />mayuwe ya sadoniki na mayuwe matuhu kwachausa cha untanda wa kasuche kamwechifuwa.”<verse eid="EXO 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vimpandwa vye Dihema Dikukile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 35:10" />“Chila mntu mta umanyi wa ndima siku mgati mwenyu neze adamanye vintu vyose alagize Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 35:11" />Kudamanya Hema Dikukile na ngubiko yakwe na paziya dyakwe na vifungilo vyakwe, misomo yakwe na vyegamilo vyakwe, <verse eid="EXO 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 35:12" />Shanduku dye Dilagano hamwenga ne mitengo yakwe yokudinuila na ingubiko yakwe na paziya dya kusenta Hantu Hakukile na Hantu Hakukise, <verse eid="EXO 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 35:13" />meza ya kwikiya migate ne mitengo yakwe yo kwinuila hamwenga na viya vyakwe vyose, migate ilavigwe kulongozi kwa Chohile, <verse eid="EXO 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 35:14" />viya vya kwikiya taa hamwenga na viya vyakwe vyose, taa zakwe na mavuta yakwe, <verse eid="EXO 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 35:15" />shanduku dya kuvunkiziza ubani ne mitengo yakwe yokuinuila na mavuta ya kuhaka na ubani una mhempe wedi ne paziya dya mwo lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile, <verse eid="EXO 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 35:16" />shanduku dya malavyo ya kutikimywa hamwenga na lwavu lwa shaba, mitengo yakwe hamwenga na viya vyakwe, kalai kulu na chitako chakwe, <verse eid="EXO 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 35:17" />mapaziya yo uwa na nguzo zakwe na vitako vyakwe na paziya dyo lwivi lo uwa we Dihema, <verse eid="EXO 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 35:18" />vijinji vye Dihema Dikukile na vijinji vyo uwa hamwenga na sigi zakwe, <verse eid="EXO 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 35:19" />suche zisumigwe vyedi vitendese kwa chausa cha ndima ya Hantu Hakukile. Izo ni suche zikukile za mlavyantambiko Haluni na wanawe kwachausa cha ndima ya ulavyantambiko.”<verse eid="EXO 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu Wegala Malavyo yawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 35:20" />Wantu wose wa Izulaeli wahalawa kulongozi kwa Musa. <verse eid="EXO 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 35:21" />Chila mntu aungile mo moyo wakwe kamlaviza Chohile lavyo dyakwe kwa chausa che Dihema Dikukile na ndima zakwe zose na suche zakwe zikukile. <verse eid="EXO 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 35:22" />Elo wose wata moyo wedi, wagosi na wavyele kwa wegala mahambo ya zahabu na sitadi za mwamagutwi na mpete na madanga ya hula na minyolo na viya vyose vya zahabu na chila mntu kamlaviza Zumbe chintu cha zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 35:23" />Chila mntu endile na nyuzi za langi ya buluu na inkundu hegu chitambala chedi ching'aile hegu mkota wa ngoto uhakigwe langi inkundu hegu mkota wa mbuzi nakegala. <verse eid="EXO 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 35:24" />Chila mntu adahile kulavya mayuwe ya feza hegu shaba kegala kwa Zumbe enga lavyo dyakwe. Naho mntu yoyose endile na mbawo za mjoholo iviya kazigala. <verse eid="EXO 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 35:25" />Wavyele wose wendile na umanyi wa kuluka wegala nyuzi za kulukila za langi ya buluu na zambalau na inkundu, <verse eid="EXO 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 35:26" />wavyele wose wendile na umanyi wa kuluka, waluka mazoya ya mbuzi. <verse eid="EXO 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 35:27" />Vilongozi wegala mayuwe yakwitangwa sadoniki na mayuwe matuhu kwa chausa cha untanda mwa kasuche kakugubika mwechifuwa na kakwiji kamwechifua, <verse eid="EXO 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 35:28" />iviya wegala vilungo na mavuta kwachausa che ita na mavuta ya kuhaka na ubani una mhempe wedi. <verse eid="EXO 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 35:29" />Waizulaeli wose, wagosi kwa wavyele, wadya wongile mwe myoyo yawo kwigala chochose kwa chausa cha ndima idya Zumbe amsigile Musa aidamanye, wegala vintu ivyo wowo wenye, saviya malavyo ya kumwinka Zumbe.<verse eid="EXO 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandima wa Kudamanya Hema Dikukile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 35:30" />Musa kawagamba Waizulaeli, “Kaulani! Zumbe kamsagula Bezaleli, tati yakwe ni Uli, iviya babakwe ni Huli, ywa kabila dya Yuda. <verse eid="EXO 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 35:31" />Kammemeza Muye wakwe, kamwinka umanyi na fanyanyi na ubala wa kudamanya ndima zose, <verse eid="EXO 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 35:32" />aike mizungu kudolonya chiumanyi, na kudamanya ndima ya kufula zahabu na mayuwe ya feza na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 35:33" />asongole mayuwe ya kuhambila na vintu vyakwe vyo kwikiya na mbawo kwa chausa cha ndima ntuhu zose za kiumanyi. <verse eid="EXO 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 35:34" />Naho kamwinka udahi yeye na Oholiabu mwana ywa Ahisamaki wa kabila dya Dani, wadahe kuwahinya watuhu. <verse eid="EXO 35:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 35:35" />Kawenka umanyi wa kudamanya chila ndima ya kusana hegu ikudamanywa ni wantu wa kuluka hegu wamanyi wa kusuma kwa nyuzi za langi ibuluu na zambalau na inkundu na chitambala ching'aile chedi chilukigwe kwa kujeseza umanyi wose wa ubala.”<verse eid="EXO 35:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EXO 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 36:1" />“Bezaleli na Oholiabu, hamwenga na chila mntu yudya Zumbe amwinkile umanyi na fanyanyi za kumanya vikungwa mwezindima zose zo uzesi we Dihema Dikukile, nadamanye kuligana na yose yadya Zumbe alagize.”<verse eid="EXO 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wegala Malavyo yalozize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 36:2" />Musa kamwitanga Bezaleli na Oholiabu na chila mntu yudya endile enkingwe umanyi ni Zumbe, na chila mntu yudya moyo wakwe umtintisa adamanye indima iyo, <verse eid="EXO 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 36:3" />Awo wahokela kulaila kwa Musa vintu vyose vilavigwe ni Waizulaeli kwa moyo uchumile kwa chausa che Dihema Dikukile. Mna wantu wajendeleza kumwigaila Musa malavyo yawo chila mtondo kwakunga kwawo. <verse eid="EXO 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 36:4" />Elo wantu wose wata umanyi nawakadamanya ndima za chifundi za kuzenga Hema Dikukile, chila yumwenga kaleka ndima yakwe, wambasa Musa, <verse eid="EXO 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 36:5" />Wamgamba, “Wantu wegala vintu vilozese kujinka viya vikungwa mwendima ya Zumbe achilagize chidamanye.”<verse eid="EXO 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 36:6" />Ivyo, Musa kalagiza, “Mntu yoyose, atende mgosi hegu mvyele, asekwigala lavyo tuhu kwa chausa che Dihema Dikukile.” Wantu niyo wachindwa wasekwigala vintu, <verse eid="EXO 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 36:7" />Kwa viya vintu wegale vichinta kwe indima iyo na kusigala.<verse eid="EXO 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzenga Hema Dikukile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 36:8" />Wagosi wose wata umanyi wazenga hema Dikukile kwa mapaziya mlongo yadamanywe kwa chitambala chedi chinga'aile chilukigwe na kuhambwa kwa nyuzi za langi ibuluu na zambalau na inkundu na kuluka vyumbe vina mawawa vikwitangwa makelubi. <verse eid="EXO 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 36:9" />Utali wa chila paziya wendaga futi milongo mine na mbili, wangalamu wakwe wendaga futi mtandatu. Mapaziya yose yendaga na chihimo chimwenga. <verse eid="EXO 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 36:10" />Kayalunganya mapaziya mashano kutenda chihande chimwenga, niyo adamanya seivyo yadya amashano amatuhu. <verse eid="EXO 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 36:11" />Kadamanya matasi ya langi ya samawi mwedipindo dye dipaziya idimwenga mwe dipindo dye chilungo chakwe, kadamanya seivyo mwedipindo dye dipaziya dyendile ntendele ya kuse kwe chilungo cha kaidi. <verse eid="EXO 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 36:12" />Kajela matasi milongo mishano mwe paziya dimwenga, na matasi milongo mishano kumpezo kwedipindo dye dipaziya dyendile kumpezo kwakaidi, matasi ayo nendile yakasinyana. <verse eid="EXO 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 36:13" />Akaheza kadamanya ndwana milongo mishano vya zahabu, na kuyalunganya ayo amapaziya dino na dino kwaziya izindwana, ivyo ditenda hema dimwenga.<verse eid="EXO 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 36:14" />Akaheza kadamanya naho ngubiko ya hema kwa mapaziya mlongo nadimwenga kwa suche idamanywe kwa mazoya ya mbuzi. <verse eid="EXO 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 36:15" />Chila paziya nendile dina utali wa futi milongo mine na shano wangalamu wakwe futi mtandatu. Mapaziya yose mlongo na dimwenga nendile yana chihimo chimwenga. <verse eid="EXO 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 36:16" />Ivyo, kayalunganya amapaziya mashano hamwenga, na mapaziya mtandatu hamwenga. <verse eid="EXO 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 36:17" />Akaheza kadamanya matasi milongo mishano mo uhelo we chihande cha nkongo cha mapaziya, na matasi matuhu milongo mishano mwe nkongelo yechihande cha kaidi. <verse eid="EXO 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 36:18" />Akaheza kadamanya ndwana milongo mishano za shaba chani alunganye viya vihande vidi vya mapaziya, na ivyo kutenda paziya dimwenga dye dihema. <verse eid="EXO 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 36:19" />Akaheza kadamanya ngubiko ntuhu mbili, imwenga ya mkota uhuhile wa ndolome wa langi inkundu, mlanga mwakwe kadamanya ngubiko ntuhu ya mkota wa mbuzi. <verse eid="EXO 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 36:20" />Akaheza kadamanya fulemu za mbawo mjoholo za kuchimalisiza Idihema Dikukile. <verse eid="EXO 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 36:21" />Chila fulemu nendile ina utali wa futi mlongo na shano na wangalamu wa futi mbili na nusu. <verse eid="EXO 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 36:22" />Chila fulemu nendile ina mbulo mbili. Fulemu zose ze Dihema kazidamanyiza mbulo. <verse eid="EXO 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 36:23" />Fulemu ze Dihema kazidamanya vino, mbawo milongo midi ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi, <verse eid="EXO 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 36:24" />niyo adamanya vitako milongo mine vya feza vitende hasi heizo izifulemu milongo midi, na vitako vidi hasi ha chila fulemu chani kutoza izimbulo zakwe mbili. <verse eid="EXO 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 36:25" />Na ntendele ya kaidi ye Dihema, kugamba kuchenya kwe Dihema, kadamanya naho fulemu milongo midi, <verse eid="EXO 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 36:26" />na vitako vyakwe vya mayuwe ya feza milongo mine na vitako vidi hasi ha chila fulemu. <verse eid="EXO 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 36:27" />Ntendele ya kunyuma, kugamba uswelo wa zuwa we Idihema, kadamanya fulemu mtandatu. <verse eid="EXO 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 36:28" />Kadamanya seivyo fulemu mbili kwa chausa che zimpembe ze Dihema ntendele yakwe ya kunyuma. <verse eid="EXO 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 36:29" />Fulemu izo mbili nendile zilumana hasi kubula kulanga kwedidanga dya nkongo. Fulemu mbili izo kwachausa cha mpembe mbili nazidamanywa seivyo <verse eid="EXO 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 36:30" />Ivyo kwendaga na fulemu mnane na vitako vyakwe vidamanywe kwa mayuwe ya feza milongo mtandatu, na vitako vidi hasi ha chila fulemu. <verse eid="EXO 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 36:31" />Kadamanya naho misomo ya mjoholo, misomo mishano ntendele imwenga ye dihema, <verse eid="EXO 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 36:32" />misomo mishano kwachausa cha fulemu za ntendele ya kaidi yedihema na misomo mishano kwa chausa cha fulemu ye ntendele ya kunyuma ye dihema, ukusinya uswelo wa zuwa. <verse eid="EXO 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 36:33" />Kadamanya msomo wa hagati hedizengo dye dihema ntendele imwenga yedihema dihema kubula ntendele yakaidi ye Dihema. <verse eid="EXO 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 36:34" />Fulemu zose kazihaka zahabu, kazidamanya na madanga ya zahabu ya kutozeza imisomo iyo, misomo iyo nayo kaihaka zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 36:35" />Kadamanya paziya kwa chitambala chedi ching'aile chilukigwe vyumbe vidi vina mawawa vikwitangwa makelubi na kuhambwa kwa nyuzi za langi ya buluu na zambalau na inkundu. <verse eid="EXO 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 36:36" />Kadamanya nguzo nne za mjoholo, kazihaka zahabu na kuzijela madanga na kuzihaka zahabu nakuzikiya ndwana za zahabu. Kazidamanyiza vitako vine vya mayuwe ya feza. <verse eid="EXO 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 36:37" />Naho, kwachausa cho lwivi lwe Dihema kadamanya paziya kwa chitambala chedi ching'aile chihambigwe na kulukwa kwa nyuzi za langi ya buluu na zambalau na inkundu, idyo idipaziya dihambwa vitana, <verse eid="EXO 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 36:38" />idipaziya idyo kadamanya nguzo shano, mlanga mwakwe hamwenga nezindwana zakwe kazihaka zahabu, mna vitako vyakwe vishano nendile nivya shaba.<verse eid="EXO 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EXO 37" />
  <para style="s">Kudamanya Shanduku dye Dilagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 37:1" />Akaheza Bezaleli kadamanya shanduku dya Lagano dya mbawo za mjoholo, utali wakwe wendaga futi ntatu na inchi chenda, wangalamu futi ntatu na ichi chenda, chimo chakwe futi ntatu na inchi chenda. <verse eid="EXO 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 37:2" />Kadihaka zahabu yedi kundani na kuse, kadidamanyiza msilimbo wa zahabu ntendele zose. <verse eid="EXO 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 37:3" />Akaheza kadamanya madanga mane ya zahabu na kuyajela mwe zimpembe zakwe, chila mpembe danga dimwenga. <verse eid="EXO 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 37:4" />Kadamanya mitengo ya mti wa mjoholo wa kudinuila na kuihaka zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 37:5" />Mitengo iyo kaijisa mwe yadya amadanga mwe ntendele mbili ze dishanduku, kwa chausa cha kudinuila. <verse eid="EXO 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 37:6" />Kadamanya ngubiko ye dishanduku kwa zahabu yedi, ingubiko iyo yetangwa Hantu Hambazi, utali wakwe futi ntatu na inchi chenda, wangalamu wakwe futi mbili na inchi imwenga. <verse eid="EXO 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 37:7" />Niyo adamanya vyumbe vidi vina mawawa vikwitangwa makelubi, kwa kufula zahabu mo uhelo we ingubiko iyo, <verse eid="EXO 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 37:8" />kelubi dimwenga uhelo umwenga na idituhu uhelo umtuhu. Kadamanya makelubi maidi kouhelo yatenda chintu chimwenga ne ngubiko. <verse eid="EXO 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 37:9" />Vyumbe ivyo navikasinyana amawawa yawo yachuluswa kugubika ingubiko ye dishanduku. Nyuso zawo zikakaula ingubiko ye dishanduku.<verse eid="EXO 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bezaleli adamanya meza ya Migate ya malavyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 37:10" />Naho kadamanya meza ya mbawo za mti wa mjoholo, utali wakwe wendaga futi ntatu, wangalamu wakwe wendaga futi imwenga na nusu na chimo chakwe futi mbili na nchi ntatu. <verse eid="EXO 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 37:11" />Kaihaka zahabu yedi na kuidamanyiza msilimbo wa zahabu kuizunguluka ntendele zose. <verse eid="EXO 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 37:12" />Kazungulusiza lupapi luna wangalamu wa inchi ntatu, na kuchidamanyiza msilimbo wa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 37:13" />Kadamanya madanga mane ya zahabu na kuyajela mwe zimpembe zakwe nne mwamatengu yakwe. <verse eid="EXO 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 37:14" />Madanga ayo nayehaguhi na ludya ulupapi chani yatende hantu hakujeila idya imitengo yokuinuila imeza. <verse eid="EXO 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 37:15" />Kadamanya mitengo midi ya mjoholo ya kwinuila imeza nakuihaka zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 37:16" />Kadamanya viya vya zahabu yedi vya kuika mlanga mwe meza, sahani zakwe na vikombe vyakwe na bakuli za mazi ya divai.<verse eid="EXO 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chinya cha kwikiya taa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 37:17" />Naho, kasana chiya cha kwikiya taa kwa zahabu yedi. Chitako chakwe na mti wakwe nevikombe vyakwe na mafundo yakwe na maluwa yakwe vyose vitenda chintu chimwenga. <verse eid="EXO 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 37:18" />Matambi mtandatu yalaila mnkanda mwakwe, matambi matatu ntendele imwenga na matambi matatu ntendele ntuhu. <verse eid="EXO 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 37:19" />Mwe chila tambi kwendaga na vikombe vitatu mliganyo wa maluwa ya mlozi, chila chimwenga na fundo dyakwe na luwa dyakwe. <verse eid="EXO 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 37:20" />Momti mwendaga na vikombe vine mliganyo wa maluwa ya mlozi, hamwenga na mafundo yakwe na maluwa yakwe. <verse eid="EXO 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 37:21" />Chila hantu matambi maidi yahotele hendaga na fundo kutimilana na yadya matambi mtandatu yakuhota mwechiya chokwiya ita. <verse eid="EXO 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 37:22" />Mafundo ayo na matambi nendile ni chintu chimwenga ne chiya cho kwikiya ita chose chidamanywa kwa zahabu yedi. <verse eid="EXO 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 37:23" />Kadamanya taa zakwe mfungate, na kadamanya koleo dyakwe na visahani vyakwe kwa zahabu yedi. <verse eid="EXO 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 37:24" />Kadamanya ichiya cho kwikiya ita na viya vyakwe kwa chilo milongo mitatu na shano za zahabu yedi.<verse eid="EXO 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nchanja ya kuvunkiziza ubani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 37:25" />Bezaleli kadamanya nchanja ya kuvunkiziza ubani kwa mbawo za mjoholo. Nchanja iyo yendaga iligana ntendele zakwe zose, futi imwenga na nusu imwenga na nusu na chimo chakwe futi ntatu. Mahembe mwezimpembe ze nchanja iyo nendile ni chintu chimwenga ne nchanja yenye. <verse eid="EXO 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 37:26" />Yose kaihaka zahabu yedi, ntendele yakwe ya kulanga, ntendele zakwe za mwezimbavu na mpembe zakwe. Naho kaidamanyiziza msilimbo lwa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 37:27" />Kadamanya madanga maidi ya zahabu hasi ho msilimbo mwe zintendele mbili zikusinyana. Madanga ayo nayajeseza kutozeza imitengo yokuinuila. <verse eid="EXO 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 37:28" />Kadamanya mitengo ya mijoholo na kuihaka zahabu.<verse eid="EXO 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mavuta yakukile na Ubani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 37:29" />Kadamanya mavuta yakukile ya kuhaka, na ubani wedi una mhempe uhanganywe vyedi ni mmanyi ywa kudamanya vintu vikupwepweleka.<verse eid="EXO 37:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EXO 38" />
  <para style="s">Nchanja ya kokela malavyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 38:1" />Kadamanya nchanja kwa chausa cha malavyo ya kutikimya ya mbawo za mjoholo. Nchanja iyo yendaga ya iligana, futi mfungate na nusu kwa futi mfungate na nusu na chimo futi nne na nusu. <verse eid="EXO 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 38:2" />Kadamanya hembe mwe chila mpembe chani izi mpembe ze inchanja zitende ni chintu chimwe, na kaihaka zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 38:3" />Kadamanya naho viya vyose kwa chausa che nchanja, nyungu na mabakuli na machepe na ndoo ya kuhaila moto. Viya vyakwe vyose kavidamanya kwa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 38:4" />Kadamanya lwavu lwa shaba, na kulujela hasi holupapi lwe nchanja lubula hagati he nchanja. <verse eid="EXO 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 38:5" />Niyo adamanya madanga mane na kuyaika mwezimpembe zo lwavu ulo lwe shaba yatende hantu hakwingiziza imetengo yokuinuila. <verse eid="EXO 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 38:6" />Kadamanya mitengo ya mjoholo na kuihaka shaba. <verse eid="EXO 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 38:7" />Kaijele idya imitengo mwe yadya amadanga yendile mnkanda mwe nchanja chani wainuile. Nchanja iyo yadamanyagwa kwa mbawo nendile ina mpong'a hagati.<verse eid="EXO 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudamanya kalai kulu dya shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 38:8" />Akaheza kadamanya kalai kulu dya shaba na chitako cha shaba. Kadidamanya kwa vihande vya shaba vyendile vikajesezwa ni wavyele kwekawila saviya vyelole, vihande ivyo vilavigwa ni wavyele nawakasankana holwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile.<verse eid="EXO 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudamanya uwa we Dihema Dikukile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 38:9" />Akaheza kadidamanyiza Idihema Dikukile uwa. Mapaziya ya ntendele ya uswelo wa zuwa wo uwa yendaga yachitambala chedi ching'aile chilukigwe utali wakwe wendaga futi gana na milongo mishano, <verse eid="EXO 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 38:10" />ayo nayatozwa ni migalanguzo ya shaba milongo midi ina vitako milongo midi vya shaba. Mna ndwana zezinguzo izo ne zinkombosha zakwe zendaga za feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 38:11" />Ntendele ya chenya utali wakwe wendaga futi gana na milongo mishano, nkombosha zakwe milongo midi za shaba, mna ndwana zakwe nezinkombosha zendaga zidamanywa kwa feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 38:12" />Ntendele ya uswelo wa zuwa kwendaga na paziya dina utali wa futi milongo mfungate na mishano, na nkombosha zakwe mlongo umwenga na vitako vyakwe mlongo umwenga. Ndwana zakwe na sigi zakwe vyendaga vidamanywa kwa feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 38:13" />Ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa, kwendaga na lwivi, lwendile na wangalamu wa futi milongo mfungate na shano. <verse eid="EXO 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 38:14" />Paziya dya chila ntendele dyo lwivi dyendaga na wangalamu wa futi milongo midi na nusu, hamwenga na nguzo ntatu na vitako vyakwe vitatu. <verse eid="EXO 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 38:15" />Ntendele yakaidi naho kwendaga na paziya dina wangalamu wa futi milongo midi na nusu, hamwenga na nguzo ntatu na vitako vyakwe vitatu. <verse eid="EXO 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 38:16" />Mapaziya yose kuzunguluka uwa yendaga ya chitambala chedi ching'aile chilukigwe. <verse eid="EXO 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 38:17" />Vitako vyose vye zinguzo vyendaga vya shaba, mna ndwana ze zinguzo izo ne zinkombosha zakwe vyendaga vidamanywa kwa feza.<verse eid="EXO 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 38:18" />Paziya dyo lwivi lwo uwa dyadamanyagwa kwa chitambala chedi chinga'ile chidamanywe ni mmanyi adahile kuluka na kuhambwa kwa nyuzi langi ya buluu na zambalau na inkundu. Nadyo dyendaga na utali wa futi milongo mitatu na chimo chakwe futi mfungate na nusu, kuligana na mapazi yo uwa. <verse eid="EXO 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 38:19" />Naho nguzo zakwe zendaga nne, vitako vyakwe vine vyendaga vya shaba, ndwana zakwe zendaga zidamanywa kwa feza, uhelo wezinguzo nezinkombosha zendaga zidamanywa kwa feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 38:20" />Vijinji vyose vye Dihema Dikukile navyo uwa mnkanda mwe Dihema vyendaga vya shaba.<verse eid="EXO 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vihimo vye vimpandwa vijesezwe mwe Dihema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 38:21" />Luno ni ludongo lwa mayombe ye vimpandwa vidamanyizwe Idihema Dikukile umo mwikigwe vibawo vidi vye Sigilizi za Zumbe. Ludongo ulo lwikwa ni Walawi kwa lagizo dya Musa, ukachimailwa ni Itamali, mwana ywa mlavyantambiko Haluni. <verse eid="EXO 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 38:22" />Bazaleli ise ni Uli na babakwe ni Huli, ywa kabila dya Yuda, kadamanya chila chintu chiya Zumbe Chohile amlagize Musa. <verse eid="EXO 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 38:23" />Kambizwa ni Oholiabu mwana ywa Ahisamaki ywa kabila dya Dani, mmanyi ywa kusongola na kuhamba mahambo mwe suche inga'aile ilukigwe vyedi kwa nyuzi za ya langi ibuluu na zambalau na inkundu. <verse eid="EXO 38:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 38:24" />Zahabu yose wamlavize Zumbe kwa chausa cha uzesi we Dihema Dikukile yendaga na uzami wa chilo magana mnane milongo mfungate na mfungate na gilamu magana matatu kuligana na vihimo vye Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="EXO 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 38:25" />Feza wasangile awo wantu wawazigwe wendaga na uzami wa chilo magana milongo mitatu mlongo umwenga na mfungate hamwenga na gilamu magana mane kuligana ne vihimo vye Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="EXO 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 38:26" />Chila mntu awazigwe kukongela mihilimo milongo midi na kujinkanya kalavya nchangizo zakwe za feza gilamu shano. Wagosi wose wawazigwe wendaga magana milongo mtandatu na ntatu, magana mashano na milongo mishano. Chila mntu awazigwe kaungwa alihe ichihimo icho saviya vikigwe mwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="EXO 38:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 38:27" />Chilo magana milongo mitatu ya feza zadamanyizaga ivitako gana dimwenga vye Dihema Dikukile na diya idipaziya, nivyo kugamba chila chitako chadamanywagwa kwa chilo milongo mitatu. <verse eid="EXO 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 38:28" />Ziya izichilo mlongo na mfungate na gilamu milongo mfungate na shano zijeseza kudamanya ndwana ze zinguzo na kuzihaka mo uhelo we zinguzo nezinkombosha zakwe. <verse eid="EXO 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 38:29" />Shaba yose igalwe ni Waizulaeli kumlaviza Chohile yendaga na uzami wa chilo magana milongo midi gana dimwenga milongo midi na nne. <verse eid="EXO 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 38:30" />Bezaleli ajesezaga ishaba iyo kudamanya vitako vyo lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile na nchanja ya shaba hamwenga na lwavu lwakwe lwa shaba na viya vyose vye nchanja iyo, <verse eid="EXO 38:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 38:31" />vitako vya uwa uzunguluke Idihema Dikukile na vyo lwivi lwo uwa ne vijinji vyose vye Dihema Dikukile na vyo uwa uzunguluke ntendele zose.<verse eid="EXO 38:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EXO 39" />
  <para style="s">Kudamanya Suche za Walavyantambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 39:1" />Kwa kujeseza nyuzi za langi ya buluu na inkundu wadamanya suche zisumigwe vyedi za kusankanila Hantu Hakukile. Wamsumila Haluni suche na kuzikukiza saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 39:2" />Wadamanya suche yamwechifuwa kwa chitambala ching'aile kwa nyuzi za zahabu na nyuzi za langi ya buluu na zambalau na inkundu. <verse eid="EXO 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 39:3" />Wafula zahabu na kuikantakanta nyuzi sisili na kuziluka mwe suche yedi ing'aile chihambigwe gwe chifundi hamwenga nezinyuzi ze langi ibuluu na zambalau na inkundu. <verse eid="EXO 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 39:4" />Suche iyo ya mwechifuwa, yavalagwa kwa sigi mbili mlanga mwa mayega zisumilwe mwezimpembe zakwe mbili. <verse eid="EXO 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 39:5" />Msipi usumigwe chifundi mlanga mwakwe chani uchitalizize wendaga chintu chimwenga na kasuche kakugubika mwechifuwa, naudamanywa kwa vintu seivyo, zahabu na nyuzi ibuluu na zambalau na inkundu na suche inga'ile yedi chilukigwe saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 39:6" />Akaheza wasongola mayuwe ya yombe kulu yakwitangwa shohamu yajeligwe mwe vintu vya kutozeza vya zahabu vidolonywe saviya mntu akufamika hula, mazina mlongo na maidi ya wana wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="EXO 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 39:7" />Mayuwe ayo niyo wayaika mlanga mwa mayega ya chila kasuche kamwechifuwa katende lukumbusa lwa welekwa mlongo na waidi wa Izulaeli saviya Zumbe Chohile amlagize Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakwiji kamwechifuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 39:8" />Wamanyi wadamanya kakwiji kamwechifuwa saviya wadamanye kadya akasuche kamwechifuwa, kwa chitambala chedi chiinga'aile chihambigwe kwa zahabu na nyuzi za langi ibuluu na langi ya zambalau na inkundu. <verse eid="EXO 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 39:9" />Kakwiji ako kendaga kaligana ntendele zose naho nakakujwa, utali wakwe wendaga inchi chenda na wangalamu wakwe wendaga inchi chenda. <verse eid="EXO 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 39:10" />Kakwiji ako kahambagwa kwa misilimbo mine ya mayuwe ya yombe kulu, msilimbo wa nkongoa wendaga wa akiki na yakuti ya langi ya manjano na alimasi inkundu. <verse eid="EXO 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 39:11" />Msilimbo wa kaidi wendaga wa zumalidi na yakuti ibuluu na alimasi. <verse eid="EXO 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 39:12" />Msilimbo wa katatu wendaga wa yasinto na akiki inkundu na amasisito, <verse eid="EXO 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 39:13" />msilimbo wa kane wendaga wa zabalajadi na shohamu na yasipi. Yose yajelwa mwe vintu vya kutozeza vya zahabu, chila umwenga hantu hakwe. <verse eid="EXO 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 39:14" />Ivyo, kwendaga na mayuwe mlongo na maidi, na chila yuwe dimwenga diwandikwa zina dimwenga dya wana mlongo na waidi wa Yakobo. Chani kuchimaila hantu ha wana wa Waizulaeli. <verse eid="EXO 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 39:15" />Wadamanyaga mikufu ya zahabu yedi ilukigwe enga sigi kwachausa cha akakwiji ako kamwechifuwa. <verse eid="EXO 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 39:16" />Wadamanya vintu vidi vya kutozeza vya zahabu na madanga maidi ya zahabu, nakuyajela amadanga ayo mwe mpembe mbili za kulanga za akakwiji ako. <verse eid="EXO 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 39:17" />Niyo waijela imikufu iyo imidi ilukigwe ye zahabu mwamadanga ayo maidi ya kakwiji ako kamwechifuwa. <verse eid="EXO 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 39:18" />Uhelo we mikufu iyo imidi waitaliza mwe vintu vyo kutozeza vimlanga mwa mayega yakasuche kamwechifuwa ntendele ya kulongozi. <verse eid="EXO 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 39:19" />Ukaheza wadamanya madanga maidi ya zahabu, wayajela mwe zimpembe mbili za hasi ntendele ya mndani mwa akakwiji ako kamwechifuwa hajihi na kasuche kamwechifuwa. <verse eid="EXO 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 39:20" />Wadamanya madanga matuhu maidi ya zahabu na kuyajela kulongozi kwezimpembe za hasi ze vihande vya kasuche kamwechifuwa, hantu kakulungana na udya umsipi ulukigwe chimanyi. <verse eid="EXO 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 39:21" />Wataliza kakwiji kamwechifuwa mwa kasuche kamwechifuwa kwa kulunganya madanga yakwe na kasuche kamwechifuwa kwa luzigi lwa langi ya buluu, chani kakwiji ako kasekulegela mna kekaile udya uzipi ulukikwe chimanyi, saviya Zumbe Chohile amlagize Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Suche ntuhu za Chilavyantambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 39:22" />Kadamanya nkazu ya kuvala mndani mwa kasuche kamwechifuwa ka langi ya buluu. <verse eid="EXO 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 39:23" />Nkazu iyo yendaga na langa hagati dya kujisiza umtwi, disumilwe katambala chani disekutatuka. <verse eid="EXO 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 39:24" />Mwedipindo dya hasi dye inkazu niyo wasuma mahambo ya makomamanga ya langi ya buluu na zambalau na ikundu na nyuzi zing'aile zedi zilukigwe. <verse eid="EXO 39:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 39:25" />Wakaheza wadamanya mbuji za zahabu na chila hagati he makomamanga maidi wajela mbuji mwe dipindo dye nkazu. <verse eid="EXO 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 39:26" />Ivyo, mbuji na komamanga vitimilana kuzunguluka idipindo dye nkazu iyo chani ijeseze saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 39:27" />Wakaheza wawadamanyiza Haluni na wanawe shati ntali za chitambala chedi ching'aile, <verse eid="EXO 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 39:28" />kwa kujeseza suche yedi inga'aile waluka chilemba na nkofiya na putula, <verse eid="EXO 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 39:29" />iviya kwa kujeseza suche yedi ing'aile na nyuzi za langi ya buluu na zambalau na inkundu na wadamanya luzigi luhambigwe vyedi, saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 39:30" />Wakaheza wadamanya kabati ka zahabu yedi kwa chausa cha chilemba chikukile na kuwandika mlanga mwakwe saviya kudolonya hula, “Mkuka kwa Zumbe.” <verse eid="EXO 39:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 39:31" />Wakaheza wakataliza kulongozi kwechiya ichilemba kwa luzigi lwi buluu, saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubindilikila kwe Ndima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 39:32" />Ivyo, ndima yose ye Dihema Dikukile ibindilikila. Waizulaeli wadamanya yose saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 39:33" />Wamwigaila Musa Idihema Dikukile hamwenga na viya vyakwe vyose, nkombosha zakwe na fulemu zakwe na misomo yakwe na nguzo zakwe na vitako vyakwe, <verse eid="EXO 39:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 39:34" />na ngubiko zakwe mbili imwenga idamanywe kwa mkota wa ndolome ujeligwe langi inkundu, intuhu nayo idamanywa kwa mkota wa mbuzi na paziya dya Hantu Hakukile. <verse eid="EXO 39:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 39:35" />Shanduku dye Dilagano ne mitengo yakwe yo kudinuila hamwenga nengubiko yakwe ikwitangwa Hantu Hambazi <verse eid="EXO 39:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 39:36" />meza na viya vyakwe vyose na migate ikukile ilavigwe kwa Chohile, <verse eid="EXO 39:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 39:37" />chiya cha kwikiya ta cha zahabu yedi na ta zakwe, viya vyakwe vyose hamwenga na mavuta kwa chausa che izita izo, <verse eid="EXO 39:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 39:38" />nchanja ya zahabu na mavuta ya kuhaka na ubani una mhempe wedi, na paziya dyo lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile, <verse eid="EXO 39:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 39:39" />nchanja ya shaba na lwavu lwakwe lwa shaba, mitengo yakwe na viya vyakwe vyose na kalai kulu nechitako chakwe, <verse eid="EXO 39:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 39:40" />mapaziya youwa na nguzo zakwe na vitako vyakwe, na paziya dyo lwivi louwa, sigi zakwe na vijinji vyakwe, viya vyose vikungwa mwe ndima ye Dihema Dikukile, kugamba hema dyo mdugano, <verse eid="EXO 39:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 39:41" />na suche zose zilukigwe vyedi vitendese kwa chausa cha kusankanila Hantu Hakukile, kugamba suche zikukile za mlavyantambiko Haluni, na suche za wanawe kwa chausa cha ndima ya ulavyantambiko. <verse eid="EXO 39:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 39:42" />Waizulaeli wadamanya chila chintu saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 39:43" />Musa kakaula indima wadamanye, nakuwona kugamba wadamanya chila chintu saviya Zumbe alagize. Ivyo Musa amlombeza Chohile awajimbike.<verse eid="EXO 39:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EXO 40" />
  <para style="s">Kuchimalisa Idihema Dikukile na kudisenta kulongozi kwa Zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 40:1" />Zumbe kamgamba Musa, <verse eid="EXO 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 40:2" />“Mwe zuwa dya nkongo dyo mwezi wa nkongo, dichimalise Idihema Dikukule. <verse eid="EXO 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 40:3" />Mndani mwe Idihema idyo wike diya Idishanduku dye Dilagano, ukaheza ika paziya kulongozi kwakwe. <verse eid="EXO 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 40:4" />Ingiza meza na kwika viya vyakwe mlanga, naho ingiza ichiya chokwiya izita nakuchika mlanga mwakwe. <verse eid="EXO 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 40:5" />Nchanja ya zahabu ya kuvunkiziza ubani nawike kulongozi kwe Shanduku dye Dilagano, ukaheza tundika paziya mwo lwivi lwe Dihema Dikule. <verse eid="EXO 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 40:6" />Ika inchanja yokutikimiziza malavyo kulongozi ko lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="EXO 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 40:7" />Kalai kulu dyo kwesuntila dike hagati he Dihema Dikukile ne nchanja yo kutikimiziza malavyo na kudimemeza mazi. <verse eid="EXO 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 40:8" />Zungulusiza Idihema uwa na kutundika paziya ho lwivi lwakwe.”<verse eid="EXO 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 40:9" />“Ukaheza, disente Idihema kulongozi kwa Zumbe hamwenga ne viya vyakwe vyose kwa kuvihaka yadya mavuta yo kuhaka, nadyo naditende dikuka. <verse eid="EXO 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 40:10" />Ukaheza, waisenta kulongozi kwa Zumbe inchanja yokutikimiziza malavyo na viya vyakwe vyose kwa kuihaka mavuta, iyo naitende ikuka vitendese. <verse eid="EXO 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 40:11" />Kalai kulu dyo kwesuntila ne chitako chakwe navyo uvisente seivyo.”<verse eid="EXO 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 40:12" />“Mwitange Haluni na wanawe weze ko lwivi lwe Idihema Dikukile, ukaheza uwasunte kwa maji. <verse eid="EXO 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 40:13" />Mvise Haluni ziya izisuche zikukile. Mhake mavuta na kumsente kulongozi kwa Zumbe, chani adahe kunisankanila mwendima ya ulavyantambiko. <verse eid="EXO 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 40:14" />Wegale wanawe na kuwavisa ziya izishati izintali, <verse eid="EXO 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 40:15" />wahake mavuta saviya umhakile tati yawo, chani nawo wanisankanile mwendima yo ulavyantambiko. Ukuwahaka mavuta kwawo nakuwengize mwe ndima ya ulavyantambiko wa mazuwa yose mwe vyeleko vyawo vyose.”<verse eid="EXO 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 40:16" />Ivyo, Musa na wantu wakwe wadamanya jejeje malagizo yose alagize Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="EXO 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 40:17" />Mwe dizuwa dya nkongo dyo mwezi wa nkongo mwaka wakaidi wakaheza kukulawa Misili, Hema Dikukile dichimaliswa. <verse eid="EXO 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 40:18" />Umo Musa na wantu wakwe wendaga wakachimalisa Idihema, na kwika vitako vyakwe na kuchimalisa fulemu zakwe nakwika nkombosha na kulunganya izinguzo zakwe. <verse eid="EXO 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 40:19" />Wazumbula amapaziya nakudidigubika Idihema saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa. <verse eid="EXO 40:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 40:20" />Musa niyo aguha vibawo vidi vya mayuwe na kuvika mwe diya Idishanduku yde Dilagano. Kengiza idya imitengo yo kwinuila Idishanduku mwa madanga yakwe na kwika ingubiko ye Dishanduku ikwitangwa Hantu ha Mbazi. <verse eid="EXO 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 40:21" />Akaheza kadika diya Dishanduku dye Dilagano mndani mwe Dihema Dikukile na kutundika paziya, na kwa ivyo kadifisa Dishanduku dye Dilagano disekuwonwa ni wantu, saviya alagizwe ni Zumbe.<verse eid="EXO 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 40:22" />Waika imeza mndani mwe Dihema Dikukile, ntendele ya chenya na ntendele ya kuse kwe dipaziya, <verse eid="EXO 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 40:23" />mlanga mwe meza waika migate ilavigwe kwa Zumbe, saviya Zumbe alagize. <verse eid="EXO 40:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 40:24" />Kaika chiya cha kwikiya ta mndani mwe Dihema Dikukile, ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi, ikasinyana ne meza, <verse eid="EXO 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 40:25" />hadya, kulongozi kwa Zumbe, kakoleza izitaa zakwe, saviya alagizwe ni Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 40:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 40:26" />Waika idya idishanduku ye zahabu yo kuvunkiziza ubani mwe Dihema, kulongozi kwe dipaziya dikusenta Hantu Hakukile na Hantu Hakukise, <verse eid="EXO 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 40:27" />na kuvunkiza ubani una mhempe wedi mlanga mwakwe, saviya alagizwe ni Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 40:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 40:28" />Watundika idipaziya mwo lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile, <verse eid="EXO 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 40:29" />kulongozi ko lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile kaika nchanja ya malavyo ya kutikimya, kalaviza mlanga mwakwe malavyo ya kutikimya na malavyo ya uhule, saviya alagizwe ni Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 40:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 40:30" />Kaika kalai kulu dya kwesuntila mgatigati mwe Dihema Dikukile ne nchanja, na kujela mazi ya kwesuntila mndani mwakwe. <verse eid="EXO 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 40:31" />Musa na Haluni na wanawe wose wajeseze amazi ayo kwa kusuntila imikono yawo ne viga vyawo. <verse eid="EXO 40:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 40:32" />Chila nkanana wakengila mndani mwe Dihema Dikukile hegu wakabula haguhi naidya inchanja, wesunta, saviya Musa alagizwe ni Zumbe. <verse eid="EXO 40:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 40:33" />Akaheza Musa na wantu wakwe wadamanya uwa kuzunguluka Dihema Dikukile ne nchanja na kutungika paziya ko lwivi lwo uwa. Ivyo, Musa hamwenga na wantu wakwe wabindiliza indima yose.<verse eid="EXO 40:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ingu mlanga mwe Dihema Dikukile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 40:34" />Akaheza ingu dikung'ala digubika diya Idihema Dikukile, ung'azi mkulu wadigubika kulagisa kugamba Zumbe Chohile eyaho. <verse eid="EXO 40:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 40:35" />Kwachausa icho, Musa kadunduga kwingila mndani mwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="EXO 40:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 40:36" />Mwe zintambo zawo zose, Waizulaeli wadunduga kukonga ntambo kubula hadya idingu idyo dikenuka kulaila mwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="EXO 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 40:37" />Ivyo, uneva idingu idyo hadinenuke wowo hawakutamba. Wagoja kubula umo dikenuka. <verse eid="EXO 40:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 40:38" />Mwe zintambo zawo zose, Waizulaeli wadaha kudiwona idingu dya Zumbe mlanga mwe Dihema Dikukile chipindi cha nomsi na udya umoto ukaka kulaila mwedingu chipindi cha nechilo.<verse eid="EXO 40:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 40" />
</usx>